&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Mission Brief&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of the Ground Fluid Systems Team, you will be assisting the team in the design and project work around ground facilities used for launching rockets, testing rocket engines or other components of the launch vehicle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist engineers in a wide range of fluid system design tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare technical documentation such as Piping &amp;amp; Instrumentation Diagrams and hardware specification lists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and expand a catalog of parts used across our fluid system facilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create templates, documents, or calculation tools to support our internal engineering workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
