&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Participation Program:&lt;/strong&gt; Share in our success through our virtual company share program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy the days off to relax and recharge &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company pension plan:&lt;/strong&gt; Secure your future with our company pension plan, featuring a 20% employer contribution after the probation period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rental clothing with laundry service:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy hassle-free workwear with our convenient rental clothing and laundry service &amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your skills with an individual learning budget granted after the probation period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Childcare allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a childcare allowance for your non-school-age children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible mobility budget&lt;/strong&gt;: Travel your way with a choice between a fully financed Deutschlandticket, JobRad bicycle leasing, FINN JobAuto, or a fuel allowance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Disclaimer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW204159307 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW204159307 BCX0&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end Spectrum industrial delivery across Block 2 and Block 4, from raw material supply to launch-ready vehicle handover. Treat Mission Launch Operations as the internal customer and be accountable for delivering launch vehicles on time, every time, to the agreed cadence and acceptance criteria. Lead the Value Stream teams to cascade these commitments across functions and sites, securing an executable plan with VP Spectrum Production and other functional owners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Cascade cadence horizontally. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;With Operational Planning, work backwards from customer handover dates through launch-pad AIT, logistics, vehicle integration, engine test, manufacturing, suppliers and raw materials. Translate cadence into linked milestones, lead times, buffers and capacity requirements, with named owners and committed dates. Verify readiness at each handover and resolve gaps across the full flow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Own the customer commitment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Be the accountable industrial delivery interface to Mission Launch Operations. Agree vehicle delivery dates, launch cadence, configuration, readiness and handover criteria. Maintain a shared view of plan, target and forecast for every vehicle; communicate risks early, lead recovery and agree changes through authorised governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Lead the Block 2 and Block 4 teams. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Set objectives and hold Value Stream Leads accountable for delivery integration, readiness and recovery. Protect clear focus on current vehicle delivery and future product industrialisation, managing dependencies and configuration transitions between blocks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Drive critical-path recovery. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Identify constraints driving milestone deviations and secure sequenced recovery commitments from functional owners. Agree production and AIT interventions with VP Spectrum Production; verify their impact on delivery and escalate unresolved capacity, funding or priority conflicts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Lead industrial readiness and scale. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Integrate the roadmap to agreed Rate 20 and Rate 50 ambitions. With Production Engineering, Procurement, Quality and VP Spectrum Production, establish evidence of process capability, supplier readiness, capacity, tooling, skills and test availability. Track gaps, investment dependencies and readiness decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Connect development to industrial delivery. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Through the Block 4 Lead, align industrial milestones with the Programme Director and Chief Engineer. Integrate Spectrum Development Operations hardware commitments and Design for Manufacture feedback from Design and Production Engineering, using APQP as guidance. Subsystem Programme Managers own development and qualification campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;7&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end production system performance. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Own the Spectrum-wide value stream framework and Isar Production System performance from suppliers through launch operations. Set flow priorities and improvement outcomes. Partner with VP Spectrum Production on deployment within manufacturing and global AIT, supported by the Production System / CI Leader.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Improve flow and economics. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;With functional leaders and Finance, reduce queues, work in progress, rework, lead time and unit-cost drivers. Prioritise improvements by their effect on the whole value stream and verify sustained benefits without compromising HSE or acceptance requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Governance and decision rights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead the Spectrum delivery review against Mission Launch Operations commitments. Show vehicle handover and cadence adherence, plan versus forecast, critical path and recovery. Require functional commitments and verify recovery restores customer dates. Escalate unresolved trade-offs to VP Global Operations; retain visibility of baseline deviations when dates change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Director owns end-to-end industrial delivery integration and priorities through the Value Stream Leads. Functional leaders retain line management, resources and execution accountability. Agree cross-block allocations with VP Spectrum Production and maintain visibility of the approved baseline when forecasts change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Key working relationships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;9&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;VP Spectrum Production. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Owns production execution, teams, resources and operating capability through Production Execution, AIT, MD Sweden, Global HSE and operational CI. Agree manufacturing, Propulsion AIT, Launch Vehicle AIT and engine-test commitments, recovery actions and capacity interventions. Swedish regional employee management remains with MD Sweden.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;10&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Spectrum Development Operations. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Reports to VP Spectrum Production and delivers agreed prototype and development hardware and manufacturing feedback. The Block 4 Value Stream Lead integrates that work package into the overall industrial plan, including shared capacity and transition to production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;11&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Programme Directors and Chief Engineers. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Programme Directors own programme baselines; Chief Engineers retain technical authority. Align industrial plans, configuration transitions and readiness evidence with programme milestones. Engineering owns design decisions and technical disposition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Planning Procurement and Logistics. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Operational Planning owns detailed production and supply schedules; Procurement owns supplier commitments; Logistics owns transport execution. Value Stream Leads integrate these commitments and coordinate closure of end-to-end constraints.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Production Engineering Quality and CI. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Production Engineering owns process and tooling development and validation. Quality retains independent assurance and acceptance. Director Quality &amp;amp; CI owns business-wide improvement methodology and maturity assessment; production leaders own local improvement results, with CI coaching.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;14&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Mission Launch Operations and Enterprise Planning. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Mission Launch Operations is the internal customer for launch vehicles. Agree and review delivery, cadence and handover readiness; the Director remains accountable for end-to-end industrial delivery. Campaign command and launch authorisation remain with designated leaders. Provide customer demand, readiness and delivery implications to Enterprise Planning and SIOP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Senior leadership of end-to-end product delivery, value streams or industrialisation in space, aerospace or complex manufacturing, including development-to-production transitions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Proven ability to lead through a matrix, resolve cross-functional constraints and integrate planning, suppliers, manufacturing, AIT and launch or customer delivery.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Strong critical-path, capacity and financial judgement; practical experience deploying Lean and improving flow, quality, cost and delivery.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Practical AI capability is required: demonstrable use of AI and digital tools to improve departmental efficiency, analysis or reporting. Understands connected ERP, MES and PLM information, traceability and reliable data.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;singleLevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Relevant engineering or technical qualification, or equivalent experience; clear executive communication, sound judgement and ability to develop accountable leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Participation Program:&lt;/strong&gt; Share in our success through our virtual company share program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy the days off to relax and recharge &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company pension plan:&lt;/strong&gt; Secure your future with our company pension plan, featuring a 20% employer contribution after the probation period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public transport ticket:&lt;/strong&gt; Commute with ease using a fully financed Deutschlandticket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rental clothing with laundry service:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy hassle-free workwear with our convenient rental clothing and laundry service &amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your skills with an individual learning budget granted after the probation period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Childcare allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a childcare allowance for your non-school-age children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Disclaimer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metaview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We use Metaview to record interview audio so our team can review it later and stay focused during the conversation. We will record interviews only if you opt in. Please note that we will request your consent separately during the interview process. Participation is completely voluntary and will not affect your application in any way. For more information on how we process your personal data, please see our &lt;a id=&quot;menur28pu&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://deu01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fisaraerospace.com%2Fprivacy-policy&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cbritta.bonn%40ext.isaraerospace.com%7Cbf5a1173fd434834ab1c08dea5c061eb%7C50154d7ed4fe4770bb43bf09a927cc45%7C0%7C0%7C639130442882001477%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=l1vw27o02fEuCFAICyAHO91ObS%2FjnXDl5woYeGiSRek%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will be part of the Global Price &amp;amp; Discount Strategy Team, shaping pricing and discount strategy across our full global portfolio which includes our core brand, HelloFresh, as well as: Factor, GreenChef, EveryPlate, Chef&#39;s Plate, and Youfoodz. You will own the strategy and execution of our global roadmap for active customer &amp;amp; referral incentives, partnering closely with local market leadership, tech, marketing, and more which makes this a unique opportunity to combine analytical depth, strategic thinking, and cross-functional execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that this position is a 24-month fixed-term contract (with the aim of converting it to a permanent position afterwards).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Referral Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the conceptualization, execution, and optimization of our global referral incentive strategy, ensuring alignment with overall business goals and market conditions and translating strategy into tangible action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Loyalty Program &amp;amp; Retention Economics: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Lead incentive strategy and impact modeling to drive performance of our emerging loyalty program and churn prevention initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Testing &amp;amp; Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the full AB testing lifecycle from hypothesis generation and test setup to execution and post-test analysis to constantly refine our incentive models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify opportunities to improve current global strategies through deep-dive analysis, increasing customer lifetime value while balancing top and bottom-line growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with and influence senior leadership and global teams (e.g., Lifecycle Marketing, Product, Analytics) in setting strategy roadmaps and sharing recommendations that drive impactful decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playbook Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and refine best practices and playbooks to ensure a consistent, scalable approach to pricing and discount initiatives across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in Business/Management, Business Analytics, Economics or any related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6 years of professional experience in pricing strategy, consulting, analytics, or a subscription-based business model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and advanced command of Excel with the ability to translate complex data into actionable insights, additional SQL-knowledge is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience devising and measuring the effectiveness of discount strategies (including AB testing), with a proven track record from other data-rich business environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication skills including the ability to lead effective meetings and presentations with senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of end-to-end project ownership in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding attention to detail to ensure analysis accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient?&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1002&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The Group Marketing Controller is the primary finance interface for HelloFresh&#39;s global marketing function. The role exists to ensure marketing spend is planned accurately, closed correctly, and reported transparently — bridging the gap between marketing execution and the Group P&amp;amp;L.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Close &amp;amp; Accruals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the month-end close process for marketing cost lines across all markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and validate marketing accruals submitted by local finance teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve booking errors, misclassifications, or missing accruals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clean actuals in the income statement for all marketing line items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with SE Finance Controlling to improve and create transparency to the markets on marketing IC charges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Budget &amp;amp; Forecast Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consolidate and challenge market-level marketing budgets during planning cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead marketing Guidance creation for Business Plan cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the Group marketing budget with actuals vs. budget vs. forecast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag material variances early and escalate to marketing stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Reporting &amp;amp; Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Tech and local markets to improve and automate input quality of weekly reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce monthly marketing performance reports covering spend vs. budget, phasing, and key variance drivers (Leverage A.I. and Databricks Dashboards)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the CFO/board reporting pack with accurate marketing cost commentary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain performance reports for Global Marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Business Partnering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the day-to-day finance contact for the Global Marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Direct and Indirect spend for the Marketing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Process &amp;amp; Controls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and improve the end-to-end marketing close process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent cost treatment across markets (e.g. working vs. non-working spend, agency fees, media)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps in how marketing costs are captured and propose fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT SUCCESS LOOKS LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean marketing close every month — no material restatements or late accruals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholders can trust the marketing numbers without re-checking them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Variances are explained proactively, not reactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing controller processes are standardised across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT THE FUTURE LOOKS LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage marketing spend between markets by reviewing ROI, AOR and agreed upon KPI performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Centralised and automated marketing controlling at month-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT THIS ROLE IS NOT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not a marketing strategist — not expected to have opinions on campaign effectiveness or brand direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not a data analyst — analytical support comes from the Finance Systems team; this role translates outputs into financial conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not a local market controller — this role holds the Group view; local controllers own their market execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of experience in financial controlling, FP&amp;amp;A, or a similar finance business-partnering role, ideally with exposure to marketing or performance-marketing cost structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel/Google Sheets skills; comfort working with large datasets and BI/reporting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to explain financial variances clearly to non-finance stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running or supporting a month-end close process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating across multiple markets and currencies in a fast-paced, matrixed organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about how AI and automation can modernise financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;SLSQ427149&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;Databricks operates at the leading edge of the unified data, analytics and AI space. Our customers turn to us to lead the accelerated innovation their businesses need to gain first‑mover advantage in today’s ultra‑competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;As we continue our rapid expansion across Central Europe, we are looking for a creative, execution‑oriented Strategic Account Executive to join the team in Germany and maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks within the insurance vertical. Reporting to our Senior Director of Enterprise Sales, you will focus on building relationships and closing new business opportunities within one of Germany’s largest Reinsurers, based in Munich. You will be part of an account team supporting this highly strategic client. Leveraging your consultative sales experience in the Insurance/FSI vertical, you will help shape the data and AI strategy, identify and progress high-value opportunities, and deliver tangible business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;marker:text-quiet list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will take ownership of your flagship account, define a clear strategy, and relentlessly drive it to exceed revenue and consumption goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will turn that strategy into action, executing with urgency and discipline to consistently overachieve your targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will build boardroom‑level relationships, becoming the trusted advisor on all things data and AI for senior stakeholders up to and including C‑level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will uncover and shape new business, expanding use cases and driving deeper platform consumption across your account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will orchestrate the full Databricks ecosystem, mobilising internal teams to maximise impact and customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will demonstrate compelling value in every engagement, leading confident, insight‑led negotiations that take opportunities all the way to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;What we look for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;A proven record of exceeding revenue targets in complex enterprise sales environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;Recognised insurance domain expertise, applied to expanding strategic Insurance/FSI accounts in Germany through deep understanding of regulatory, risk, and compliance dynamics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;711&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;713&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;Proven success selling data, analytics, big data, AI, or other highly technical cloud software solutions through complex, multi-stakeholder, multi-year enterprise sales cycles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to identify high-impact data and AI use cases and engage key buying centres to expand Databricks’ footprint and strategic relevance within an organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;864&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of consumption-based, land-and-expand models, with the ability to drive sustained growth within a single strategic account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1015&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to create and shape demand, translating customer priorities into measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1130&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1132&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Disciplined use of sales methodologies such as MEDDPICC, account planning, Value Selling, or Command of the Message, combined with strong pipeline management and accurate forecasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1320&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;A track record of building executive-level champions and cross-functional account teams to execute against a defined account and territory strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1473&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Experience developing and executing partner strategies that extend reach, accelerate deal velocity, and support complex enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1623&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;Willing and able to travel to customer sites, company and industry events - regionally and internationally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Fluent in German and English, with the credibility to engage, challenge, and influence senior stakeholders up to C-level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
