&lt;h1&gt;Your Mission&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Industrial companies hold millions of spare parts, and many more are available from resellers, distributors, and the companies that build production lines. Your mission is to connect these worlds. You will build SPARETECH&#39;s supply network: the partners who sell parts to our customers and the partners who buy parts from them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will define how we work with resellers, distributors, and line builders, win them as partners, and turn these partnerships into new ways for manufacturers to find, buy, and sell the parts that keep their production running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you the opportunity to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a new channel from the ground up:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Shape SPARETECH&#39;s partnership strategy for resellers, distributors, and line builders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win strategic partners:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Lead partner acquisition from first conversation to signed agreement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design the deal:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Develop value propositions and commercial models that work for our partners and our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape what we build:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work with Product and Engineering to bring partner offerings into the SPARETECH platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create value in both directions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Help our customers buy the parts they need and sell the parts they no longer use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take real ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work closely with leadership in a role where your strategy and execution are visible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work remote-first:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work from within Germany as part of an international team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become a part of the team if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Have 6+ years of experience in business development, partnerships, channel management, or key account management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Know the industry:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Have worked in or with manufacturing, industrial distribution, automation, or OEM after-sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Have structured and negotiated commercial partnerships with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think and execute:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Can design a partnership approach from scratch and run it hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay persistent:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Enjoy long sales cycles and building trust over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speak fluently:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Are fluent in German and English (C1 or higher).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-yes company, where you can decide every day whether you work from home, at our Stuttgart or Munich office, or at any&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.designoffices.de/&quot;&gt;Design Office&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;in Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A permanent employment contract, 30 days of vacation, and the opportunity to participate in the company&#39;s success through our VSOP program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern hardware and the frame for a height-adjustable desk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual training budget of 1000 EURO for your professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In Germany: A subsidized&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jobrad.org/&quot;&gt;job bike&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to escape city traffic and a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qualitrain.net/&quot;&gt;Wellpass&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;gym membership to stay active&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To enjoy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/Corporate-identity-templates-2003b5c0fdd84c1d833435833aaea51a?pvs=21&quot;&gt;Corporate Benefits&lt;/a&gt;, including discounts on fashion, travel, and much more from various companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic start-up atmosphere and an international team in which new ideas, creative approaches, and cooperation at eye level are valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SPARETECH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SPARETECH&#39;s vision is to empower the zero-waste industrial sharing economy by enabling maintenance and procurement teams at manufacturing leaders like Bosch, Porsche, and Nestlé to reduce MRO spend and optimize inventory through accurate part information, internal transparency, and market visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve this, we have built, and continue to build, an AI-powered MRO software that connects all players in the spare parts ecosystem, from manufacturers and suppliers to the people working behind the machines. By facilitating the exchange of data, knowledge, and expertise, we create shared visibility that empowers smarter decisions, reduces waste, and drives seamless collaboration. This connected spare parts intelligence unlocks value that extends far beyond software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://www.thesaasnews.com/news/sparetech-raises-10-million-in-series-a&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1257119756&quot;&gt;Insight Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, SPARETECH is accelerating its growth with a strong focus on product innovation and team excellence. We take pride in our inclusive and collaborative culture, as well as our energetic and committed team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-36f618bc-2c80-80e7-a04a-001cc06a8d28 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Senior Data Analyst to lead data quality, maintenance, and data import processes while helping advance the organization’s analytics capability. You will take ownership of SPARETECH&#39;s heart—the Golden Layer—by acquiring, importing, and maintaining spare parts product data to increase its value. You will ensure data accuracy and integrity, design and lead reporting and analytics frameworks, and deliver actionable insights to support business decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you the opportunity to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the acquisition, import, and maintenance of product data in SPARETECH&#39;s proprietary database while ensuring accuracy and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough quality checks on incoming catalogues and ensure high database integrity by investigating and resolving reported product issues in collaboration with the Data and Partner Management teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively across teams to gather business requirements and lead the development of core data reporting and analytics that drive better decision-making throughout the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of Product Data Management and Data Acquisition topics, constantly seeking opportunities to improve and optimize our existing structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become a part of our team if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in data analysis, data management, or business intelligence roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing analytics functions or data capabilities within a growing organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing data quality checks and governance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and advanced Excel skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python or R for data analysis and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with relational databases, non-relational databases and Metabase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data processing techniques and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring junior analysts and promote a data-driven culture across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-yes company, where you can decide every day whether you work from home, at our Stuttgart or Munich office, or at any&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.designoffices.de/&quot;&gt;Design Office&lt;/a&gt; in Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A permanent employment contract, 30 days of vacation, and the opportunity to participate in the company&#39;s success through our VSOP program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern hardware and the frame for a height-adjustable desk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual training budget of 1000 EURO for your professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In Germany: A subsidized&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://www.jobrad.org/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id--1644864965&quot;&gt;job bike&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to escape city traffic and a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://qualitrain.net/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1677192227&quot;&gt;Wellpass&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; gym membership to stay active.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic start-up atmosphere and an international team in which new ideas, creative approaches, and cooperation at eye level are valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To enjoy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.corporate-benefits.de/&quot;&gt;Corporate Benefits&lt;/a&gt;, including discounts on fashion, travel, and much more from various companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SPARETECH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SPARETECH&#39;s vision is to empower the zero-waste industrial sharing economy by enabling maintenance and procurement teams at manufacturing leaders like Bosch, Porsche, and Nestlé to reduce MRO spend and optimize inventory through accurate part information, internal transparency, and market visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve this, we have built, and continue to build, an AI-powered MRO software that connects all players in the spare parts ecosystem, from manufacturers and suppliers to the people working behind the machines. By facilitating the exchange of data, knowledge, and expertise, we create shared visibility that empowers smarter decisions, reduces waste, and drives seamless collaboration. This connected spare parts intelligence unlocks value that extends far beyond software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://www.thesaasnews.com/news/sparetech-raises-10-million-in-series-a&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1257119756&quot;&gt;Insight Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, SPARETECH is accelerating its growth with a strong focus on product innovation and team excellence. We take pride in our inclusive and collaborative culture, as well as our energetic and committed team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;Your Mission&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the bridge between SPARETECH and the manufacturers whose data powers our platform. Your mission is to find, win, and maintain data partnerships that expand our catalog data, so industrial companies can find and identify the spare parts that keep their production running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Product and Engineering, you will turn strong manufacturer relationships into lasting data connections and make sure our most important customers find their most valuable parts covered on SPARETECH.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you the opportunity to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own our data partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Win new manufacturer and data partners and grow lasting relationships with existing ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive measurable impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Expand our catalog coverage so our largest customers find their most valuable parts on SPARETECH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape how we get data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work with Product and Engineering to move partners from catalog files toward direct API connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect partners and customers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Handle data requests and follow up on partner inquiries that support our commitments to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think strategically:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Decide where to focus your efforts and help build a partner approach that scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work remote-first:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work from within Germany as part of an international team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become a part of the team if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Have 3 to 5 years of experience in partner management, sales, business development, customer success, after-sales, or a comparable role at a large manufacturer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Know the shop floor:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Understand how a production site works from the inside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand automation technology:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Know the components manufacturers sell and how they work in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Communicate clearly and build lasting relationships with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Follow through:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work diligently and follow up reliably across several projects at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are technically competent:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You don&#39;t need to be an engineer, but you are confident discussing technical topics with manufacturers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speak fluently:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Are fluent in German and English (C1 or higher).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-yes company, where you can decide every day whether you work from home, at our Stuttgart or Munich office, or at any&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.designoffices.de/&quot;&gt;Design Office&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;in Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A permanent employment contract, 30 days of vacation, and the opportunity to participate in the company&#39;s success through our VSOP program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern hardware and the frame for a height-adjustable desk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual training budget of 1000 EURO for your professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In Germany: A subsidized&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jobrad.org/&quot;&gt;job bike&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to escape city traffic and a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qualitrain.net/&quot;&gt;Wellpass&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;gym membership to stay active&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To enjoy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/Corporate-identity-templates-2003b5c0fdd84c1d833435833aaea51a?pvs=21&quot;&gt;Corporate Benefits&lt;/a&gt;, including discounts on fashion, travel, and much more from various companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic start-up atmosphere and an international team in which new ideas, creative approaches, and cooperation at eye level are valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SPARETECH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SPARETECH&#39;s vision is to empower the zero-waste industrial sharing economy by enabling maintenance and procurement teams at manufacturing leaders like Bosch, Porsche, and Nestlé to reduce MRO spend and optimize inventory through accurate part information, internal transparency, and market visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve this, we have built, and continue to build, an AI-powered MRO software that connects all players in the spare parts ecosystem, from manufacturers and suppliers to the people working behind the machines. By facilitating the exchange of data, knowledge, and expertise, we create shared visibility that empowers smarter decisions, reduces waste, and drives seamless collaboration. This connected spare parts intelligence unlocks value that extends far beyond software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://www.thesaasnews.com/news/sparetech-raises-10-million-in-series-a&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1257119756&quot;&gt;Insight Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, SPARETECH is accelerating its growth with a strong focus on product innovation and team excellence. We take pride in our inclusive and collaborative culture, as well as our energetic and committed team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Territory Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; (TAE) is a key growth role within Everpure (formerly Pure Storage) Germany&#39;s Go-To-Market organisation. This position focuses on driving growth across all accounts not currently managed by an Account Executive, including the full install base, dormant accounts, and new inbound opportunities. TAEs are responsible for expanding Pure’s footprint, reigniting customer relationships, and capturing new business through a combination of direct engagement and partner collaboration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Territory Account Executive (TAE), you’ll play a pivotal role in bringing this vision to life - helping customers unlock the power of their data, modernise their infrastructure, and accelerate transformation. You’ll &lt;strong&gt;join our Commercial team in Germany&lt;/strong&gt;, with the autonomy to own a dynamic territory, driving growth across a broad set of customers, from re-engaging dormant relationships to winning new logos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Pure, you’ll join a culture built on curiosity, innovation, and integrity. We celebrate diverse perspectives, challenge convention, and empower our people to think big, take bold action, and make a measurable impact. This is your opportunity to grow your career with one of the most innovative technology companies in the world and to do work that truly changes how businesses use data to compete and win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Account Growth &amp;amp; Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute sales activities to generate revenue, manage a high-volume pipeline, and contribute to closing deals on a quarterly basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute Outreach &amp;amp; Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform consistent, high-activity prospecting to penetrate new accounts, reach decision-makers, and learn how to win new business effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Partner Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with Channel Partners and Partner Managers to align on customer engagement and utilise partner resources to advance opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reactivate Customer Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Focus on re-engaging dormant or inactive customers by discovering new business use cases and identifying potential refresh and expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Foundational Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and deliver proposals and business cases that clearly demonstrate the value of Pure&#39;s solutions, supported by internal experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain Sales Discipline:&lt;/strong&gt; Diligently manage sales technology (Salesforce), deliver accurate forecasts, and maintain strong time management to thrive in a fast-paced, team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Sales Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success in direct, full-lifecycle B2B technology sales with a consistent record of meeting or exceeding sales metrics (KPIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Drive &amp;amp; Motivation:&lt;/strong&gt; A high degree of self-motivation, strong time management skills, demonstrates initiative and the drive to learn quickly and succeed across both transactional and early-stage strategic sales motions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success working with both internal teams and channel partners to ensure seamless customer engagement and shared goal achievement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency with core sales technologies, including Salesforce and G Suite, and an ability to use data to prioritise daily activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong verbal and written communication skills suitable for engaging with business leaders and maintaining professional business relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilience &amp;amp; Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; A competitive, positive attitude combined with strong organisational and time management skills necessary to handle a dynamic, high-activity territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Business Level, written and spoken, German and English language skills required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior knowledge of the storage industry and familiarity with how data solutions drive business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel Sales Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of channel-led sales motions and experience collaborating effectively within the broader partner ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Training:&lt;/strong&gt; Completion of a structured B2B sales methodology training (e.g., Business Value Selling or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience using digital prospecting and engagement tools (e.g., Outreach, LinkedIn Sales Navigator) to accelerate the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Everpure Germany team and be part of a team that&#39;s redefining data storage. Apply now and unleash your potential!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-OFFICE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;Senior Forward Deployed Engineer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Deployed Software Engineer &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;On-Site:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Grafenwohr, Germany – &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVE TS/SCI Clearance required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Reports to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Echo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Direct reports:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; None. Delta’s provide performance feedback on other engineers and participate in company peer mentorship program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Travel:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; 0-10%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At PVM, we serve those who serve, as a Palantir ally for mission impact. We are a veteran-founded, Palantir Vanguard partner — and the only small business providing services in that tier. We help&amp;nbsp;our government partners tackle real problems in National Security, Readiness, and Space — not building shelfware.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job__description body&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE), you will build analytical dashboard features, support CI/CD pipeline tasks, and work within a structured agile environment alongside senior engineers and government stakeholders. You will operate in two-week sprint cycles, contributing to feature delivery from design through deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our organization, an FDE takes ownership of their work — building reliable features, writing meaningful code, and ensuring each sprint increment is production-ready.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver front-end analytical dashboard views using Foundry’s Workshop/Slate application layer under guidance from senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support CI/CD pipeline configuration tasks, including build scripts, automated tests, and environment promotion workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement metric definitions and data transformations aligned to the Foundry Ontology to ensure consistent data interpretation across dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clear technical documentation, including configuration notes, runbooks, and sprint artifacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in sprint planning, daily standups, sprint reviews, and demonstrations for government stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct testing and validation to confirm dashboards function correctly and data aligns with approved definitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify integration issues, surface blockers early, and collaborate with senior engineers to resolve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support defect resolution and incremental enhancements to maintain stable operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:540,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:270,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep expertise with Palantir Foundry Ontology Manager, Workshop, Actions, Pipeline Builder, and operational application development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python, TypeScript, or Java in cloud-based data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in government, defense, or classified environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently build features, test them, and deliver production-ready functionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in small, fast-moving technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:540,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:270,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;17&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience conducting ontology reviews, governance assessments, and platform architecture evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About PVM &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At PVM, we mean it when we say we value diversity. As a PVM team member, you will work with people from all different backgrounds that are passionate about the problems we solve for our customers and are focused on delivering value for our clients. Our culture encourages problem solving, leadership, and innovation, and creates an environment that will support your professional and personal growth. Here are a few highlights of the advantages of being a part of the PVM community:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for growth and advancement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition/Training reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer bonus program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote and on-site positions available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PVM delivers digital services that help government agencies unlock the power of their data for good and maximize the value of their technology investments. We design, develop, and deploy solutions to solve mission-critical problems. PVM is a black- and service-disabled veteran-owned small business and was founded by a retired Naval officer out of frustration with the status quo with one goal in mind: to help his fellow Shipmates solve the problems they were facing every day. Today, we continue to be driven by that same goal and are focused on taking on our clients’ missions as our own to make a difference in the communities we serve. PVM believes in equal opportunity employment. We won&#39;t discriminate against any employee or applicant based on race, gender, nationality, age, religion, disability, military status, or sexual orientation. As a company and as individuals, we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive and welcoming environment for our team, our family members, and our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-alert job-alert--margin&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;PVM, Inc. is an SBA 8(a)-certified, Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business and Palantir USG Vanguard Partner. PVM is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote opportunity and we would be interested in applications from the UK, Ireland, Sweden, Spain and Germany.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is building a native experimentation platform: a Grafana app that lets teams define A/B tests, connect them to feature flags and product telemetry, and get trustworthy, statistically sound answers about what their changes actually did.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It started as a hackathon project and is now used by Grafana engineering and product teams in our internal environment to run real experiments. The next step is to make it a first-class product: one we rely on every day internally and, over time, one we offer to Grafana Cloud customers alongside Frontend Observability, Session Replay and our other user-experience capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join the &lt;strong&gt;Product Analytics team&lt;/strong&gt;, a group of highly technical product analysts who help teams across Grafana understand how our products are used and run experiments on them. As the team&#39;s dedicated software engineer, you&#39;ll own the engineering of the experimentation app and have a lot of influence over where it goes. You&#39;ll partner closely with data scientists on the statistics, data engineers on event pipelines and the data warehouse, software engineers across Grafana on feature flags, Frontend Observability and the App Platform, and product stakeholders who rely on experiment results to make decisions. This is a hands-on engineering role that ships production code. It is not an analyst role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the product:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The experimentation app is built on the Grafana App Platform:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend:&lt;/strong&gt; a TypeScript and React app plugin using @grafana/ui, plus a custom datasource plugin that powers experiment statistics panels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend:&lt;/strong&gt; Go, built with the Grafana App SDK. Experiments are Kubernetes-style custom resources defined in CUE, with an operator, admission webhooks, and support for declarative, GitOps-style management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feature flags:&lt;/strong&gt; integration with &lt;strong&gt;OpenFeature&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;OpenFeature Remote Evaluation Protocol (OFREP)&lt;/strong&gt;, Grafana&#39;s multi-tenant feature toggle service, and an embedded GO Feature Flag evaluator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Statistics engine:&lt;/strong&gt; a Bayesian analysis engine (TypeScript, with a Go port) that produces a direction-aware verdict per metric, probability to be best, credible intervals, expected loss and sample-size recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt; experiment exposure and outcome events flow from product instrumentation through RudderStack into BigQuery, or from Grafana Faro into Loki, and are queried live through Grafana datasources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI:&lt;/strong&gt; experiment authoring assisted by &lt;strong&gt;Grafana Assistant&lt;/strong&gt;, which discovers relevant data and drafts the experiment configuration for a human to review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolve the experimentation app from internal tool to product.&lt;/strong&gt; Full ownership of features end to end across the React frontend and Go backend, from problem framing and design through rollout, measurement and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the experimentation experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop intuitive workflows for defining hypotheses, configuring experiments and metrics, managing their lifecycle, and exploring results. Make these experiences useful for product managers and analysts as well as engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make instrumentation easier to adopt and trust&lt;/strong&gt;. Evolve the experimentation SDK and its OpenFeature and Faro integrations. Help teams connect variant assignment, actual exposure, and outcome events with consistent identity and event contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect experiments to the rest of Grafana’s user-experience stack.&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate with Grafana Faro and Frontend Observability so flag exposures and outcomes are captured automatically, and link experiment results to Session Replay and critical user journeys so teams can see &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; a variant won, not only &lt;em&gt;that&lt;/em&gt; it won.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Harden the statistics and analysis path.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with our data analysts to extend the statistics engine, and make analysis scalable, cost-aware and correct. Examples include moving computation server-side, scheduled analysis, alerting on experiment health, and guardrails against misleading results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI where it genuinely helps.&lt;/strong&gt; Extend the Grafana Assistant integration for authoring, explaining and reporting on experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the engineering bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor teammates, including analysts who contribute code, through code review, pairing and design docs. Write the architecture decision records (ADRs), docs and demos that help other teams adopt experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own what you ship.&lt;/strong&gt; Take part in on-call for the services you build, and support the internal teams that run experiments on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest heavily in developer productivity. You can use modern AI coding assistants as part of your daily workflow (your choice of tools, within security guidelines), backed by a company-funded usage budget so you can iterate quickly without unnecessary friction. We encourage pragmatic AI-assisted development: faster prototyping, test generation, refactors, documentation, and incident follow-ups, always with strong code review and quality standards. You’ll also have access to the latest frontier models from OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes you a great fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We highly value people who are intellectually curious, default to transparency, have a strong bias towards action, and are kind and enjoy working as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong full-stack engineering experience.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve built and operated production web applications with TypeScript and React, and backend services in Go (or a similar language, with willingness to work in Go). You value maintainability, automated testing and secure development practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience building an in-house platform or integrating existing experimentation and A/B testing platform &lt;/strong&gt;(for example Statsig, Eppo, GrowthBook, Optimizely, LaunchDarkly experiments, or an in-house platform).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product and data intuition.&lt;/strong&gt; You care whether what you shipped actually moved the needle, and you’re comfortable working with event data, SQL and data warehouses such as BigQuery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve delivered complex projects with minimal supervision, broken them into short feedback loops (analyze, design, ship an MVP, learn, iterate), and helped teammates work more effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational responsibility.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve been on call, supported software in production, and know how to make systems observable and debuggable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic AI usage.&lt;/strong&gt; You use AI coding tools thoughtfully, validate their output, and share practices that improve the team’s speed &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication.&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain technical and statistical tradeoffs to engineers, analysts and product managers in a fully remote, asynchronous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with feature flags and OpenFeature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A working understanding of experiment statistics: Bayesian or frequentist testing, sample sizing, variance reduction, and common pitfalls such as peeking and sample ratio mismatch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes concepts: custom resources, operators, admission webhooks, GitOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building Grafana plugins or apps, or with the Grafana App SDK or Scenes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with frontend observability and product analytics tooling, such as Grafana Faro, RUM, session replay, RudderStack or Segment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open source contribution or maintainership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a user of Grafana, Prometheus, Loki or Tempo, whether at work or on a homelab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Germany, the base compensation range for this role is €&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;100,000 - €125,000&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
