&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fondée en 2014, Artefact est une société française de services autour de la data, spécialisée dans le conseil en IA, transformation data et en data &amp;amp; digital marketing. L’approche unique d’Artefact, qui fait le pont entre la donnée et le business, permet à nos clients d’atteindre leurs objectifs business de façon dédiée et efficace. Nos 2500 collaborateurs répartis dans 27 bureaux à travers le monde allient leurs compétences pluridisciplinaires au profit de l’innovation business des entreprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La mission des Artefactors ? Transformer la data de nos clients en impact business. Dans ce sens, nous collaborons avec plus de 1000 clients, leaders de leurs industries (Orange, Carrefour, Samsung, AccorHotels, L’Oréal, LVMH, Decathlon) et sommes partenaires privilégiés de Google (GMP/GCP), AWS ainsi que Microsoft Azure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;929&quot; data-end=&quot;1135&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En tant que stagiaire Data Analyst,&lt;/strong&gt; tu seras intégré(e) à une équipe travaillant étroitement avec des consultants / data scientists et tu participeras à des missions ayant un impact réel pour les clients. Tes missions pourront inclure :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;2064&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;Collecter, nettoyer, préparer les données à partir de sources diverses (bases de données internes, API, logs, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;Explorer et analyser les données pour identifier tendances, anomalies, corrélations, patterns utiles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1364&quot; data-end=&quot;1570&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1366&quot; data-end=&quot;1570&quot;&gt;Participer à la conception et réalisation de dashboards / reportings sous outils de data visualisation (ex. Tableau, PowerBI, ou outils internes) pour présenter les résultats aux équipes ou aux clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1571&quot; data-end=&quot;1647&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1573&quot; data-end=&quot;1647&quot;&gt;Contribuer à la définition de KPI pertinents selon les objectifs métier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1648&quot; data-end=&quot;1818&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1650&quot; data-end=&quot;1818&quot;&gt;Travailler en collaboration avec les équipes métier (marketing, produit, etc.) pour bien comprendre leurs besoins et transformer ces besoins en analyses exploitables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1895&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1821&quot; data-end=&quot;1895&quot;&gt;Aider à automatiser certains processus de reporting ou analyses simples.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1896&quot; data-end=&quot;2064&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1898&quot; data-end=&quot;2064&quot;&gt;Documenter tes travaux, partager les résultats et les apprentissages au sein de l’équipe, proposer des améliorations ou de nouvelles approches quand c’est possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2111&quot; data-end=&quot;2304&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2111&quot; data-end=&quot;2304&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Étudiant(e) en dernière année de cycle ingénieur, Master 2, ou équivalent, avec une spécialisation en Data, Intelligence Artificielle, Mathématiques appliquées, Statistiques ou Informatique et recherche un stage de fin d&#39;études à partir de Janvier 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2337&quot; data-end=&quot;2892&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2337&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2339&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;Maîtrise de &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2351&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; pour extraire / manipuler les données.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2400&quot; data-end=&quot;2523&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2402&quot; data-end=&quot;2523&quot;&gt;Connaissances en langage de programmation pour l’analyse de données, typiquement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2483&quot; data-end=&quot;2493&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; (avec pandas, numpy, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2524&quot; data-end=&quot;2646&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2526&quot; data-end=&quot;2646&quot;&gt;Bonne compréhension des principes statistiques de base (moyennes, distributions, tests, corrélations, variance, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2647&quot; data-end=&quot;2740&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2649&quot; data-end=&quot;2740&quot;&gt;Capacité à créer des visualisations / dashboards (Tableau, PowerBI, ou outil équivalent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2741&quot; data-end=&quot;2892&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2743&quot; data-end=&quot;2892&quot;&gt;Connaissance minimale de l’écosystème numérique et data (web analytics, datalake, dataviz, etc.) est un plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2894&quot; data-end=&quot;2940&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2894&quot; data-end=&quot;2938&quot;&gt;Compétences personnelles / soft skills :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2941&quot; data-end=&quot;3489&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2941&quot; data-end=&quot;2991&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2943&quot; data-end=&quot;2991&quot;&gt;Esprit logique et analytique, souci du détail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2992&quot; data-end=&quot;3088&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2994&quot; data-end=&quot;3088&quot;&gt;Sens de la communication orale et écrite : savoir expliquer ses résultats à des non-experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3089&quot; data-end=&quot;3171&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3091&quot; data-end=&quot;3171&quot;&gt;Capacité à travailler en équipe, à écouter et à comprendre les besoins métier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3172&quot; data-end=&quot;3260&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3174&quot; data-end=&quot;3260&quot;&gt;Proactivité, curiosité, et capacité à proposer des idées ou des approches nouvelles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3261&quot; data-end=&quot;3328&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3263&quot; data-end=&quot;3328&quot;&gt;Autonomie, tout en étant à l’aise avec le suivi et les retours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3329&quot; data-end=&quot;3489&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3331&quot; data-end=&quot;3489&quot;&gt;Bon niveau en français (oral et écrit) ; l’anglais professionnel est un plus, notamment pour échanges ou documentations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un stage de &lt;strong&gt;6 mois&lt;/strong&gt; basé à &lt;strong&gt;Paris&lt;/strong&gt; dans le 9ème arrondissement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un accompagnement par un tuteur expérimenté et l&#39;opportunité de travailler avec des équipes reconnues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La possibilité d&#39;être embauché(e) en CDI à l&#39;issue du stage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Socle de formation (training day, Retex, café tech) développement des compétences via des outils internes innovants&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prêt à rejoindre l&#39;aventure ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu te reconnais dans cette description et que tu souhaites mettre tes compétences au service de projets concrets et impactants, envoie-nous ta candidature !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quels que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fondée en 2014, Artefact est une société française de services autour de la data, spécialisée dans le conseil en IA, transformation data et en data &amp;amp; digital marketing. L’approche unique d’Artefact, qui fait le pont entre la donnée et le business, permet à nos clients d’atteindre leurs objectifs business de façon dédiée et efficace. Nos 2500 collaborateurs répartis dans 27 bureaux à travers le monde allient leurs compétences pluridisciplinaires au profit de l’innovation business des entreprises.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La mission des Artefactors ?&lt;/strong&gt; Transformer la data de nos clients en impact business. Dans ce sens, nous collaborons avec plus de 1000 clients, leaders de leurs industries (Orange, Carrefour, Samsung, AccorHotels, L’Oréal, LVMH, Decathlon) et sommes partenaires privilégiés de Google (GMP/GCP), AWS ainsi que Microsoft Azure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En tant que stagiaire Data Scientist, tu seras responsable de :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La réalisation de projets de données (sécurisation de la livraison de vos projets)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La communication de ton travail et réalisations au sein de l’équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler en étroite collaboration avec ton homologue conseil pour établir et entretenir des relations solides avec vos clients et mieux comprendre leurs besoins&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;S’assurer que tes solutions apportent des valeurs à la problématique client&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rechercher et développer de nouvelles approches techniques pour résoudre efficacement les problèmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partager les bonnes pratiques et contribuer aux connaissances institutionnelles d’Artefact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Tu es ?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;310&quot;&gt;Tu es étudiant(e) en dernière année de cycle ingénieur, Master 2, ou équivalent, avec une spécialisation en &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;342&quot;&gt;Data Science, Intelligence Artificielle, Mathématiques appliquées, Statistiques ou Informatique.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;441&quot;&gt;Tu es à la recherche d&#39;un stage de fin d&#39;études de 6 mois à partir de janvier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;523&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;2027&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;537&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu possèdes une bonne compréhension de l&#39;écosystème numérique et data et de ses technologies : web analytique, programmatique, DMP, Datalake, dataviz, data science, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as un fort intérêt pour les problématiques business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as un esprit pratique et analytique, et possèdes d’excellentes compétences en résolution de problèmes, y compris la capacité de désagréger les problèmes, d’identifier les causes profondes et de recommander des solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise du français (écrit/oral) obligatoire pour le bureau de Paris pour travailler en équipe et de l’anglais professionnel pour communiquer avec nos clients internationaux&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le petit +&lt;/strong&gt; : une première expérience (stage, projet scolaire, Junior Entreprise, etc.) en conseil et/ou écosystème de données est une valeur ajoutée !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement professionnel&lt;/strong&gt; : CDI à la clé (85% de conversion) ; socle de formation (onboarding, retex, café tech, deep dive de use cases tech...) développement des compétences via des outils internes innovants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement personnel &lt;/strong&gt;: collaborez avec les experts dans leur domaine, tu apprendras des meilleurs ; feedbacks réguliers via counsellor, managers, équipes et RH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environnement de travail unique &lt;/strong&gt;: flexibilité télétravail; évènements d’équipe et d’entreprise ; localisation idéale dans le 9ème arrondissement !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Socle de formation&lt;/strong&gt; (training day, Retex, café tech) développement des compétences via des outils internes innovants&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quelles que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rejoignez-nous !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Artefact est un cabinet de conseil international spécialisé en Data et Intelligence Artificielle, présent dans plus de 20 pays avec plus de 2 500 collaborateurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous accompagnons nos clients dans leur transformation en combinant expertise technologique, conseil et connaissance métier, sur des enjeux allant de la stratégie Data &amp;amp; IA à la conception et au déploiement de solutions concrètes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nos équipes réunissent notamment des Business Consultants, Data Analysts, Data Scientists et Data Engineers, qui interviennent auprès de grands groupes internationaux dans des secteurs variés.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre ambition : mettre la Data et l’IA au service de problématiques business concrètes et créer un impact mesurable pour nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton rôle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Au sein de l’équipe Talent Acquisition France et sous la responsabilité de la Head of Talent Acquisition, tu pilotes en autonomie le recrutement des équipes Strat Data d’Artefact, sur des profils allant de Junior à Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partenaire des équipes opérationnelles, tu les accompagnes tout au long du processus afin de garantir des recrutements de qualité et une expérience candidat exigeante :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Piloter les recrutements de bout en bout&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recueillir et challenger les besoins auprès des managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et mettre en œuvre l’approche de recrutement adaptée à chaque besoin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter l’ensemble du processus : sourcing, qualification, entretiens RH, coordination des étapes d’évaluation et offre&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer une approche proactive du sourcing et constituer des viviers de profils pertinents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accompagner les équipes opérationnelles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conseiller et challenger les managers tout au long du processus afin de garantir des décisions de recrutement objectives et cohérentes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantir la bonne application du processus et des méthodes d’évaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Veiller à une expérience de recrutement de qualité pour les candidatures et les équipes internes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribuer à l’amélioration continue&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier les points de friction et contribuer à l’amélioration des processus et pratiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Veiller à la qualité et à la fiabilité des données dans notre ATS (Greenhouse)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer aux projets et initiatives de l’équipe Talent Acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience confirmée en recrutement, idéalement dans le conseil/ ESN&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une maîtrise du recrutement de bout en bout, avec une solide pratique du sourcing et de l’approche directe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une capacité à gérer et prioriser un périmètre de recrutement en autonomie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une posture de business partner, avec la capacité de conseiller et challenger&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une bonne maîtrise des outils de recrutement et un bon niveau d’anglais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération : &lt;/strong&gt;jusqu’à 44K annuel selon profil.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formations continues et participation à des projets stratégiques d&#39;acquisition et de fidélisation des talents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Équipe dynamique, flexibilité télétravail, séminaires d&#39;équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Localisation Paris 9ème&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étapes du recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec Mélody, Head of Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec Laurie, DRH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte, notamment de croyances, de genre, d’âge, de situation d&#39;handicap, d’origine ethnique, d’orientation sexuelle, d’appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Remote, occasionally Zurich · 80–100% · Start as soon as possible ·&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Xebia&lt;/strong&gt; pushes the boundaries of what’s possible – and you’re right in the middle of it! We’re not just consultants, but visionaries: with more than 5,000 experts worldwide, we help our clients drive their digital transformation with passion and ambition. At Xebia, it’s about more than recommendations: with innovative solutions, we create a unique combination of technology, people and processes. Our goal is to make our clients digital frontrunners – ready to turn media usage data into insights that make a difference?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our client, a large Swiss media company, is building a new platform on Azure Databricks for the usage data of its apps and websites. It will replace the commercial analytics tool they use today. Analysts are starting to work on the new platform now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You join the platform team of five developers through Xebia. Most of your time goes into implementing Jira tickets. You build and run the pipelines that take event data from Azure Event Hubs through the bronze, silver and gold layers into the tables analysts and dashboards use. You keep the Databricks and Azure infrastructure in code with Pulumi and ship changes through GitHub Actions. The team creates and refines tickets together and reviews each other&#39;s code. You&#39;ll also help analysts get started with Databricks and GitHub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the senior person in the team, you can advise on anything from implementation details to the overall architecture, while the product owner sets the priorities. Today the role also covers the data model, the infrastructure and the platform costs, and there is room to take on more responsibility over time. The team uses AI coding assistants such as Claude in its daily work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Several years of hands-on data engineering on Databricks: building and running production pipelines with Spark, PySpark or SQL and Delta Lake, in a medallion architecture&lt;br&gt;• Architecture experience on a Databricks or Azure data platform&lt;br&gt;• Streaming or event ingestion, ideally Azure Event Hubs or Kafka&lt;br&gt;• Data modelling for analytics and BI&lt;br&gt;• Infrastructure as code, ideally Pulumi (Terraform experience transfers)&lt;br&gt;• Git, GitHub workflows and CI/CD with GitHub Actions&lt;br&gt;• Experience in larger projects&lt;br&gt;• You work well in a team and get productive with little onboarding&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable using AI coding assistants&lt;br&gt;• Fluent English&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Unity Catalog, Databricks Asset Bundles, data quality frameworks&lt;br&gt;• Dashboards in Databricks or Power BI&lt;br&gt;• Azure experience beyond Databricks&lt;br&gt;• Web and app usage tracking or digital analytics, including tracking migrations&lt;br&gt;• Media or broadcasting experience&lt;br&gt;• German&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The current engineer can hand over until the end of January. English is the working language; German is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes us special&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;Innovation potential:&lt;/strong&gt; At Xebia, the focus is on innovation and pioneering spirit. You can develop your creative ideas and share innovative thoughts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Personal growth:&lt;/strong&gt; We believe in personal development for outstanding professional experiences. Unlock your potential and keep growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Community and networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Xebia is a community of technology enthusiasts. Meet professionals from different fields, share knowledge and shape innovation together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚖️ &lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We value work-life balance. Adapt your working hours and find a balance between your career and your personal life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎉 &lt;strong&gt;Great social events:&lt;/strong&gt; Ski days, B2run, spontaneous after-work apéros, Christmas and summer parties – we celebrate together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to take your professional journey further, we warmly welcome you to Xebia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to meeting you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Electra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Air travel is about to become something more: more direct, more accessible, and more connected to the places where people live, work and want to be. Every day in the U.S., people make 35 million trips of 50–500 miles, stuck in traffic or routed through crowded hubs. Chances are, you&#39;ve been one of them. At Electra, we&#39;re changing that with the EL9, a nine-passenger, hybrid-electric aircraft that takes off and lands in just 150 feet. Our Ultra Short technology opens up thousands of new places to fly, beyond conventional runways, congested airports and long drives. We&#39;re backed by Lockheed Martin, Honeywell and Safran. Operators worldwide have signed intent-to-purchase agreements for the first 2,200 aircraft we produce, and we&#39;re moving toward first test flights in 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Getting a new kind of aircraft airborne takes more than ambition. It takes our kind of bold: people who think big while working in the real world. Who move ideas into action and collaborate without silos. Who put people first and make room at the table for everyone. Who challenge one another without diminishing one another.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Sound like you? Then look beyond what you thought were your own limits, and help us take flight beyond runways.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Electra seeks an experienced Program Manager to lead the planning and execution of a European tour for Electra&#39;s EL2 technology demonstrator aircraft. This role will serve as the primary team lead for the EL2 program, partnering closely with engineering, flight test, government and commercial stakeholders, and company leadership to ensure the tour achieves its strategic objectives safely, on schedule, and within budget. &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;After the completion of the European tour this role will transition to supporting EL9. &amp;nbsp;The exact nature of this support will depend on the candidates specific skills and interest areas; likely options include test team program management, program office support, or leading teams executing government contract&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tour Planning and Strategy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop a master schedule, budget, and resourcing plan for the tour, including aircraft transport/ferry logistics, ground support, and personnel deployment to meet the overall mission objectives and success critera.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Sales, Business Development, and Government Affairs to prioritization of target locations, stakeholders, and events (e.g., customer demonstrations, government engagements, airshows) across the tour itinerary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-Functional Coordination&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Flight Test and Engineering teams to ensure the aircraft, crew, and support equipment are mission-ready for each tour stop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with Legal, Regulatory, and International Trade/Export Control functions to secure necessary permissions, airspace access, and customs clearances for international operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Serve as the central point of coordination between internal teams and external partners, hosts, and government counterparts at each location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage vendor and logistics partners supporting ground operations, transport, and lodging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Risk Management and Execution&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify, track, and mitigate risks related to schedule, safety, logistics, weather, and geopolitical factors across tour locations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop contingency plans for schedule disruptions, maintenance needs, or changes in stop-level objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor tour execution in real time and adjust plans as needed to maintain safety and achieve strategic goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain clear documentation and traceability of decisions, approvals, and changes throughout the tour&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reporting and Communication&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide regular status updates to program and executive leadership on tour progress, risks, and outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Capture and communicate lessons learned and stakeholder feedback from each tour stop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support internal and external communications/marketing efforts related to the tour&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver a post-tour summary with key outcomes, metrics, and recommendations for future campaigns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Business, or related field, or equivalent experience (advanced degree a plus)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;US Persons required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;8+ years in program or project management, ideally within aerospace, defense, or a related complex technical industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record managing complex, multi-stakeholder programs with tight schedules and significant logistical coordination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with international operations, export control considerations, and cross-border logistics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong organizational and risk management skills, with the ability to adapt plans quickly in dynamic environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to work cross-functionally with engineering, flight test, legal, and business teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, including experience engaging with government and/or customer audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Willingness and ability to travel internationally, potentially for extended periods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting flight test campaigns, demonstration tours, or airshow operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with European aviation regulatory environments and airspace coordination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with government or defense customers internationally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prior experience with aircraft ferry/transport logistics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance; STD, LTD, and life insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, sick leave, and company holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Paid winter break&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;401(k) with immediate vesting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Free catered lunches, coffee, snacks, and drinks at our Manassas headquarters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Free on-site parking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Electra is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. This position may be subject to ITAR requirements.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗠𝗮𝗸𝗲𝘀 𝗖𝗹𝗼𝘂𝗱𝗯𝗲𝗱𝘀 𝗨𝗻𝗶𝗾𝘂𝗲&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudbeds.com/&quot;&gt;Cloudbeds&lt;/a&gt;, we&#39;re not just building software, we&#39;re transforming hospitality. Our platform powers hotels across 150 countries, processing billions in bookings annually. From boutique properties to large hotel groups, we help hoteliers transform operations and uplevel their commercial strategy through a unified platform that integrates with hundreds of partners. And we do it with a completely remote team. Imagine working alongside global innovators to build AI-powered solutions that solve hoteliers&#39; biggest challenges. Since our founding in 2012, we&#39;ve continually been recognized for excellence, most recently earning top honors at the 2026 HotelTechAwards for Best Hotel Management Software and landing on Deloitte&#39;s Technology Fast 500 again, but we&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗟𝗼𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗛𝗼𝘄 𝗬𝗼𝘂&#39;𝗹𝗹 𝗠𝗮𝗸𝗲 𝗮𝗻 𝗜𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗰𝘁:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an 𝗔𝗰𝗰𝗼𝘂𝗻𝘁 𝗠𝗮𝗻𝗮𝗴𝗲𝗿, you will be part of the Customer Success team. AMs will be expected to actively manage a portfolio of customers with an estimated value of $500,000 - $1,000,000 USD with the goal of building strong customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AM Team is responsible for identifying upsell opportunities for ACV expansion and minimizing customer churn. AMs will act as the first point of contact for all things related to Cloudbeds. They are responsible for guiding clients through their customer journey while providing recommendations on how to best improve their business in order to achieve success. As an AM you will make the motto &quot;more reservations, happier guests&quot; a reality by providing strategic guidance to our customers around the world and helping them achieve their &quot;Success Outcomes.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗬𝗼𝘂 𝗕𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝘁𝗼 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗧𝗲𝗮𝗺:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the customer&#39;s &quot;success outcomes&quot; and work with them to achieve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main point of contact for all things related to Cloudbeds and help escalate urgent support tickets, amongst other things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve net dollar retention goals through identifying upsell opportunities and implementing proactive churn reduction strategies in order to help Cloudbeds obtain net negative churn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a consultative approach to drive product engagement, customer &quot;stickiness&quot;, and package growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze customer data to improve customer utilization and engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage customer escalations related to the strategic use of Cloudbeds software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek to promote the value of the product and identify new opportunities to upsell additional services and products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review customer complaints and concerns and seek to improve all aspects of the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a detailed understanding of products and services, assist customers with questions, and suggest the best products for their needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather client feedback and requirements for future releases of the software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use training materials to keep up-to-date with the latest system updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a &quot;strategic partner&quot; to assigned portfolio of customers, utilizing hospitality industry knowledge to provide insight and recommendations to optimize product performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the hospitality industry - continuously staying updated on industry trends, strategies, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗦𝗲𝘁𝘀 𝗬𝗼𝘂 𝗨𝗽 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗦𝘂𝗰𝗰𝗲𝘀𝘀:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional ability to communicate and foster positive business relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of customers&#39; concerns and thoughts regarding the use of products, and the ability to troubleshoot as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to communicate, present, and influence credibly and effectively at all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to clearly communicate &amp;amp; synthesize customer details (needs, feedback, concerns, opportunities, etc.) internally to multiple departments (Sales, Support, Product, Marketing, Design).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple projects at a time while paying strict attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent listening, negotiation, and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and able to thrive in a results-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural relationship builder with integrity, reliability, and maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in hyper-growth work environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time and project management skills; always looking to improve inefficient processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing accounts within the European hospitality market is a significant plus, given the concentration of customers in this region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both English and German is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#LI-PC1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗼𝗿𝗸 𝗔𝘂𝘁𝗵𝗼𝗿𝗶𝘇𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻: Please note that applicants must be currently authorized to work in the location where the position is located without requiring visa sponsorship. At this time, Cloudbeds is unable to provide sponsorship for work visas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝘁𝗼 𝗘𝘅𝗽𝗲𝗰𝘁 - 𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗝𝗼𝘂𝗿𝗻𝗲𝘆 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗨𝘀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behind Cloudbeds&#39; revolutionary technology is a team redefining what&#39;s possible in hospitality. We&#39;re 650+ team members across 40+ countries, bringing together elite engineers, AI architects, world-class designers, hoteliers, and hospitality veterans to solve challenges others haven&#39;t dared to tackle. Our diverse team speaks 30+ languages, but we all share one language: a passion for innovation and travel. From pioneering breakthroughs in machine learning to revolutionizing how hotels operate, we&#39;re not just watching the future of hospitality unfold – we&#39;re coding it, designing it, writing it, and shipping it. If you&#39;re ready to work alongside some of the brightest minds in tech who are obsessed with using AI to transform a trillion-dollar industry, this is your chance to be part of something extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more online at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudbeds.com/&quot;&gt;cloudbeds.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗖𝗹𝗼𝘂𝗱𝗯𝗲𝗱𝘀 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudbeds.com/press/?press_type=company-news&amp;amp;news_category=awards&quot;&gt;𝗔𝘄𝗮𝗿𝗱𝘀&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Winner – Hotel Management Software | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall 10 Best Places to Work | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall Top 10 Hotelier&#39;s Choice | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finalist – Property Management Systems (PMS) &amp;amp; Channel Managers | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Most Loved Workplace® Certified (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deloitte Technology Fast 500 (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗗𝗶𝘀𝗰𝗼𝘃𝗲𝗿 𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗕𝗲𝗻𝗲𝗳𝗶𝘁𝘀:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote First, Remote Always&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO in accordance with local labor requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office stipend based on country of residency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development courses in Cloudbeds University&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to professional development, including manager training, upskilling, and knowledge transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗘𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘆𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝗶𝘀 𝗪𝗲𝗹𝗰𝗼𝗺𝗲 - 𝗔 𝗖𝘂𝗹𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲 𝗼𝗳 𝗜𝗻𝗰𝗹𝘂𝘀𝗶𝗼𝗻&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudbeds is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer that celebrates the diversity in our global team! We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudbeds is committed to the full inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, Cloudbeds will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations in the hiring process. We encourage deaf, hard-of-hearing, deaf-blind, and deaf-disabled individuals to apply. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process or to perform essential job functions, please contact our HR team by phone at (858) 201-7832 or via email at &lt;a ---------- Cloudbeds will provide an American Sign Language (ASL) interpreter where needed as a reasonable accommodation for the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To all Staffing and Recruiting Agencies: Our Careers Site is only for individuals seeking a job at Cloudbeds. Staffing, recruiting agencies, and individuals being represented by an agency are not authorized to use this site or to submit applications, and any such submissions will be considered unsolicited. Cloudbeds does not accept unsolicited resumes or applications from agencies. Please do not forward resumes to our jobs alias, Cloudbeds employees, or any other company location. Cloudbeds is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes/applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;RDQ427R369&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Databricks, we are passionate about enabling data teams to solve the world&#39;s toughest problems — from making the next mode of transportation a reality to accelerating the development of medical breakthroughs. We do this by building and running the world&#39;s best data and AI infrastructure platform so our customers can use deep data insights to improve their business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Developer Ecosystem organisation shapes how developers and the AI agents working for them build on the Databricks Data and AI Platform, from within the product to the tools they already use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring an Engineering Manager to lead our declarative deployment framework, which turns data and AI projects into versioned, reviewable, repeatable software. It is one product with two entry points. Third-party developers use our open-source CLI from their IDEs, terminals, and CI/CD systems. First-party, they author, deploy and inspect the same projects inside the Databricks workspace. In both, AI agents increasingly do the work: coding agents drive the CLI, and our in-product AI assistant authors and deploys projects alongside the developer. Thousands of organisations run their CI/CD on it, and it is one of the fastest-growing parts of the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team owns the deployment engine and CLI, the in-workspace authoring and deployment experience, and the metadata service and deployment history that record every deployment. The hard problems are real infrastructure-as-code problems: reconciling declared and live state, making plans safe for humans and agents to approve, keeping visual authoring and code in sync, and shipping weekly releases that remain backwards-compatible for our largest customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and grow the team:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage a team of senior engineers across three closely connected areas (the deployment engine and open-source CLI, the in-workspace authoring and deployment experience, and deployment history and metadata), working with strong tech leads. Hire, coach and promote, and grow engineers into tech leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make agentic development the default path:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape how developers and AI agents author, validate and deploy projects, both inside the workspace and from the developer&#39;s own coding agent. Design the tools, skills and guardrails so agents get the same safety and auditability as humans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the strategy and roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product and Design to set a multi-quarter roadmap for declarative deployment: agentic development, governed deployments and deployment history, enterprise CI/CD, and new resource coverage. Make the trade-offs explicit when the demand is larger than the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar on execution and operational excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Run a predictable delivery process for a fast-moving, open-source product with frequent releases. Own reliability, on-call health, incident response and the quality bar for a tool customers depend on to ship to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Treat backward compatibility as a product feature:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead engine and configuration migrations without forcing customers through a flag day, and communicate change clearly to customers, the community and field teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead across the platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive alignment with the many platform teams whose resources and services the framework deploys, and with our sibling teams in Developer Ecosystem (SDKs, CLI, IaC provider, IDE). Make the whole toolchain feel like one product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years managing software engineering teams, and 8+ years of software engineering experience overall.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and shipping developer tools or platforms used by many external developers or internal teams, such as infrastructure-as-code, deployment or CI/CD systems, CLIs, SDKs, or internal developer platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of declarative systems and deployment workflows: plan/apply, state management, drift and reconciliation, environment promotion, GitOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enough technical depth to engage on architecture and trade-offs with senior and staff engineers, and to hold a high-quality bar for public, versioned interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams through ambiguity, with competing priorities from customers, partners and platform dependencies, and making clear calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and a customer-first mindset. You enjoy talking to developers, reading their issues, and turning feedback into roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, including with executives, partner teams and an external developer community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stand-out experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built or led teams on infrastructure-as-code or deployment platforms, e.g. Terraform, Pulumi, AWS CDK / CloudFormation, Kubernetes controllers, Argo CD / Flux / Helm, or Vercel / Netlify-style deploy platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managed an open-source developer tool with an active community and a frequent release cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipped developer workflows for AI coding agents (CLI-first tooling, agent skills, MCP), or AI-assisted authoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have managed managers or multiple teams (~15 to 20+ engineers), owned a multi-year platform strategy, and grown tech leads and managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

