&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Technology provides Technology services for WPP, the world’s largest communications services group. As a creative transformation company, WPP is helping its clients transform the future through extraordinary work. WPP ET is an integral part of that journey, and we are proud to provide technology for some of the world’s most creative brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own WPP’s office-technology product set (meeting rooms, room booking, print, signage and building-access technology), retaining WPP control of standards and roadmap while Kyndryl delivers operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the roadmap, standards and backlog for meeting rooms, room booking, print and signage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a consistent, reliable and modern in-office technology experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Govern Kyndryl and AV/vendor operations and approve change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage hardware standards, lifecycle and refresh.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with facilities and agencies on room and workplace technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise demand and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the service outcomes, standards and SLAs that Kyndryl and other partners deliver against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Govern Kyndryl performance, manage demand and escalations, and retain WPP accountability for the service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the service roadmap and approve partner-delivered change before it reaches production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product / service ownership for meeting-room and office technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Teams Rooms, AV, signage, print and room-booking platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware lifecycle and standards management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor governance and SLA management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backlog and stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable product or service ownership experience for the relevant technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience governing third-party / managed-service delivery against SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications and/or degree, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owns the product/service vision, roadmap and prioritised backlog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balances user experience, security, cost and operational stability in every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holds delivery partners to account against agreed outcomes and SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses data and user feedback to drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;ABOUT BLENHEIM CHALCOT&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Blenheim Chalcot, we invest more than just funds. We invest our knowledge and experience, our ideas and infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a leading digital venture builder, creating and scaling businesses that transform industries through technology, innovation and entrepreneurship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ventures operate across a wide range of sectors, including FinTech, EdTech, GovTech, Media and Marketing Technology. Businesses we have built include ClearScore, Salary Finance and Modulr.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We provide our portfolio businesses with the expertise, infrastructure and strategic support needed to scale successfully, spanning technology, commercial growth, talent, finance and operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For graduates, this creates a unique opportunity to gain exposure to entrepreneurial thinking, innovative technologies and the practical challenges of building successful businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT FOSPHA&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fospha is a fast-growing marketing measurement technology company transforming how global brands understand and optimise their marketing performance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In an increasingly complex digital landscape, Fospha helps businesses understand what is driving growth across their marketing channels, enabling smarter investment decisions and more effective commercial strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Combining advanced data science, AI and marketing analytics, Fospha provides a powerful measurement platform that allows brands to understand the full impact of their advertising investments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with leading global brands, Fospha is at the forefront of innovation in marketing technology, helping businesses make data-driven decisions and unlock new opportunities for growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With an international team spanning multiple markets, Fospha offers an exciting environment for ambitious graduates who want to develop their skills, challenge conventional thinking and contribute to a rapidly scaling technology business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fospha.com/&quot; data-rich-text-autolink=&quot;&quot;&gt;https://www.fospha.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;THE GRADUATE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Blenheim Chalcot as a Graduate, you will gain hands-on experience in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment while working directly within Fospha.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be embedded within the Fospha team, contributing to meaningful projects across commercial strategy, business operations, analytics, AI and growth initiatives, depending on business priorities and your strengths.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional graduate scheme where you spend months observing. From the outset, you will be encouraged to take ownership, contribute ideas and make a measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For you as a graduate, this opportunity involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dedicated to Fospha&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Although you will be employed by Blenheim Chalcot, your day-to-day responsibilities, projects and objectives will be focused on supporting Fospha&#39;s growth and strategic priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Strategic Exposure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Gain experience working on real business challenges, analysing opportunities, improving processes and supporting initiatives that contribute directly to business performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI, Data &amp;amp; Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Develop practical experience of how AI, automation and data-driven decision-making can transform business operations, enhance productivity and create commercial value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Access Blenheim Chalcot&#39;s learning and development opportunities, designed to strengthen your professional, commercial, analytical and leadership skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early Careers Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Benefit from structured development opportunities, mentoring and exposure to experienced professionals across Fospha and the wider BC portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graduate Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Become part of the wider Blenheim Chalcot graduate community, with access to learning sessions, networking opportunities, collaborative projects and social events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountability &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Take responsibility for meaningful projects from an early stage, developing your ability to think independently, solve problems and deliver results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Progression&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– Build a strong foundation for a long-term career within a high-growth technology business, with opportunities to develop as the organisation continues to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT YOU COULD BE WORKING ON&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your interests, capabilities and Fospha&#39;s business priorities, you could be involved in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analysing commercial performance, market opportunities and business growth initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting strategic projects that improve operational efficiency and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exploring how AI tools and automation can improve existing business processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with stakeholders across commercial, product, operations and analytics teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conducting research, preparing business cases and presenting recommendations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identifying opportunities to improve how the business operates, makes decisions and delivers value to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting cross-functional initiatives within a fast-growing international technology business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for graduates who are excited by the opportunity to get involved in different challenges, learn quickly and contribute wherever they can make the biggest impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ARE YOU BC?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t expect you to have worked in a start-up before, studied a technology-related degree or have extensive professional experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are more interested in your potential, mindset and ability to learn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from graduates across all academic disciplines, particularly those who demonstrate strong analytical thinking, intellectual curiosity, commercial awareness and an interest in technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look for some key fundamentals in people joining the BC Group:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You ask questions, challenge assumptions and are always looking for better ways of doing things. You are genuinely interested in emerging technologies, AI and how businesses grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Commercially Minded&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You enjoy solving problems, working with information and understanding how decisions translate into business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Doers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You are proactive, resourceful and willing to take initiative. You don&#39;t wait to be told what to do and are motivated by delivering tangible results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You thrive in dynamic environments, adapt quickly to changing priorities and are comfortable navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enthusiastic About Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You recognise the opportunities AI, data and digital innovation present and are excited to explore how they can be applied in a commercial environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Humble &amp;amp; Sociable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;– You are collaborative, approachable and enjoy working with talented people. We value individuals who bring energy to a team and are open to feedback and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for ambitious individuals with the drive and potential to grow alongside the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you see yourself in this and would like to work with similarly minded people, we would love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT WE CAN OFFER YOU AS A BC EMPLOYEE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be part of one of the UK&#39;s leading digital venture builders, with the opportunity to learn from experienced entrepreneurs, technologists and business leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gain meaningful experience within Fospha, an innovative and internationally growing marketing technology company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access structured graduate learning and development opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a collaborative graduate community across the Blenheim Chalcot portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to AI, data, commercial strategy and business innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A fun, entrepreneurial and ambitious working environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discretionary bonus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;25 days of annual leave plus your birthday off.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Life Assurance and Pension Scheme.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flexible benefits, including Private Medical Insurance, Dental Cover and gym subsidies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;APPLICATION &amp;amp; RECRUITMENT PROCESS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are keen to apply, please submit your CV and a member of our Talent Team will be in touch regarding the next steps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a structured recruitment process designed to assess your potential, problem-solving ability, commercial thinking and suitability for a fast-paced entrepreneurial environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our process typically consists of three stages:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 1: Initial HR Screening&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An introductory conversation with a member of the BC Talent Team to explore your background, motivations, career aspirations and interest in Fospha.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 2: Case Study Assessment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An opportunity to demonstrate your analytical thinking, commercial judgement, problem-solving ability and approach to using technology and AI to tackle business challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage 3: Final Interview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An interview with senior stakeholders from Fospha and Blenheim Chalcot, focusing on your strategic thinking, potential and alignment with the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the recruitment stages and timings may be adjusted depending on business requirements.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITIES&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Blenheim Chalcot is a proud Equal Opportunity Employer. Diversity is one of our core values and is central to our business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to maximise the diversity of our workforce and welcome applications from everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage diversity of perspective, background, identity and thought, while fostering an environment where everyone can express themselves regardless of race, religion, sex, gender, colour, national origin, disability or any other legally protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to nurturing an inclusive environment and building a diverse workforce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your CV you understand that we have a legitimate interest to use your personal data for the purposes of assessing your eligibility for this role.&amp;nbsp; This means that we may use your personal data to contact you to discuss your CV or arrange an interview, or transfer your CV to the hiring manager(s) of the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp; You can ask us at any time to remove your CV from our database by emailing&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- but please note that this means we will no longer consider you for the role you have applied for.&amp;nbsp;You can review our privacy policy&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.blenheimchalcot.com/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chainguard is the trusted source for open source. By delivering hardened, secure, and production-ready builds of all the open source software engineers and AI agents rely on, Chainguard helps organizations build faster, stay compliant, and eliminate risk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our customers include Fortune 500 enterprises and global industry leaders, including Anduril, Canva, Fortinet, Hewlett Packard Enterprise, OpenAI, Snap Inc., and Snowflake. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chainguard is venture-backed by leading investors, including Amplify, IVP, Kleiner Perkins, Lightspeed Venture Partners, Mantis VC, Redpoint Ventures, Sequoia Capital, and Spark Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role, in a nutshell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Renewal Manager, Enterprise at Chainguard, you will play a crucial role in ensuring the retention and long-term success of our largest and most strategic customers. You will own the renewal process for a defined book of high-value accounts, managing complex, multi-year, multi-product renewals from early planning through close while delivering a thoughtful, value-driven customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of Customer Success, Sales, and Ops. You will partner closely with Account Executives and Customer Success Managers on every account: you own the renewal, CSMs own adoption and outcomes, and AEs lead expansion. Your work ensures renewal conversations start early, are grounded in the value customers have realized, and support Chainguard’s broader revenue and retention goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a trusted partner to customers, guiding renewal conversations with procurement, security leaders, and executives with clarity, empathy, and confidence. Strong business acumen, comfort with complex negotiation, and cross-functional leadership are essential, as each renewal carries significant revenue and requires coordination across many stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Renewal Management: Own the end-to-end renewal process for a portfolio of enterprise customers, starting renewal planning 120+ days out and driving on-time renewals through account strategy, stakeholder engagement, and negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value &amp;amp; Business Case: Partner with CSMs to build renewal business cases grounded in adoption, CVE reduction, and engineering time saved, and present them to economic buyers and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial Execution: Structure and negotiate multi-year terms, ramps, co-terms, and pricing changes, and coordinate with Finance, Legal, customer Procurement, and Deal Desk to ensure accurate and timely contract execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account Team Partnership: Work with AEs to align renewals with expansion opportunities, so renewal and growth motions move together rather than compete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; CRM Hygiene: Maintain accurate renewal data in CRM, including forecasts, risks, and renewal status, to provide clear visibility and predictable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Retention Strategy: Identify renewal risks early, including budget pressure, adoption gaps, stakeholder changes, and competitive threats, and lead cross-functional plans to mitigate churn and protect gross retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process &amp;amp; Playbooks: Develop and refine enterprise renewal playbooks, including executive engagement and procurement navigation, to increase efficiency and improve on-time renewal rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship: Serve as the escalation point for the most complex renewals, mentor other Renewal Managers, and help shape how the function scales across segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in B2B SaaS in renewals, account management, or sales, with direct ownership of six-figure customer contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of renewing large, multi-year enterprise agreements at or above value, including through competitive displacement attempts and budget pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive complex renewals with predictability and deliver against gross retention targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating multi-year agreements, pricing, and contract terms with enterprise procurement teams while maintaining strong customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort engaging senior stakeholders, including security, engineering, and procurement leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and organizational skills, with the ability to manage multiple complex renewal cycles simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort generating quotes, preparing order forms, and maintaining CRM hygiene, ideally in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High emotional intelligence, strong communication skills, and a proactive, problem-solving mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate with full autonomy in a fast-paced, evolving environment and lead the build-out of new processes where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large enterprises in regulated industries such as financial services or healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth or early-stage startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with security, DevSecOps, or developer-focused products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for technology and cybersecurity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Range:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to 144,286 GBP 70/30 OTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;If your experience is close, but doesn’t fulfill all requirements,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;please apply&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; Chainguard is on a mission to build the best team. To achieve our goal, we are focused on hiring Chainguardians with unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We live and breathe our company values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are customer obsessed — We focus on delivering solutions to our customers that create value and make their lives better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a bias for intentional action — We prioritize, plan, try things, and fail fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We don&#39;t take ourselves too seriously (but we do serious work) — We are solving an important problem which takes focus, but we also like to enjoy the journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We trust each other and assume good intentions — We&#39;re transparent with decisions to empower team members to make well informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few of the benefits we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible &amp;amp; Remote-First Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Work remotely with team meetup opportunities, bi-annual destination summits, and a monthly stipend for coworking spaces, phone and internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to Equity:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive stock options upon hire and promotion. Plus, you can participate in secondary offerings and have 10 years to exercise your options (yes, you read that correctly: 10 years!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;100% Covered Health Insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; We cover 100% of your health, vision and dental insurance premiums for you and your dependents. Nothing comes out of your paycheck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;∞ Flexible Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Take the time you need – to do our best work, we need to recharge and reset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;18 Weeks Paid Parental Leave:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer 18 weeks for birthing parents and 12 weeks for non-birthing parents, with the option to use it all at once or throughout your child&#39;s first year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your experience is close but doesn&#39;t fulfill all requirements, please apply. We&#39;re building the best team in technology and are focused on hiring &quot;Chainguardians&quot; with unique backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chainguard is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. We also consider qualified applicants with criminal histories, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that Chainguard will process your personal data in accordance with &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.chainguard.dev/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Chainguard&#39;s Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;©2026 Chainguard. All Rights Reserved.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Director (Perm, UK, Remote)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About Nearform&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nearform is an independent team of data and AI experts, engineers, and designers who build intelligent digital solutions and capabilities at pace. We create AI‑enabled solutions that enhance digital experiences, empower developers, and deliver measurable results. In these ways, we partner with ambitious enterprises to deliver enduring impact. Our deep expertise in solving complex digital problems, along with our collaborative, people‑first approach, enables enterprises to build breakthrough products and modernise legacy systems by unleashing the power of AI. Today, our team of 500 experts in 20+ countries is trusted by leading enterprises including Lululemon, Puma, Sun Life, Starbucks, Travelex, Virgin Media O2, and Walmart&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nearform has worked with this Client for over a decade. They are one of our most strategically important clients — a Client that we both &lt;strong&gt;sell to&lt;/strong&gt; (as a direct client) and &lt;strong&gt;sell with&lt;/strong&gt; (as a partner taking joint propositions to their end-clients).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a strategic account director to own the commercial growth of this account. This is a senior, hands-on role: equal parts business developer, marketer, account strategist, and trusted operator inside one of Nearform&#39;s most important relationships. You will be the commercial centre of gravity for everything Nearform does with this Client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the executive relationship. &lt;/strong&gt;Build and maintain a network of senior sponsors across the Client’s consulting and technology leadership teams, creating new advocates for Nearform and deepening executive engagement over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the business development plan.&lt;/strong&gt; Build, maintain, and execute a multi-year account plan with clear targets, named opportunities, and a credible path to growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win new business, across both sides of the relationship.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead pursuit of new opportunities — directly into this Client and jointly into their end-clients — from origination through to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring commercial framing to technical pursuits.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Nearform&#39;s Technical Directors and Solutions leaders to translate strong technical propositions into compelling commercial cases that win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage marketing for the account.&lt;/strong&gt; Own how Nearform shows up in and around this Client — joint content, co-branded propositions, events, case studies, and the steady drumbeat of presence that keeps us front of mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and align the account management model.&lt;/strong&gt; Agree with the Client (and internally) how the relationship is governed — who meets whom, on what cadence, with what outcomes — and keep that model healthy as the account scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a commercial face of the relationship.&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain senior stakeholder relationships across this account, and act as the internal owner of the commercial health at Nearform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast, report, and run the rhythm.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain accurate pipeline, forecast confidently, and run the operational cadence (QBRs, pipeline reviews, account standups) that keeps the account predictable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with local GTM teams &lt;/strong&gt;where appropriate so we are bringing local intimacy with global consistency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial track record&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience growing a strategic enterprise account, ideally one that combines direct selling and partner/channel motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of winning new business in a services or technology environment — not just managing existing revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable owning a number and forecasting against it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting and Partner fluency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has worked with, in, or alongside consulting firms — understands how they sell, how they buy, and how to be useful to them in front of their clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knows how to navigate a &quot;sell-to and sell-with&quot; relationship without confusing the two&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knows how to elevate the partnership-building dimension to develop and execute joint GTM strategies with the client by identifying repeatable plays, solution offerings and routes to market that creates growth for both organisations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI and technology background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of modern technology delivery — software engineering, cloud, data, and (especially) applied AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credible in technical conversations: doesn&#39;t need to architect the solution, but can shape, qualify, and commercially frame it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conversant in the AI landscape as it applies to enterprise — agents, AI-native engineering, the difference between hype and production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operator instincts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plans the work and works the plan — strong account-planning discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident running marketing for an account: brief, prioritise, and partner well with central Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds trust quickly with senior stakeholders, internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable holding the commercial line in a room of technical specialists, and the technical line in a room of commercial buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships in the management consulting ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up or refining an account management operating model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background that includes time in a delivery or technical role earlier in career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUI SOMMES-NOUS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact 3000 est l’agence créative intégrée d’Artefact qui combine le talent créatif au savoir-faire data &amp;amp; IA. L’agence puise son inspiration dans le réel et les insights précis pour concevoir des idées qui résonnent et marquent les esprits sur tous les terrains de jeu créatifs, de l’IA aux médias intemporels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basée à Paris, Artefact 3000 compte 65 collaborateurs et accompagne ses clients dans la définition de leur stratégie de communication, la conception et le déploiement de campagnes intégrées, l’animation des réseaux sociaux, et la production digitale (contenus, expériences digitales, sites web).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MISSIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce rôle, tu es en charge de la &lt;strong&gt;production de contenus visuels et vidéo en IA générative&lt;/strong&gt;, sous la direction d&#39;un créatif tech senior et en collaboration direct avec un autre créatif. La majorité de ton activité consiste à exécuter des briefs créatifs avec des outils IA, en garantissant la qualité et la cohérence des livrables finaux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production IA (cœur du poste)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produire des contenus image et vidéo avec des outils IA génératifs (Midjourney, Runway, Kling, Higgsfield,, etc.) selon des briefs créatifs précis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la post-production et l&#39;intégration des assets IA dans des livrables finaux (montage, compositing, motion).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Motion design &amp;amp; exécution créative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produire des contenus vidéo en motion design (After Effects, Premiere Pro).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Décliner des concepts visuels validés sur les formats de campagne 360 (social, display, film digital, OOH).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à l&#39;élaboration de moodboards et key visuals en amont de production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFIL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diplômé(e) d&#39;une école de &lt;strong&gt;Design&lt;/strong&gt; (design graphique ou motion design) ou avec une première expérience professionnelle en agence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un portfolio avec des productions IA concrètes est &lt;strong&gt;obligatoire&lt;/strong&gt;; les candidatures sans livrables IA ne seront pas examinées.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences techniques indispensables&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise indispensable de la Suite Adobe :&lt;strong&gt; After Effects, Premiere Pro, Photoshop &lt;/strong&gt;et&lt;strong&gt; Illustrator&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familier avec les plateformes de création IA (&lt;strong&gt;Higgsfield, Midjourney, Runway&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familier avec les modèles suivants (&lt;strong&gt;Kling, Seedance, GPT image, Nano Banana&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une première expérience avec un &lt;strong&gt;outil de création IA avec interface nodale&lt;/strong&gt; est appréciée (&lt;strong&gt;ComfyUI, Magnific, etc.&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familier avec &lt;strong&gt;Figma&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On recrute quelqu&#39;un dont le cœur de métier est la production IA, et qui mobilise le motion design pour élever la qualité du rendu final. Nous ne recrutons pas un profil motion designer qui &quot;s&#39;intéresse à l&#39;IA”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ÉQUIPE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu rejoins un binôme spécialisé constitué de deux profils créatifs et techniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MODALITÉS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basé à Paris 9.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prise de poste : ASAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Poste à temps plein (CDI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rémunération prévue : &lt;strong&gt;33k€&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibilité de 3 jours de télétravail par semaine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROCESS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec le sénior crea tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien RH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMMENT POSTULER ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si cette description correspond à ce que tu cherches, merci d&#39;envoyer ton CV + Portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les candidatures sans portfolio/showreels ne seront pas examinées.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au plaisir de te rencontrer.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Étudiant.e en Master, passionné.e par l’innovation et l’intelligence collective, vous êtes à la recherche d’un stage de fin d’étude ou équivalent de 6 mois? Nous vous proposons d&#39;accompagner notre équipe “Ideate &amp;amp; Achieve”, sur la création de programmes d’intrapreneuriat, ateliers et expériences d’intelligence collective, d’innovation participative et de formations.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui nous sommes :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Chez Artefact Open Innovation, nous sommes des entrepreneurs convaincus que la compétitivité, l’efficacité et la transformation des grandes organisations se gagnent en développant de nouvelles formes de collaborations et une compréhension des enjeux liés à l’adoption des nouvelles technologies – notamment DATA et IA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Pour cela, nous partageons et propageons l’esprit entrepreneur avec des modes de collaboration plus agiles à l’échelle :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Des individus, à travers des programmes de formation et l’accélération de projets d’innovation,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Des équipes, grâce à des expériences d’innovation participative et l’adoption de nouveaux modes de collaboration,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Des écosystèmes et des organisations, en créant et animant de larges communautés ouvertes (open innovation), mobilisées autour d’objectifs communs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les missions que nous vous proposons :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribuer au pilotage des projets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Cadrer, suivre et animer les projets : présentation, compte-rendu, document de facilitation ou de suivi…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Assurer la meilleur coordination et animation de l’ensemble des parties prenantes du projet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation des programmes et expériences d’innovation :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Accompagner l’équipe sur l&#39;ensemble des phases du projet : design, appel à idée, sélection des idées, formation des équipes, coaching des équipes, organisation des événements physiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Contribuer à l’organisation d’événements et ateliers ponctuels à destination de nos clients (Ex : ateliers d’idéation, sessions de coaching, hackathon…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Assurer la logistique des événements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Participer à la facilitation de ces expériences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;Ces missions, non exhaustives, s&#39;articulent autour des projets menés pour l’ensemble de nos grands clients, inspirés par le Design Thinking et le Lean Startup. Vous pourrez également, comme tous nos collaborateurs, contribuer ponctuellement au développement de nos équipes comme de notre portefeuil client&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li4&quot;&gt;Après une première année de master validée, vous souhaitez rejoindre une petite équipe où vous agirez en autonomie et responsabilité.-&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Vous maîtrisez les principaux outils bureautiques (Google et/ou Microsoft) et ne craignez pas de découvrir de nouveaux logiciels (MailChimp, Klaxoon, Canva, Mural…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Votre très bon relationnel vous permet de vous adapter à des interlocuteurs variés (Chefs de projet, designers, facilitateurs, partenaires, décideurs et experts chez nos clients…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;A l’aise dans un environnement international, vous maitrisez l’anglais, à l’oral comme à l’écrit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Vous avez une expérience et une&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;appétence confirmée pour la mise en place et la gestion d’événements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Ce stage vous permettra une immersion au cœur des enjeux d’innovation, de co-création et de collaboration des grandes organisations. Et il pourra, si nos projets respectifs convergent bien, déboucher sur une embauche à l’issue du stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Condition : &lt;/strong&gt;stage de Septembre 2025 à Février 2026&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧡&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;About Alma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👐 &lt;/strong&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Our&lt;strong&gt; Account Manager team&lt;/strong&gt; key role is to position Alma as a &lt;strong&gt;true business partner with our top merchants&lt;/strong&gt;. In short, our Account Managers are in charge of a portfolio of large accounts, with whom you&#39;ll work closely to make them successful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be arriving at the beginning of the experience, as our team was created in March 2021. There is still a lot to create! This means you&#39;ll have a key role in shaping the function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Account Manager Team Lead, you will work closely with the Sales team, the Onboarding team, the Retail Training team and the Merchant Support team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is a permanent role, based in Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 &lt;/strong&gt;About the job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;In a nutshell, &lt;strong&gt;your key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt; will consist in:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage, negotiate and retain a portfolio of large accounts&lt;/strong&gt;. Establish trustful relationships with Alma’s large merchants. Be the key point of communication for the merchants&#39; stakeholders, while working closely with the other functions (Onboarding, Training, Support).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver meaningful insights&lt;/strong&gt;. Analyse merchants&#39; performance to provide superior insights on their businesses. Develop expertise in your field to constantly position Alma as a strategic partner, helping the merchants achieve their goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify key business opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;. Identify up-sell/cross-sell opportunities on your accounts and develop strategic plans with the merchants. Ensure your accounts get the most out of Alma (maximise conversion, increase turnover, increase basket size) by leveraging the tools we have developed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the voice of merchants&lt;/strong&gt;. Share insights and feedback from merchants with the Product &amp;amp; Engineering team and the wider organisation, helping to constantly improve our solution and the merchants&#39; experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧰 &lt;/strong&gt;You will work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aircall&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SalesNavigator&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧩&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You have ideally&lt;strong&gt; more than 5 years&amp;nbsp;of relevant experiences (full-time permanent positions) in similar functions such as a Sales or an Account Manager / Shop manager in the Retail industry.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are seeking individuals who demonstrate coachability and a strong willingness to learn and grow.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You’re &lt;strong&gt;fluent in French&lt;/strong&gt; and a &lt;strong&gt;full professional proficiency in English are mandatory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial skills&lt;/strong&gt;: You like finding new opportunities for mutual gains. You are at ease in negotiation &amp;amp; closing discussions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Driven&lt;/strong&gt;: You are comfortable and autonomous in managing your portfolio using identified key KPIs, you like talking numbers!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demanding and reliable&lt;/strong&gt;: You set high goals for yourself. You don&#39;t compromise on the quality of your work, and you always deliver on your commitments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empathetic&lt;/strong&gt;: You easily get into other people&#39;s shoes. You are always keen to do the extra mile for clients to make them successful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous and driven&lt;/strong&gt;: You know how to find the solution to an issue and look for the information you need. You are comfortable obtaining information from the Alma teams who can help you obtain solutions quickly (product, finance, risk, sales etc...)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great communicator&lt;/strong&gt;: You have excellent written and oral communication skills. You know how to adapt to your audience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;🧘 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a growing company that&#39;s reshaping how merchants and consumers connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership from day one, with real impact on business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment where your ideas and results matter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to help build a category and be part of something meaningful&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
