&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Lead AI &amp;amp; Value Transformation Consultant, you will architect and drive large-scale AI and data-driven business transformation within the Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG) sector using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Senior and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As a master AI operator, your core mandate is to support complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their Finance and Supply-Chain ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Map how the Celonis platform accelerates and underpins the customer’s enterprise AI strategy.. Take end-to-end accountability for massive ROI targets. Craft board-level executive narratives and lead complex, multi-workstream value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute C-level orchestration, cultivating powerful executive sponsorship across the C-suite. Drive lasting adoption by co-owning enterprise-wide change management and building advanced CoE operating models for total self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer and govern massive, cross-regional transformation programs. Implement highly advanced AI-driven account planning across a portfolio of workstreams. Build actionable frameworks that empower the customer to quantify processes at a global scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate as a master AI-fluent operator, leveraging advanced copilots for rapid technical outputs and seamlessly orchestrating Applied Value Engineers for complex architectural builds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value:&lt;/strong&gt; Define the strategic expansion roadmap, positioning Celonis as the underlying intelligence layer for the enterprise. Guide product development by identifying next-generation industry use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years of highly relevant experience, demonstrating ownership of multiple strategic workstreams and possessing a growing body of expert industry knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep background in enterprise IT and SaaS (e.g., SAP). Master AI-fluent operator who uses AI to scale outputs and guides technical teams on complex solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Thrives in ambiguity, capable of setting the strategic direction for entire account teams. Deeply committed to &lt;em&gt;living for customer value&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Master of value realization, setting the standard for business-critical proof points and advanced use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert at orchestrating massive enterprise programs and navigating portfolio complexities. Proven ability to mobilize C-suite sponsorship. Flawless English with exceptional executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert knowledge in Finance/Supply Chain and deep expertise in CPG market dynamics. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics, comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR is an AI-native advertising platform built for the next era of performance marketing. We operate at the intersection of machine learning, programmatic media, and full-funnel mobile growth, powering campaigns for some of the world&#39;s most ambitious advertisers. Our platform is purpose-built to deliver outcomes at scale, not just impressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a team of builders, operators, and technologists who believe the advertising industry is overdue for a fundamental rethink. We move fast, operate with a high degree of ownership, and hold ourselves to an exceptionally high standard of craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR is scaling aggressively with an active M&amp;amp;A pipeline and a platform vision that puts us on a path to becoming an industry leader. This is a rare opportunity to join a company at an inflection point and help shape what it becomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Principal Growth Manager, EMEA, you will own a book of RZR&#39;s largest and most complex accounts in the region, including top-tier gaming publishers that spend at the very top of our platform. You will be the senior expert in the room: diagnosing performance, building multi-quarter growth plans, and turning data into a case that clients&#39; leadership will act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to our Chief Revenue Officer and work closely with Analytics, Ad Ops, Product, and New Business. As the most senior individual contributor on the EMEA Growth team, you will also be the go-to mentor for other Growth Managers and share what works on large accounts across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role exists now because our biggest EMEA accounts are growing fast and need a senior owner with deep DSP expertise, someone who can run them independently from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Strategic Account Ownership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a book of top-tier EMEA accounts and drive net revenue growth and retention against quarterly targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run multi-quarter growth plans for each account, with clear revenue milestones and expansion plays across User Acquisition, Retargeting and CTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead QBRs and strategic sessions with client leadership, and build relationships well above the day-to-day contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Insight&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose performance shifts and run test roadmaps across creative, audience and bidding with our Analytics and Ad Ops teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex technical topics such as SKAN, MMP attribution, bidding and LTV optimization into clear strategy for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Revenue Operations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the revenue forecast for your book and be accountable for its accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot churn risk early and manage it, with clear escalation paths and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Team Leverage&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor Growth Managers, share playbooks from large-account work, and bring EMEA market intelligence to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in mobile advertising or ad tech, including 5+ years client-facing in growth, account management or customer success at a DSP, ad network or programmatic platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have personally managed accounts with multi-million-dollar annual spend (ideally $1M+ per month) and grown them through a defined plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical fluency in performance programmatic: bidding and auction dynamics, ROAS/LTV optimization, SKAN and MMP attribution, and creative testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong forecasting discipline, with a track record of accurate revenue calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing senior client stakeholders (VP, Head of UA and C-level).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English; based in or able to relocate to London, with regular travel across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile gaming publisher experience, especially with large European studios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CTV or retargeting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring or informal team-lead experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A second EMEA business language (German, French, Turkish or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join RZR in London?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The biggest accounts in the region.&lt;/strong&gt; You will hold relationships with top-tier gaming publishers, where your recommendations move millions in spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A senior IC track with real influence.&lt;/strong&gt; You will be the expert other Growth Managers learn from, with no need to move into management to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A small, senior team at a breakout moment.&lt;/strong&gt; RZR is one of the fastest-growing DSPs in mobile, with a goal of becoming a top-3 DSP within two years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More levers on every account.&lt;/strong&gt; UA, Retargeting and CTV under one platform, powered by machine learning built for performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upside that pays.&lt;/strong&gt; A competitive base plus quarterly variable compensation, with accelerators for beating target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;RZR Behaviors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR operates by eight core behaviors: Extreme Ownership · Move Fast · Drive for Excellence · Proactive Communication · Courage · Curiosity · Deliver Results · Manage Ambiguity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RZR is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR is a place where everyone can grow. However you identify, and whatever background you bring with you, we invite you to apply if this role excites you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RZR provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any kind. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Manager -&amp;nbsp; Robotic Picking | Outbound | Hybrid Working | Hatfield&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are Ocado Group and we&#39;re bringing world-class automation to online grocery. Our Ocado Smart Platform (OSP) combines cutting-edge robotics, AI and IoT within our advanced CFCs (Customer Fulfilment Centres). We&#39;ve mastered the single pick, transforming online delivery for our global partners. Join us and be part of a team pushing the boundaries of retail technology.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;As the Product Manager for Robotic Picking (OGRP), you will own Ocado’s flagship automated picking capability, which has completed over 350 million picks in production to date. Sitting within our Outbound Product Area, you will operate at the intersection of software, robotics and physical operations - optimising performance and profitability where decisions show up in production within days, not quarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Operating as the highest individual contributor level in Product, you will serve as a recognized domain authority for Product Directors and VPs, with the capability and strategic breadth to step into a Director role. Day to day, you will manage the boundary between what the robot can reliably pick, how orders get planned and packed and what the CFC can execute without losing throughput or delivery quality. You will drive cross-area strategy, influence senior engineering counterparts and collaborate with commercial leaders to accelerate feature adoption and scale OGRP across new global sites.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Own the vision, roadmap and adoption outcomes for Ocado’s on-grid robotic picking (OGRP) capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Manage product range extension, using data on damage rates and pick success to balance range growth against operational risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Design seamless integration between robotic picking, manual stations order packing and downstream CFC workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Lead exception design and site readiness, establishing criteria that allow OGRP to launch reliably across diverse global layouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Drive rigorous experimentation and hypothesis testing, holding cross-functional teams to high standards of evidence and validation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;Maintain clear visibility over P&amp;amp;L lines influenced by your domain, making critical Build vs. Buy calls and establishing metrics tied directly to business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary market intelligence resource and go-to domain expert for Product Directors, VPs and external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,7,0&quot;&gt;Mobilise and lead through expertise and influence, mentoring surrounding PMs and actively contributing to the broader product leadership group.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;A seasoned Product Leader/Manager with a proven track record of driving impact at scale within complex technical or commercial domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate complex business environments and influence organizational strategy at the senior leadership and C-suite level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;Strong data and commercial fluency, with the ability to manage P&amp;amp;L impacts, build financial rationales and defend prioritization decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;Comfort making high-quality, decisive choices under conditions of ambiguity, high operational stakes and physical constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;Exceptional communication skills, with experience presenting complex product strategies to internal leadership and external clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Nice to Haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;Valuable expertise in robotics, automated fulfilment, warehouse operations or complex hardware/software integrations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;We believe in supporting our people with meaningful, flexible benefits that prioritise well-being and work-life balance. Here’s a snapshot of what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Time to recharge:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days annual leave (rising to 27 after 5 years), plus the option to buy more – and 30 days a year to work from anywhere in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Private Medical Insurance from your first month, wellbeing support through specialist apps and EAP, plus Income Protection and Life Assurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Family-first policies:&lt;/strong&gt; 22 weeks paid maternity/primary carer leave and 6 weeks paid paternity leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Financial support:&lt;/strong&gt; Pension with employer matching up to 7%, share schemes (Sharesave &amp;amp; BAYE) and interest-free loans for train tickets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Commuter perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Cycle to Work Scheme, Car salary sacrifice and free shuttle buses to/from Hatfield and Welwyn Garden City stations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Exclusive discounts:&lt;/strong&gt; 15% off at Ocado.com with free delivery (starting in your first month) and up to 70% off at our Company Shop.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;Be bold, be unique, be brilliant, be you. We are looking for individuality and we value diversity. We are an equal opportunities employer and we are committed to treating all applicants and employees fairly and equally. We are &lt;span class=&quot;citation-5 citation-end-5&quot;&gt;committed to making reasonable adjustments to provide a positive, barrier-free recruitment process and supportive work environment. If you have any support or access requirements, we encourage you to advise us at the time of application.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-KS1&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5 citation-end-5&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

Established in 2004, OLIVER is the world's first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&nbsp;
As a part of The Brandtech Group, we're at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our AI solutions enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&nbsp;Role: Senior Director of Social and Creator
Location:&nbsp;London, United Kingdom
Social is our largest and fastest-growing business on Unilever, one of the biggest marketers in the world. We're looking for a senior social leader to run it.&nbsp;
You'll lead a team of 100+ social, content, community and creator specialists across U-Studio and our Social Studios, including Dove. The team works in-house, side by side with Unilever brand teams, on some of the most famous brands in the world.&nbsp;
You'll be the figurehead for social on the account. You'll line manage senior leads, look after the careers of a large team across the UK, EMEA and our global hubs, and set the bar for what great Unilever social looks like. You'll partner closely with Global Client Leads and Managing Partners to grow the business, and you'll be the person Unilever's brand and business group leads turn to on social.&nbsp;
THIS ROLE IS RIGHT FOR YOU IF:
You're a senior social leader who lives in the feed. You know platforms, audiences and culture, and you know what makes a post worth talking about. You can explain why to a CMO in two minutes.&nbsp;
You've run large, multi-market teams and you care about the people in them. You've built teams that stay, grow and get promoted.&nbsp;
You're commercially sharp. You've grown accounts, written winning proposals and owned the numbers as well as the work.&nbsp;
You understand agency life inside out, but you're just as at home working inside a client's business. Unilever has many moving parts and many stakeholders. You enjoy that rather than putting up with it.&nbsp;
You have a point of view on where social is going, and people want to hear it.&nbsp;
ABOUT THE TEAM&nbsp;
OLIVER has been Unilever's in-house agency partner since 2016. U-Studio now spans [18] markets and every business group. Social sits at the heart of it: content, community management, creators, social commerce and culture-led strategy across [90+] brands. In 2025 we became Social AOR for Dove, building One Dove Social Studios across [7] markets.&nbsp;
WHAT YOU WILL BE DOING&nbsp;
Leadership and people&nbsp;

Lead and line manage the Unilever social leadership team, and set direction for social leads across every U-Studio and Social Studio.&nbsp;


Own the careers of the wider team, including reviews, progression, hiring and retention.&nbsp;


Be visible. Teams should know who sets the bar and why.&nbsp;


Build a strong leadership bench underneath you, with clear succession for key roles.&nbsp;


Represent social in the account leadership team.&nbsp;

Clients and growth&nbsp;

Be the senior social partner to Unilever brand, business group and global leads.&nbsp;


Partner with Gareth and U-Studio leadership to grow social across new brands, markets and scope.&nbsp;


Lead social thinking on proposals, pitches and renewals.&nbsp;


Spot risks early in relationships, scope or quality, and act before the client raises them.&nbsp;

Quality and craft&nbsp;

Set and hold the creative and strategic bar for Unilever social everywhere we work.&nbsp;


Own social playbooks and ways of working, and make sure they're rolled out and used in every market.&nbsp;


Make sure brand strategy shows up in the feed, not just in the playbook.&nbsp;


Embed GenAI tools, agents and proprietary tech in the team's everyday work.&nbsp;

Thought leadership&nbsp;

Develop our point of view on social for Unilever, covering platforms, culture, creators, social commerce and measurement.&nbsp;


Bring new thinking to clients without waiting for a brief.&nbsp;


Represent OLIVER at Unilever and industry events, working with the Global Head of Social on our wider social POV.&nbsp;

Commercial and operations&nbsp;

Own the health of the social business on Unilever, including resourcing, margin, utilisation and forecasting.&nbsp;


Shape team structures and costing for new scope.&nbsp;


Keep teams compliant with platform, regulatory and Unilever policy changes.&nbsp;

WHAT YOU'LL BRING&nbsp;

12+ years in social at agencies or brands, including senior leadership of a large, international team.&nbsp;


Experience leading senior relationships on a major global account, ideally FMCG or beauty.&nbsp;


Deep platform knowledge and a strong creative eye. Editorial experience is a plus.&nbsp;


A track record of line managing senior leaders and building teams that stay and grow.&nbsp;


Commercial confidence with P&amp;L, margin, resourcing and business cases.&nbsp;


Experience working in a large, complex organisation with many stakeholders.&nbsp;


Confident presenting to senior clients and industry audiences.&nbsp;
Hands-on experience bringing AI into social workflows, or a real appetite to.&nbsp;

