&lt;h3&gt;About Tensordyne&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is transforming our world. It can perform cognitive functions that previously only humans could do, such as perceiving interactions across different modalities and environments - with the ability to quickly learn and then solve complex problems. Tensordyne is an AI system solution company that builds very high-performance, low-power generative AI inference systems. Our mission, through the creation of custom silicon, hardware and software, is to enable multimodal Generative AI inference acceleration at scale, with safe, sustainable, high-performance systems for our hyperscaler and neocloud data center customers. We are at the leading edge of advancing the latest research and product improvements for generative Al inference solutions that will make Al even more advantageous for compelling new generative AI applications.Tensordyne is a well funded, fast-paced startup company with headquarters in both Sunnyvale, CA, and Munich, Germany. We also have many talented team members working remotely across North America and Europe. We take care of our people and their families with comprehensive benefits, competitive compensation, flexible spending options, and recognition programs, because building category-defining technology starts with a healthy, supported team. Come join us as we shape the future of multimodal generative artificial intelligence!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll build the software stack that takes a model from code down to the hardware: the abstractions, kernels, libraries, and tools that engineers and agents use to reach peak performance. Help optimize the latest AI models on our silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hardware is designed to be straightforward to program, so the goal is not to hide it. The goal is to expose the right level of control at each layer, from our compiler-driven Python SDK to our low-level Rust programming stack, and to make every performance gap measurable and every fix permanent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a builder who understands hardware deeply and develops with agents by default. You’ll own substantial parts of one of these layers and work closely with engineers across models, compilers, runtime, and hardware. Your focus is performance: where cycles, bandwidth, and communication go, and how to win them back. Number formats and model accuracy are owned by our conversion and emulation team; you’ll partner with them where precision and speed meet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the stack.&lt;/strong&gt; Design APIs, kernel abstractions, and libraries in our Python SDK or Rust stack so model engineers and agents can reach high performance at the layer that fits their problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make models fast.&lt;/strong&gt; Take priority workloads, from LLMs to multimodal models, to peak performance on real silicon. Profile, find the bottleneck across kernels, compiler, runtime, and parallelism, and fix it at the right layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close the gap between model and measurement.&lt;/strong&gt; Compare measured performance against analytical models and simulation. Explain every material gap, and turn the explanation into a fix or a better model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the agentic performance loop.&lt;/strong&gt; Give agents the profilers, traces, counters, and benchmark harnesses to form a hypothesis, change code, and measure the result in minutes. Make the results trustworthy enough to act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the bar for performance.&lt;/strong&gt; Define how we measure, track regressions, and report results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build for the next chip.&lt;/strong&gt; Design abstractions that carry forward to future hardware generations. Work with hardware architects to test how architectural choices affect real workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we need from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You understand hardware performance.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve optimized AI workloads on GPUs or custom accelerators and can reason about compute utilization, memory hierarchy, latency hiding, synchronization, and multi-chip scaling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build excellent software.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve owned substantial systems from design through production. You’re strong in Python and/or at least one systems language such as Rust, C++, or C, and rigorous about interfaces, abstractions, and testing. We care about engineering quality more than a specific language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You understand LLM inference end to end.&lt;/strong&gt; You can read a new model’s implementation and reason about prefill, decode, attention variants, KV caches, MoE, and parallelism, and how they map to compute, memory, and communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build with agents.&lt;/strong&gt; Agentic development is how you work, not an experiment. You’d rather build the loop that finds the optimization than find it by hand, and you know when the loop still needs a human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build things others succeed with.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve designed APIs, libraries, or performance tooling that other engineers adopted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You drive problems to resolution.&lt;/strong&gt; You form clear hypotheses, measure, and follow the evidence across software and hardware boundaries. You take ownership of the result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you hit a few of those boxes, we’d like to speak to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;We’d be thrilled if you had&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with embedded, bare-metal, or low-level runtime programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MLIR, other compiler frameworks, or kernel DSLs such as Triton, Pallas, NKI, or CuTe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to LLM serving stacks such as vLLM or SGLang, or a track record of taking end-to-end inference workloads to competitive performance on a hardware target.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why join us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your code will decide how fast models run on our hardware, and how easy it is for the next engineer, or the next agent, to make them faster. You’ll own a layer of a new programming model, work directly with the people designing the hardware, and see your decisions tested on real silicon and carried into the next generation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tensordyne Values&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think big. Pursue ambitious technical and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aim for excellence. Quality matters in everything we build and deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own it and get it done. Take responsibility and drive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate with integrity. Be direct, transparent, and respectful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win as a team. Make the people around you more effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value different perspectives. The strongest teams challenge assumptions and bring diverse experience to difficult problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tensordyne is an equal opportunity employer. We believe diverse teams are better equipped to solve complex problems and build exceptional technology. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to age, color, gender identity or expression, marital status, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, race, religion, pregnancy, sexual orientation, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note to recruitment agencies: Please do not contact Tensordyne employees or leaders regarding this role. We do not accept unsolicited agency resumes and are not responsible for fees associated with unsolicited submissions.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help Shape the Future of the UK&#39;s Energy Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BakerHicks has established itself as a trusted engineering partner within the UK&#39;s Transmission &amp;amp; Distribution sector, delivering major infrastructure projects for some of the country&#39;s leading utility clients. With continued growth and a strong pipeline of secured work, we are seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Principal/Lead Primary Design Engineer - HV Substations&lt;/strong&gt; to join our expanding Power team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to play a key role in delivering critical energy infrastructure projects, leading technical excellence across complex HV substation designs up to 400kV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the HV Substation Team Leader, you will lead a team of Primary Design Engineers and CAD Technicians, ensuring the consistent delivery of high-quality engineering solutions and technical documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will provide technical leadership across HV substation projects, support the development of junior engineers, and act as a key point of contact for both internal and external stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also support business development activities by contributing technical input to tender submissions and helping secure future project opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on some of the UK&#39;s most significant Transmission &amp;amp; Distribution projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a business that is helping deliver the infrastructure required for the UK&#39;s energy transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor a growing team of engineers and technicians.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with major utility clients including National Grid, SSEN, Scottish Power, UKPN, ENWL and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy genuine opportunities for career progression, technical leadership and professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate within a multidisciplinary engineering environment where innovation and new ideas are actively encouraged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See projects progress through the full lifecycle, from concept and design through to construction and energisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the delivery of primary engineering design for HV substation projects up to 400kV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and mentor a team of engineers and CAD technicians.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the quality, accuracy and consistency of project deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and develop junior engineers through coaching and technical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical oversight and approval of engineering work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of HV Plant CDAE responsibilities on National Grid projects where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare, review and approve:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary layouts and elevations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Single Line Diagrams (SLDs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformer sizing and specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GIS and AIS switchgear designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shunt reactors, NERs and reactive/capacitive compensation schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Switchroom layouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CT sizing calculations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Busbar design and short-circuit force calculations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Busbar and connector specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LVAC systems for substations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Earthing studies and earth return current calculations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insulation coordination studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mechanical interlocking schemes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipment technical specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Type registration documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT) activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage programme, budget and quality requirements for engineering deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare, review and approve feasibility studies, outline designs, detailed designs and technical reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve construction drawings and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate internal teams and external suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support bid and tender submissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain updates to the Business Development Tracker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in client meetings, design reviews and technical workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be an experienced HV Substation Engineer with a strong technical background and a passion for delivering high-quality engineering solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience delivering primary design and engineering for HV substation projects up to 400kV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of UK Transmission and Distribution standards and specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading engineering teams and reviewing technical deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work independently while supporting and developing others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive and collaborative approach to problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BEng or BSc in Electrical Engineering or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in HV substation primary design and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience producing designs, calculations, reports and drawings associated with substation projects up to 400kV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of IEC standards and industry best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working to National Grid and DNO specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing engineering teams and coordinating project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside CAD technicians using AutoCAD, Revit or similar software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEng or MSc in Electrical Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;National Grid HV Plant CDAE accreditation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chartered Engineer (CEng) status or actively working towards chartership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting bids, tenders and work-winning activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for a technically strong HV Substation Engineer looking to take the next step in their career, working on industry-leading projects while helping shape the future of the UK&#39;s energy infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BakerHicks, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to make a real impact, influence key engineering decisions, and develop your career within a growing and highly respected engineering consultancy&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Arial; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Arial; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;Many of the positions within our company are subject to security clearance or security assurance levels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; margin-left: 6.375in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Arial; font-size: 11.0pt; color: black;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;The successful candidate must be able to obtain and maintain the appropriate level of security clearance or assurance level for this role, in line with client and sector requirements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Arial; font-size: 11.0pt; color: black;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;In some cases, additional nationality or residency criteria may also apply due to specific client or national security obligations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Arial; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Arial; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;Further information on National security clearance levels can be found on the UK Government website: (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/united-kingdom-security-vetting-clearance-levels/national-security-vetting-clearance-levels&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;National security vetting: clearance levels - GOV.UK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About BakerHicks&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve been innovating in design, engineering and project delivery since 1957 and operate from 14 locations for a truly European reach. For more about our company story, see: &lt;a href=&quot;https://bakerhicks.com/en/about&quot;&gt;About | BakerHicks&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BakerHicks. A &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.morgansindall.com/&quot;&gt;Morgan Sindall Group&lt;/a&gt; company.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whatever your discipline, you’ll be alongside some of the most talented people in the industry. Our network of offices are appealing, friendly and comfortable spaces, easily accessible by car or public transport. And our salary and benefits packages are some of the best in the industry.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you get will depend on what you do, with individual performance-related rewards also on offer in addition to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company car or cash allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 6% matched contributory pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual leave plus ability to buy additional leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount scheme (including gym membership, mobile phones etc)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible/hybrid working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family friendly policies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee assistance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BakerHicks is an equal opportunity employer. We care about creating an inclusive atmosphere and are committed to promoting diversity and inclusion throughout.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;BakerHicks is an inclusive organisation welcoming talent from all backgrounds. Applicants are assessed on the basis of personal merit and qualifications.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DS1&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;At BakerHicks, we’ve grown rapidly in the Transmission &amp;amp; Distribution sector over the last 12 years, delivering projects that make a real difference to communities across the UK. As our portfolio expands, we’re excited to welcome Principal Designer - CDM who share our passion for collaboration, innovation, and creating a sustainable future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and proactive&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;SR188 Principal&amp;nbsp;Designer&amp;nbsp;Representative (PDR)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to support the delivery of a diverse portfolio of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;National Grid&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;projects across both&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Front-End Engineering Design (FEED)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;construction stages&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Acting on behalf of the Principal&amp;nbsp;Designer&amp;nbsp;under National Grid’s SR188 framework, you will play a key role in ensuring compliance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CDM Regulations 2015&lt;/strong&gt;, driving high standards of health, safety, and risk management throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Principal&amp;nbsp;Designer&amp;nbsp;Representative (PD R)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in accordance with National Grid’s SR188 requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and advise clients,&amp;nbsp;designers, and project teams on&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CDM compliance&lt;/strong&gt;, including roles, duties, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and manage&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;design risk management processes&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring hazards are identified, eliminated, or reduced through design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate and lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;design risk workshops&lt;/strong&gt;, HAZID/HAZOP sessions, and design reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure production and maintenance of key CDM deliverables, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design Risk Registers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-Construction Information (PCI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and Safety Files&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide CDM and safety input, influencing safe-by-design principles early in the project lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support project teams through the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;design&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;construction phase&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring effective communication of residual risks to contractors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with stakeholders including National Grid, contractors, and multidisciplinary design teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and report on&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CDM compliance and performance&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying areas for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote a strong&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;health, safety, and wellbeing culture&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;across all projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Principal&amp;nbsp;Designer&amp;nbsp;or CDM Advisor role&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally within the utilities or infrastructure sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CDM Regulations 2015&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and their practical application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;National Grid projects&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and familiarity with SR188 requirements is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience across both&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FEED/design and construction phases&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead design risk management activities and influence multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder engagement skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills with the ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant degree or equivalent in engineering, construction, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional membership (e.g., APS, IOSH, ICE, IET) desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NEBOSH Construction Certificate (or equivalent) desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and solution-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and facilitation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail with a commitment to safety excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively within multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;critical national infrastructure projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to a broad range of FEED and construction stage activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and career progression opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Many of the positions within our company are subject to security clearance or security assurance levels.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;The successful candidate must be able to obtain and maintain the appropriate level of security clearance or assurance level for this role, in line with client and sector requirements.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In some cases, additional nationality or residency criteria may also apply due to specific client or national security obligations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Further information on National security clearance levels can be found on the UK Government website: (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/united-kingdom-security-vetting-clearance-levels/national-security-vetting-clearance-levels&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;2&quot;&gt;National security vetting: clearance levels - GOV.UK&lt;/a&gt;)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About BakerHicks&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve been innovating in design, engineering and project delivery since 1957 and operate from 14 locations for a truly European reach. For more about our company story, see: &lt;a href=&quot;https://bakerhicks.com/en/about&quot;&gt;About | BakerHicks&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BakerHicks. A &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.morgansindall.com/&quot;&gt;Morgan Sindall Group&lt;/a&gt; company.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whatever your discipline, you’ll be alongside some of the most talented people in the industry. Our network of offices are appealing, friendly and comfortable spaces, easily accessible by car or public transport. And our salary and benefits packages are some of the best in the industry.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you get will depend on what you do, with individual performance-related rewards also on offer in addition to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company car or cash allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 6% matched contributory pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual leave plus ability to buy additional leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount scheme (including gym membership, mobile phones etc)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible/hybrid working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family friendly policies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee assistance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BakerHicks is an equal opportunity employer. We care about creating an inclusive atmosphere and are committed to promoting diversity and inclusion throughout.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;BakerHicks is an inclusive organisation welcoming talent from all backgrounds. Applicants are assessed on the basis of personal merit and qualifications.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DS1 &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Senior Account Executive to join our busy team. The successful candidate will work across a client portfolio including Warburtons and Nestle, therefore FMCG, Food &amp;amp; Drinks experience is ideal. The role is perfect for someone who is culturally connected, follows the latest trends and has a passion for storytelling. In addition, experience on clients targeting high net worth individuals would be preferrable for the luxury &amp;amp; travel side of the portfolio including clients such as Riverstone living and Avis First&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent client service and management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate within a large team, manage upwards and report into client leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery of projects and campaigns in line with budgets, ROI and results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep media relations and press office experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience working with talent and influencers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Imaginative writing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for producing quality work with great attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in finance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of FMCG, Luxury &amp;amp; Travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial Acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative Collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent Communication Skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencer &amp;amp; Talent Co-ordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Press &amp;amp; Social Media Awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Burson UK was named Cannes Lions Agency of the year 2026!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-CY1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Data Engineer&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prolific is not just another player in the AI space—we are the architects of the human data infrastructure that&#39;s reshaping the landscape of AI development. In a world where foundational AI technologies are increasingly commoditized, it&#39;s the quality and diversity of human-generated data that truly differentiates products and models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Data Engineer to help build scalable data solutions that serve teams across the business—from data scientists and analysts to AI engineers and product teams. You&#39;ll contribute to both the underlying platform and the way data is used in our products, working in a modern, cloud-native environment where privacy, security, and good data practices are part of how we build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Technical Expertise: 3+ years building and shipping production-grade data systems, with strong SQL skills and proficiency in Python or another object-oriented language (Java, Scala etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with cloud-native infrastructure—ideally&amp;nbsp;some exposure to Terraform, Kubernetes, or similar IaC and container orchestration tools. We don&#39;t expect deep expertise in all of these, but comfort working in this kind of environment matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience designing data APIs or services that expose data to applications, or a strong interest in working across the analytical/operational boundary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A thoughtful approach to data quality, privacy, and security—you&amp;nbsp;understand that how data is used is as important as how it&#39;s moved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong collaboration skills and comfort working across teams with different priorities—engineers, data scientists, AI engineers, and product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A pragmatic, curious mindset—you&amp;nbsp;enjoy keeping up with the field and know when to reach for a new tool versus when to stick with what works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Pipeline Management: Hands-on experience with data pipeline tools (Airflow, dbt) and strong ability to optimize for performance and reliability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Quality Focus: Commitment to continuously improving product quality, security, and performance through rigorous testing and code reviews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Documentation: Meticulous approach to creating and maintaining architecture and systems documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Problem-Solving: Exceptional analytical skills to troubleshoot complex data issues and implement effective solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Independence: Capability to ship medium features independently while contributing to the team&#39;s overall objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;What you’ll be doing in the role&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain data pipelines that power analytics, ML workloads, and product-facing applications—from internal databases, SaaS sources, and streaming systems through to the teams and services that consume them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Evolve our data platform alongside cloud platform engineers, using infrastructure-as-code (Terraform) and Kubernetes-based deployments (Argo) to keep the platform scalable, reliable, and self-serve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;System Architecture: Design and implement scalable data infrastructure that accommodates our growing data volume and complexity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop data services and APIs that expose trusted data to product applications, bridging analytical and operational systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Own data quality and observability, putting monitoring, testing, and alerting in place so issues are caught early and trust in the data stays high.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with AI engineers, data scientists, analysts, and product teams to understand their data needs and design the right solutions—not just the quickest ones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Uphold strong data privacy, security, and compliance practices in everything you build, particularly where data flows into product-facing contexts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Technical Documentation: Create and maintain comprehensive documentation of data flows, models, and systems for knowledge sharing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Security and Compliance: Ensure all data systems adhere to security best practices and compliance requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why Prolific is a great place to work&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;ve built a unique platform that connects researchers and companies with a global pool of participants, enabling the collection of high-quality, ethically sourced human behavioral data and feedback. This data is the cornerstone of developing more accurate, nuanced, and aligned AI systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that the next leap in AI capabilities won&#39;t come solely from scaling existing models but from integrating diverse human perspectives and behaviors into AI development. By providing this crucial human data infrastructure, Prolific is positioning itself at the forefront of the next wave of AI innovation—one that reflects the breath and the best of humanity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working for us will place you at the forefront of AI innovation, providing access to our unique human data platform and opportunities for groundbreaking research. Join us to enjoy a competitive salary, benefits, and remote working within our impactful, mission-driven culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Links to more information on Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/prolific/dbc97f2b3ff24f1bb6fa834a2c9c3283?v=4f874e88e46a4f54afd8bf62f1db19ed&amp;amp;p=9f2c1de05dfa43338d48c20362bfead1&amp;amp;pm=c&quot;&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/prolific/dbc97f2b3ff24f1bb6fa834a2c9c3283?v=4f874e88e46a4f54afd8bf62f1db19ed&quot;&gt;External Handbook&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.prolific.com/&quot;&gt;Website&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@JoinProlific&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Statement&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you agree that Prolific may collect your personal data for recruiting and global organization planning. Prolific&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/prolific/Policy-Privacy-Notice-for-Candidates-f94a136a67544388b4888bc436451b57&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; explains what personal information Prolific may process, where Prolific may process your personal information, its purposes for processing your personal information, and the rights you can exercise over Prolific use of your personal information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;At Qualtrics, we create software that the world’s best brands use to deliver exceptional frontline experiences, build high-performing teams, and design products people love. But we are more than a platform. We are the creators and stewards of the Experience Management category serving over 18,000 clients globally. Building a category takes grit, determination, and an appreciation for the unconventional—but most of all it requires close-knit, high-functioning teams with an unwavering dedication to serving our customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When you join one of our teams, you’ll be part of a nimble group that’s empowered to set ambitious goals and move fast to achieve them. Strategic risks are encouraged, and complex problems are solved by collaborating and iterating until the best solution comes to light. You won’t have to look to find growth opportunities— they’ll find you. From retail to government to healthcare, we’re on a mission to bring humanity, connection, and empathy back to business. Join over 5,000 people across the globe who think that’s work worth doing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Principal Account Executive — ANZ Public Sector&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why We Have This Role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Principal Account Executive to lead growth across public sector and public utilities clients in ANZ from our Sydney hub. You’ll own complex, high-value opportunities that transform customer and employee experience through our SaaS XM platform, working directly with senior decision-makers (HR, marketing, executive leaders) and partnering with solutions consultants, services, marketing and customer success to design and close strategic programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Find Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes initiative and works entrepreneurially to navigate long, multi-stakeholder sales cycles and complex procurement processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds trusted senior relationships—influencing executives in HR, marketing and broader leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent quota achiever with a proven ability to develop pipeline, forecast accurately and close large deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at selling SaaS/business transformation software into public or commercial clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persuasive, tailored communicator: aligns value messaging to client goals and procurement requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative cross-functional partner who leverages product, services and marketing to create winning solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable to changing policy, market and client priorities in the public sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Grow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop as a strategic partner to government and utility leaders, influencing long-term transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deepen expertise in enterprise SaaS for experience management and business transformation across public sector use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand skills in negotiating large, complex deals and managing procurement &amp;amp; tender processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain visibility and influence across ANZ sales strategy and the broader product roadmap through customer insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue and pipeline growth across ANZ public sector and utilities: prospect, qualify and close target accounts to meet and exceed revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strategic account plans, power maps and tailored opportunity strategies, then execute demand-generation and stakeholder engagement to convert opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage and nurture stakeholders from champions to C-level, align on value and procurement timelines, and lock in long-term program outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate public procurement and deal execution. Lead tender/RFP responses where applicable and partner with legal, finance and sales ops to remove blockers and ensure compliant contracting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead tailored product demonstrations and craft commercial proposals with solutions consultants to maximise customer ROI and win probability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate a smooth transition to customer success and services teams, track adoption and outcomes, and drive renewal and expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For On Your Resume&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of SaaS or software sales with a strong track record of meeting/exceeding quota—experience selling enterprise or transformation solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success selling into public sector, utilities or similarly complex, procurement-driven markets is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging senior decision-makers in HR, marketing, executive or program leadership functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage long, complex sales cycles, produce reliable forecasts and build a qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation, presentation and consultative discovery skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using Salesforce.com (or similar CRMs) and working with cross-functional sales enablement resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant tertiary qualifications and familiarity with government procurement/tender processes are advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Should Know About This Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a high-performing ANZ public sector sales team focused on driving transformation through experience management technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role is consultative and strategic—ideal for sellers who enjoy complex deals, long-term programs and executive engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration is central: you’ll work closely with solutions consulting, services, marketing, legal and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team invests in development and promotes on performance—expect coaching, stretch targets and visible career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working here gives exposure to meaningful public-sector outcomes that impact large populations and communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team’s Favourite Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary + uncapped commissions and accelerators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance-based promotions—advancement driven by results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health insurance with comprehensive medical and extras coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience Leave — 5 additional days per year for experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working (typically 3 days in office / 2 from home) and commuter allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunches and a well-stocked kitchen at our North Sydney office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualtrics Hybrid Work Model&lt;/strong&gt;: Our hybrid work model is elegantly simple: we all gather in the office three days a week; Mondays and Thursdays, plus one day selected by your organisational leader. These purposeful in-person days in thoughtfully designed offices help us do our best work and harness the power of collaboration and innovation. For the rest of the week, work where you want, owning the integration of work and life. #hybrid&lt;/div&gt;
