&lt;li&gt;GCP and or Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working for a public company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open-source contributions or technical blog experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
