&lt;p&gt;As the Forward Deployed Engineering Manager, you will lead the team that puts Auterion&#39;s robotic systems to work with customers in the field. We build complete systems: vehicles, sensors, onboard compute, radio links, autonomy software, and ground control. Your job is to understand how all of it fits together and to make it work in real missions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead your team through the entire customer engagement, from discovery and integration to field trials and handover. You are not a hardware specialist. You are a systems engineer who can trace a problem across every layer of the system, lead people well, and earn the trust of demanding customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and grow a cross-functional team of Forward Deployed Engineers covering systems integration and software. Hire, coach, and develop your engineers. Build a culture of ownership and proactive problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountability:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep the bar high for yourself and your team. Work directly with stakeholders across the company. You will have a close relationship with the CTO, CEO, VP of Engineering, and the engineering directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Deployment Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Own technical delivery of customer deployments in demanding, non-standard environments. This covers system configuration, connectivity, mission readiness, and operation under environmental constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the technical lead for high-stakes customer integrations. Ensure the full system works end to end: vehicle, payloads, onboard compute, communication links, autonomy software, and ground control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Troubleshooting:&lt;/strong&gt; Diagnose failures across hardware, firmware, software, and communications. Use logs, telemetry, and structured debugging to find root causes fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary technical contact for defense and enterprise customers. Translate operational requirements into deployment plans that account for system performance, link quality, power, and mission constraints. Run technical meetings, demos, and field days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback Loop &amp;amp; Release Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Product and R&amp;amp;D to feed field results and real-world edge cases back into the product. Coordinate with R&amp;amp;D on platform releases so customer deployments stay current and stable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years in technical roles in robotics, drones, autonomous vehicles, or comparable complex embedded systems. You understand the full system end to end and how a change in one subsystem affects the others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years managing a technical, customer-facing team (Field Engineers, Forward Deployed Engineers, Solutions Architects, or similar). You have dealt with underperformance and built team culture deliberately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable working in Linux. You write Python, read C++, and use Git. You debug from logs and telemetry, not only at the bench.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand hardware at integration level: power, sensors, interfaces, and RF basics. You do not need to be a hardware designer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Deployment Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with field-deployed systems where &quot;turning it off and on again&quot; isn&#39;t always an option. Understanding of networking and radio communication is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crisis Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to troubleshoot critical failures in the field under high pressure and with limited physical access to the hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Composure and credibility in front of demanding customers. You communicate clearly with engineers and decision-makers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent English. German is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Authorization:&lt;/strong&gt; Must hold EU citizenship and be eligible to work in the European Union without restriction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, ArduPilot, or ROS2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in defense or government programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility for German security clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer at Auterion, you will play a pivotal role in the successful development, integration and deployment of Auterion-powered drone systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will collaborate closely with the production, hardware engineering, and firmware/software teams, as well as operations, ensuring that every platform transitions smoothly from an airframe concept into a fully validated flying robot ready for deployment. You will serve as the primary technical interface for partners, work closely with them to understand their technical requirements, configure and adapt existing solutions, contribute to core software development, and ensure successful implementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an engineer who enjoys combining hands-on technical work with customer collaboration and system-level problem solving, bridging the gap between hardware, firmware, and real-world flight performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate in a highly hands-on environment with evolving system requirements, rapidly iterating across hardware and software integration challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage software releases and perform firmware flashing and configuration using PX4 or adjacent autopilot ecosystems, including sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and system bring-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide deep avionics and airframe expertise, including autopilot tuning, sensor and payload integration, power systems and airworthiness considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to troubleshoot integration and flight-readiness issues while collaborating cross-functionally with hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, operations, and QC engineering to escalate complex challenges when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary technical authority in customer engagements, translating mission requirements into concrete system architectures and demonstrable solutions built on AuterionOS and Skynode.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in flight testing activities to validate platform stability, safety, and mission performance, resolving technical issues often directly in the field during customer trials and demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical documentation and continuous improvement of engineering processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed customer and market requirements back into product and engineering teams to influence the roadmap of the Auterion stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Software, Electrical, Mechanical, Aerospace or Robotics Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in C/C++ and Python: you can read, debug and patch existing code and write small tools and scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in Linux environments, including the command line, logs, Docker and basic networking (IP, TCP/UDP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on hardware-software integration: system bring-up, wiring and connectors, and embedded interfaces (UART, CAN, I2C, SPI) at a practical level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured troubleshooting: you can isolate whether a problem is software, hardware, configuration or RF, often under time pressure in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator: you can explain technical issues clearly to customers and operators, and report findings back to engineering in a way they can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel and work on-site with customers, including at test ranges and in field environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship (required for security clearance and customer requirements)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4 or ArduPilot, MAVLink, QGroundControl or mission planning tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UAV flight testing and validation in operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with datalinks and radio systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous customer-facing or field engineering role, especially with defense or government customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer (Python / TypeScript / Azure)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;London, UK (On-site) | £100,000-£150,000 + pre-IPO stock options&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the software behind some of the world’s most advanced radar systems.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CHAOS Industries is a defense tech company founded in 2022 that has raised $1B from investors including 8VC, Accel and Valor Equity Partners. You’ll build the backend services, data pipelines and operator-facing apps that turn raw sensor data into decisions people can act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build high-performance Python services that ingest, process and distribute real-time sensor data with low latency, high reliability and security at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the web apps (TypeScript and React) operators use to monitor live missions and investigate what the sensors saw&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build secure, scalable Azure services for distributed radar systems, defining the infrastructure as code and instrumentation for what you own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside software, hardware and systems engineers, and the teams who take these systems into the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence architecture and help define the engineering foundations of a fast-evolving platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re a fit if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable backend systems and owning production services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems and real-time data problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real leverage from AI coding tools, with a considered view on what to delegate and what not to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel: you’ll be based in our Soho office, and most of the team is in San Francisco, so expect to co-locate there for around a week each quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python for backend services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TypeScript and React for web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure and infrastructure as code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical, dental and vision for you and your dependents, 100% paid by the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% pension match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-IPO stock options, relocation assistance, and annual bonuses (coming soon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: &lt;/strong&gt;Right to work in the UK required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply now. &lt;/strong&gt;It takes just 2 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, CRM Lifecycle + Journeys&lt;/strong&gt; owns every triggered flow in the customer journey across email, SMS, push, and in-app for UK, Germany, and France. You will build the automation engine that runs Quince&#39;s retention programme: from the welcome series a UK customer sees the day we launch, to the win-back flow that recovers a French customer six months later.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a builder role. You will spend most of your first six months in Iterable and the CDP. You will write the flow logic, set up the data pipes, design the experiments, and ship the AI agents that take work out of building, testing, and reporting on flows. The Director, CRM owns the retention strategy and the campaign calendar. You own the triggered flow programme that runs alongside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two constraints shape this job. UK and EU privacy rules mean the US lifecycle playbook does not transfer unchanged: you will rebuild the identity-resolution layer and shift weight toward logged-in and app behaviour. Channel economics also differ across markets, with SMS in particular materially more expensive in Europe than in the US, so the sequencing of email, SMS, push, and in-app per flow per market is not the same as the US default.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be joining a team that values speed, candor, and rigour. This role is for you if you like building things, you can hold a roadmap in one hand and a SQL query in the other, and you have an opinion on how AI changes lifecycle work over the next 18 months.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e0c03b8d-8a8f-42ae-b3e9-26b5a2308ae6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, launch, and own every triggered lifecycle flow for UK (July 2026), DE (October 2026), and FR (November 2026): welcome, browse abandon, cart abandon, post-purchase, low stock, back in stock, win-back, replenishment, care instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with MarTech to Ship AI agents and tooling that take work out of flow build, copy, segmentation, and QA. Target at least one end-to-end CRM agent in production by EoY1 and a 50% reduction in flow concept-to-deployment time within 90 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Data team to run the triggered-flow testing roadmap with statistically sound design. Minimum 6 A/B tests per quarter per flow per market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build channel-cost decision logic across email, SMS, push, and in-app per flow per market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recover signal lost from fingerprinting and consent restrictions in UK/EU by pushing app and logged-in routing for non-consenting users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand up and run the localisation pipeline with freelance copywriters for EN-UK, DE, and FR. Localised flow content live before each market launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with tech team to maintain CDP quality across UK/EU: data model, integrations (Iterable, Attentive, app SDK, site events), data hygiene, latency, and identity-resolution accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2753&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ae6a13b-2175-4a37-a4c2-5839b2f592ae&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2769&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46937c2f-d543-4fbd-b76c-3593c6541fb4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Required: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years lifecycle/CRM marketing in DTC or ecommerce, including at least 3 years owning automated/triggered flows end to end (not campaign/blast).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with Iterable (preferred), or comparable ESP (Braze, Klaviyo, SFMC). Must have built flows in the tool, not just briefed them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with a CDP: Segment, mParticle, Hightouch, Census, or similar. Must understand identity resolution and data hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has built or deployed AI agents or LLM workflows in a marketing context (copy, segmentation, flow logic, QA). If you have not shipped one yet, you can describe the one you would ship in your first 90 days here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL proficient. Can self-serve in Looker, Lookr, or BigQuery without waiting for an analyst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A/B testing rigour. Knows what statistical significance means and where it breaks in lifecycle (sample size, primary metric selection, novelty effects).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of UK/EU privacy law (GDPR, PECR) and consent management. Understands what changes operationally when fingerprinting is restricted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented. Triggered flows live or die on edge cases (locale, currency, time zone, opt-in state, suppression rules).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional operator. Will work daily with creative, brand, data science, tech, and US CRM counterparts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3083&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbaae2d5-3e8d-43bb-be8c-e1c7e3b63382&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Preferred:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20322c78-4bdc-4d7a-af35-387a22f0e7ab&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Multi-market lifecycle experience (UK + DE or FR), fashion or home goods background, app-native lifecycle experience, fluency in DE or FR.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Director of Specialty Fibers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role ensures that every product made from cashmere, merino, yak, alpaca, and other luxury fibers meets Quince&#39;s uncompromising standards for quality, sustainability, and affordability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director blends deep technical expertise in fiber science with strategic supply chain leadership and cross-functional collaboration, serving as the central hub connecting sourcing, production, quality, and design teams across global markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Supply Chain Management&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate the end-to-end supply chain as the central hub connecting sourcing managers, production teams, and quality specialists to ensure a seamless, resilient, and efficient flow from fiber to finished yarn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor a diverse, specialized team of sourcing managers, quality engineers, and production experts, fostering a culture of continuous improvement and technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive multi-sourcing and nearshoring strategies to mitigate geopolitical and logistical risks while ensuring a stable supply of high-grade fibers from the Americas and Asia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the strategic direction for vertical integration opportunities, evaluating build-vs-buy decisions for spinning, dyeing, or finishing capabilities that could enhance quality control and margin structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key advisor to the executive team on fiber market trends, geopolitical risks (e.g., trade tariffs, export restrictions), climate impacts on raw material supply, and competitive intelligence—translating complex data into actionable business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion Quince&#39;s &quot;unreal prices&quot; mission by continuously identifying cost-leadership opportunities across the supply chain, from farm to finished yarn, without compromising ethical standards or product integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Supplier Development&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and curate a best-in-class supplier ecosystem, identifying, vetting, and onboarding mills, dehairers, spinners, and dye houses that meet Quince&#39;s exacting standards for quality, capacity, sustainability, and labor practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead supplier development programs, coaching strategic partners to improve yield, reduce defects, adopt sustainable practices, and achieve cost efficiencies that benefit both parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive traceability and transparency across the entire fiber supply chain, from herder cooperatives and farms to finished yarn. Partner with certification bodies (GOTS, RWS, GCS, ZQ) to ensure chain-of-custody integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make high-stakes sourcing decisions based on deep market intelligence—including auction prices, crop forecasts, currency fluctuations, and geopolitical developments—balancing short-term cost opportunities with long-term relationship value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Quality Assurance &amp;amp; Technical Optimization&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect the quality management system for all specialty fibers, defining standards, testing protocols, and approval workflows for raw fiber, dehaired fiber, tops, yarns, and finished goods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Senior Manager, Natural Fibers Quality to establish measurable quality benchmarks, including micron distribution, fiber length, tensile strength, yield, color fastness, and pilling resistance—ensuring every lot meets or exceeds luxury brand parity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee third-party lab testing and compliance, working with the Cashmere Spec/Test Report/Compliance Auditor to validate that all materials meet international standards (ISO, OEKO-TEX, GOTS, REACH) and Quince&#39;s internal specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead root-cause analysis for quality failures, implementing corrective and preventive actions (CAPA) across the supply chain. Drive a culture of &quot;quality at the source,&quot; empowering suppliers to self-detect and correct issues before production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product development and design teams to translate aesthetic and tactile visions into technical specifications—micron targets, twist levels, finishing treatments—that are manufacturable at scale and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the central point of communication for all fiber-related matters, providing technical expertise and clear direction to design, product development, and production teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate daily with domestic and overseas mills, dye houses, and suppliers to give precise, actionable feedback on fiber quality, color accuracy, availability and production timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate design and merchandising visions into clear, manufacturable technical briefs for suppliers, ensuring that product aesthetics and performance meet Quince&#39;s brand standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead blind panels with design, merchandising, and customer focus groups to validate luxury fiber perception and color accuracy before commercialization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Required&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Textile Science, Fiber Engineering, Material Science, Supply Chain Management, Color Chemistry, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in specialty fiber sourcing, yarn production, quality management, or coloration for apparel, accessories, or home textiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical knowledge of natural fibers (cashmere, merino, yak, alpaca, cotton), spinning processes (woolen, worsted)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience managing cross-functional teams in a fast-paced retail or manufacturing environment, with a track record of mentoring and developing talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cost analysis skills: cost-per-kilogram modeling, yield optimization, landed cost analysis, and budget management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining quality standards, and supplier compliance programs, including SKU rationalization and shade consolidation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to translate complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sustainable fibers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of supply chain traceability including blockchain or digital tracking systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with PLM systems and quality database management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in luxury goods (apparel, home and accessories) with an eye for premium aesthetics, handfeel, and trend forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager, Rapid Response Assignment - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Remote (Cheltenham, UK)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team: Product &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment Type: Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About VulnCheck&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exploitation prevention is only as strong as the intelligence driving those efforts, and most of the industry is still running on intelligence that lacks exploit context. VulnCheck, The Exploit Intelligence Company, delivers structured exploit intelligence on what is actively weaponized in the wild, purpose-built for the data lakes, ETL pipelines, automation, and AI and LLM workflows your infrastructure already runs on, raising the capability of everything it powers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an Engineering Manager to lead our Rapid Response organization - regionally-based teams in the US, UK, and APAC that keep our customers unblocked around the clock. You’ll manage engineering teams of senior ICs directly, set the technical and operational bar for the group, and make sure work is prioritised correctly across a demanding mix of urgent and long-term needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team sits at the intersection of Engineering, Customer Success, and Sales. Your teams handle urgent pre-sales requests, urgent customer issues, and other customer-driven feature requests, alongside the backend maintenance and integration work that keeps the platform stable. You’ll need to be equally comfortable setting engineering standards, coaching engineers, and triaging competing priorities across time zones. &lt;strong&gt;This is a 100% remote role, with preference for candidates located in Cheltenham, UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow engineering teams based in the US, UK, and APAC, providing hands-on people leadership, coaching, and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set priorities across urgent pre-sales requests, urgent customer issues, customer feature requests, and backend maintenance/integration work, balancing reactive and proactive work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure continuous, follow-the-sun coverage for urgent customer and pre-sales needs across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Customer Success and Sales leadership to understand customer and deal-critical needs and translate them into engineering plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and other Engineering teams to ensure customer-driven work is integrated into the broader platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the team&#39;s engineering quality bar, including code quality, root-cause practices, and long-term fixes over one-off patches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive hiring, onboarding, and performance management across all three regional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and refine on-call, escalation, and incident response processes for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on team health, throughput, and customer outcomes to engineering and company leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove blockers for your teams and stay close enough to the technical work to make credible calls under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience managing software engineers, ideally across distributed or multi-region teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity, vulnerability management, or threat intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience as a senior or staff software engineer, with credibility to engage in technical discussions and unblock your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing customer-facing, support, sustaining, or reliability engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to prioritize and sequence competing demands—urgent customer issues, pre-sales asks, and longer-term maintenance work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing teams across multiple time zones and regions, with strong async communication habits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of backend systems, APIs, distributed systems, and cloud infrastructure (AWS preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-obsessed mindset and a track record of turning technical challenges into strong customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to work effectively with customers, Sales, Customer Success, and other Engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data pipelines, ETL systems, or high-volume data processing is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience managing a customer reliability, sustaining, support, or escalation engineering function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CVE, NVD, KEV, or exploit intelligence datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting pre-sales or deal-critical technical requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in high-growth or startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe people do their best work when they feel supported, trusted, and valued. VulnCheck offers benefits designed to meet a wide range of needs and lifestyles, tailored to your country of employment:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous, flexible time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement/pension plan contributions (e.g., 401k with match in the US; local pension schemes elsewhere)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive healthcare coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-friendly environment with flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for home office costs (phone &amp;amp; internet)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing professional development, coaching, and learning resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for career advancement within a fast-growing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Specific benefit details vary by country and are confirmed during the offer process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built on over two decades of cybersecurity experience, our team of experts understands the intricacies of vulnerabilities, their exploitation in the wild, and how to leverage this data to build more effective cybersecurity products that produce better outcomes for organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck gives organizations a tactical advantage by providing best-in-class exploit &amp;amp; vulnerability intelligence information. We have a sense of duty to protect the critical infrastructure we rely on including medical devices, power grids and telecommunication networks. We were founded in 2021 in Lexington, Massachusetts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck has a transparent, collaborative, and supportive culture - we are looking for people who have a growth mindset, are curious and innovative. Our team is smart, but humble, hardworking, and supportive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck is proud to be an Equal Employer Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. VulnCheck is committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. *Even if your experience doesn’t perfectly align with the job description, we encourage you to apply—we value potential just as much as a perfect resume.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1etcwvt&quot; data-start=&quot;457&quot; data-end=&quot;510&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Senior Software Development Engineer in Test (SDET)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;512&quot; data-end=&quot;609&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;512&quot; data-end=&quot;525&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;544&quot; data-end=&quot;562&quot;&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;590&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;611&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;611&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;Advance your testing career while shaping digital finance with automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1hl1yo8&quot; data-start=&quot;690&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;693&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;Capco is growing our Engineering team and we&#39;re looking for experienced SDETs with a passion for delivering innovative solutions in financial services. If you enjoy solving complex problems, working with cloud-native technologies, and collaborating in agile teams, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1674&quot;&gt;As a Senior Software Development Engineer in Test (SDET) at Capco, you&#39;ll contribute to high-impact, client-facing projects that shape the future of financial services. You&#39;ll work alongside talented engineers, gain access to industry-leading training, and have opportunities to develop your expertise across multiple technology platforms and business domains within Financial Services &amp;amp; Energy. You&#39;ll also embrace AI-enabled ways of working, using approved AI and automation tools where appropriate to improve engineering productivity, accelerate test delivery, and enhance software quality while applying sound engineering judgement and responsible AI practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1xihhvk&quot; data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1697&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1679&quot; data-end=&quot;1697&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;2519&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;133qpt0&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;1901&quot;&gt;Design and implement robust, reusable, and scalable test strategies and automation frameworks, applying AI-enabled engineering approaches where appropriate to improve efficiency and test coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1k7tzn6&quot; data-start=&quot;1902&quot; data-end=&quot;2051&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain test artefacts, including test plans, specifications, automated scripts, and quality reporting to support end-to-end delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1h191g2&quot; data-start=&quot;2052&quot; data-end=&quot;2182&quot;&gt;Manage test environments and generate reliable, consistent test data to support functional, integration, and regression testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bknspb&quot; data-start=&quot;2183&quot; data-end=&quot;2304&quot;&gt;Execute &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;UI&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;API&lt;/em&gt; automation using modern testing frameworks while integrating automated testing into CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g57c0v&quot; data-start=&quot;2305&quot; data-end=&quot;2519&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineers and cross-functional teams to deliver quality-first solutions, encouraging the responsible use of approved AI tools and automation to improve collaboration and engineering outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;u9wmb5&quot; data-start=&quot;2521&quot; data-end=&quot;2550&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2524&quot; data-end=&quot;2550&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2552&quot; data-end=&quot;3212&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pxt3dg&quot; data-start=&quot;2552&quot; data-end=&quot;2660&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of at least one object-oriented programming language, such as &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Java&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Scala&lt;/em&gt;, or &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight hte8d84c36-3d11-4b5d-af91-f34d644d37f4&quot;&gt;JavaScript&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kwxspc&quot; data-start=&quot;2661&quot; data-end=&quot;2802&quot;&gt;Experience designing and building test automation frameworks using tools such as &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;Selenium&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;Cypress&lt;/em&gt;, Playwright, or equivalent technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;byn3hj&quot; data-start=&quot;2803&quot; data-end=&quot;2918&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;UI&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht233d6209-1330-41b6-a261-eee046307807&quot;&gt;API&lt;/em&gt; automation, alongside a solid understanding of quality engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x31mnm&quot; data-start=&quot;2919&quot; data-end=&quot;3024&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Jira, TestRail, Jenkins, GitHub, SonarQube, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ioaxep&quot; data-start=&quot;3025&quot; data-end=&quot;3212&quot;&gt;Experience using AI-enabled tools responsibly to improve engineering productivity while maintaining appropriate human oversight, governance, software quality, and testing standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;prnxb8&quot; data-start=&quot;3214&quot; data-end=&quot;3237&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3217&quot; data-end=&quot;3237&quot;&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3239&quot; data-end=&quot;3759&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5xqlcr&quot; data-start=&quot;3239&quot; data-end=&quot;3333&quot;&gt;Development experience with modern programming languages and software engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14tizzk&quot; data-start=&quot;3334&quot; data-end=&quot;3422&quot;&gt;Performance and load testing experience using JMeter, LoadRunner, or equivalent tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13gs17d&quot; data-start=&quot;3423&quot; data-end=&quot;3520&quot;&gt;Knowledge of DevOps practices and public cloud platforms including &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Azure&lt;/em&gt;, or Google Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;998qev&quot; data-start=&quot;3521&quot; data-end=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;Experience supporting cloud migration programmes and modern application delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xq87qu&quot; data-start=&quot;3605&quot; data-end=&quot;3759&quot;&gt;Curiosity to explore responsible AI, automation, and emerging quality engineering technologies to continually improve software testing and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1lla9of&quot; data-start=&quot;3761&quot; data-end=&quot;3782&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3764&quot; data-end=&quot;3782&quot;&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3784&quot; data-end=&quot;4159&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2dvy0w&quot; data-start=&quot;3784&quot; data-end=&quot;3861&quot;&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a87gyn&quot; data-start=&quot;3862&quot; data-end=&quot;3934&quot;&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bsqn1d&quot; data-start=&quot;3935&quot; data-end=&quot;4003&quot;&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19cv5mp&quot; data-start=&quot;4004&quot; data-end=&quot;4073&quot;&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16f0ika&quot; data-start=&quot;4074&quot; data-end=&quot;4159&quot;&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across Financial Services &amp;amp; Energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;asdj0h&quot; data-start=&quot;4161&quot; data-end=&quot;4176&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4164&quot; data-end=&quot;4176&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4178&quot; data-end=&quot;4278&quot;&gt;We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package designed to support every aspect of your life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4280&quot; data-end=&quot;5347&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sfk404&quot; data-start=&quot;4280&quot; data-end=&quot;4403&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4282&quot; data-end=&quot;4300&quot;&gt;Core Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yaj5pw&quot; data-start=&quot;4404&quot; data-end=&quot;4506&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4406&quot; data-end=&quot;4424&quot;&gt;Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pqxiiz&quot; data-start=&quot;4507&quot; data-end=&quot;4668&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4509&quot; data-end=&quot;4529&quot;&gt;Family-Friendly:&lt;/strong&gt; Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nwru6l&quot; data-start=&quot;4669&quot; data-end=&quot;4767&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4671&quot; data-end=&quot;4687&quot;&gt;Family Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Eight complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jxn220&quot; data-start=&quot;4768&quot; data-end=&quot;4886&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4770&quot; data-end=&quot;4794&quot;&gt;Holiday Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Five weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j8a7rs&quot; data-start=&quot;4887&quot; data-end=&quot;5128&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4889&quot; data-end=&quot;4913&quot;&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Your growth, your way—minimum &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4944&quot; data-end=&quot;4977&quot;&gt;40 hours of training annually&lt;/strong&gt; through workshops, certifications, and e-learning. You&#39;ll also be assigned a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;5055&quot; data-end=&quot;5086&quot;&gt;Business Coach from Day One&lt;/strong&gt; to support your professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ymgary&quot; data-start=&quot;5129&quot; data-end=&quot;5184&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;5131&quot; data-end=&quot;5153&quot;&gt;Healthcare Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Convenient online GP services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ehztlg&quot; data-start=&quot;5185&quot; data-end=&quot;5347&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;5187&quot; data-end=&quot;5203&quot;&gt;Extra Perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Wellhub (Gympass), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work, and dental insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;13k4p8o&quot; data-start=&quot;5349&quot; data-end=&quot;5374&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;5352&quot; data-end=&quot;5374&quot;&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5376&quot; data-end=&quot;5869&quot;&gt;We&#39;re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know - we&#39;ll be happy to help. We value each person&#39;s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;5686&quot; data-end=&quot;5707&quot;&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork&lt;/strong&gt; culture encourages individuality and collaboration - a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5376&quot; data-end=&quot;5869&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The Airbnb Hotels team is a fun, fast-growing group leading Airbnb’s expansion into the hotel sector. Operating with an entrepreneurial spirit, this team combines the simplicity, product excellence, and guest-centered ethos that define Airbnb. This team’s mission is to deliver the smoothest, most intuitive hotel booking experience for guests, while helping hotels easily drive incremental bookings so they can focus on delivering the best hospitality. The ultimate aim is to help more people discover high-quality hotels, creating value for guests and our hotel partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Key Account Manager on the Hotels Enterprise team, you will own the commercial relationship with a portfolio of global and multinational hotel groups in your region. Your goal is to turn introductions into signed agreements then into live, healthy, growing inventory by increasing participation, bookings and revenue across Airbnb and HotelTonight. You will lead the account planning cycle with each partner, negotiate and renew commercial terms, and be the single point of contact between their executives and many Airbnb teams including Connectivity, Product, Legal and Market Management teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for the end-to-end lifecycle from prospecting, to acquisition, contracting, rollout and performance management&amp;nbsp; of Key Account partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute a global win-win strategy for your portfolio that drives value to all parties and position Airbnb as a top strategic partner across all distribution channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Through the creation of mutual account plans with your partners you will design clear actions which deliver on the Objectives and KPIs of Airbnb and our Key Account Partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate agreements with partners to unlock new opportunities for both parties &amp;amp; promote long term mutual success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data to make decisions and design projects to best expand and enhance availability and revenue through existing partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor &amp;amp; analyze over/underperformance, market trends, growth opportunities or anomalies and regularly communicate performance to Executives leveraging available production data and global market insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with partners to ensure that the partnership is held to the highest industry standards and that commercial agreements as well as operational SLAs are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop close working relationships with key internal teams and individuals to ensure that they&amp;nbsp; provide appropriate levels of support to these key partnerships and key enhancements are made to unlock revenue for the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular business reviews, formal presentations for internal and external purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to execute changes at scale while collaborating with Market Management as a subject matter expert in Key Accounts accounts to drive local property performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively contribute to the development and standardization of Enterprise team processes, playbooks, and best practices across the global function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of Travel IndustryAccount Management experience; including 5 years in a Key Account Manager role with at least 2 years&amp;nbsp; being responsible for a global partner base.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of executing on strategic priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in analyzing, structuring and negotiating complex deals that align across multiple business unit needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation skills with a proven ability to structure and close high-value, complex deals that establish long-term, strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable performing data analysis and making decisions based on the results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance time spent between strategic initiatives and operations while diving into the details when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and selling complex business solutions at the C-Suite level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and the ability to effectively influence top leaders internally and within the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a passion for redefining travel, Airbnb, and being the best!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive self-starter able to prioritize and manage work autonomously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal/written communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel at least 50% of the time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United Kingdom Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£72,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£85,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

Our Global Structure
Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we're unlocking new possibilities as one global team.About the Team
Come help us build the world's most trusted on-demand logistics engine for delivery! We're building a team of great minds to help us secure and maintain a 24x7, no-downtime, global infrastructure system that powers DoorDash's multi-sided marketplace of consumers, merchants, and drivers.
About the Role
We're hiring a Senior GRC Engineer to help take DoorDash's compliance program from something people run to something the platform runs on its own. Reporting to the Security Compliance Manager, you'll take primary ownership of how regulatory and framework change gets tracked, interpreted, and turned into real controls - one part of a broader GRC function that spans audit, policy, and risk. Day to day, that means less time updating spreadsheets and more time writing the automation, integrations, and control logic that let audit evidence collect itself. You'll also lead major external audits from start to finish and help shape the policies and control standards the rest of the program is built on.This is a hands-on role for someone who already has deep audit and assurance experience, wants to spend more time building than briefing and can move a program forward, and change how people work, without needing the title to make it happen.
You're excited about this opportunity because you will…

Build the regulatory and framework change-management process that keeps DoorDash ahead of new obligations, instead of reacting to them.
Move manual, point-in-time compliance work onto Compliance-as-Code foundations: policy-as-code, automated control testing, and continuous evidence collection wired into CI/CD, so audit readiness holds up between audits, not just during them.
Design and run agentic workflows for evidence analysis, control testing, and audit response preparation, with a human in the loop where assurance demands it.
Partner directly with engineering and architecture teams to design controls into new systems at build time and translate that technical work into the narratives auditors actually need.
Partner with the Security Compliance Manager to shape and mature the global compliance program.&nbsp;
Design, implement and validate security controls relevant to DoorDash's regulatory environment, not just document them.
Support development and refinement of security policies, standards, and guidance.&nbsp;
Mentor other members of the compliance team and help set the technical bar the rest of the function grows into.
Ensure policies are actionable, testable, and aligned to real-world controls.&nbsp;

We're excited about you because you have…

5+ years of experience in security compliance, GRC or technology risk, with a strong track record in high-growth, technology-driven and regulated environments.&nbsp;
Hands-on experience building large language models and agent workflows with daily use of AI in your own work, grounded judgment on what to delegate to agents versus what needs a human, and the ability to evidence both to an auditor. DoorDash is an AI-forward organization and the ability to optimize efficiency using AI is crucial in this role.
The ideal candidate brings hands-on experience with frameworks such as DORA, the EU AI Act, NIS2 and CRA.&nbsp;
Real, hands-on experience implementing and assessing controls against frameworks like PCI DSS, SOC 2, ISO 27001 - not just reading them.
Demonstrated ability to identify control gaps, assess risk and drive remediation in partnership with cross-functional stakeholders.&nbsp;
Experience developing, implementing and improving security policies, standards, and procedures, ensuring they are operational and effective.
Strong understanding of compliance metrics and reporting, with the ability to track control effectiveness, audit outcomes, and risk exposure.&nbsp;
Ability to influence and drive accountability across technical and non-technical stakeholders.&nbsp;
Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to translate complex audit and compliance requirements into clear, actionable guidance.&nbsp;
Comfort owning compliance metrics and reporting - you can show, not just assert, that a program is working.
Bachelor's degree in Information Security, Computer Science, or related field, or equivalent practical experience.&nbsp;
Diversity, Equity and InclusionAt Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We're committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.
We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.
If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you'll have the opportunity to let us know once you've submitted your application. We'll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.
If you're excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we'd love to hear from you!
