&lt;p&gt;By providing your information, you acknowledge that you want Roku to contact you about job roles, that you have read Roku&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/roku-job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-job-applicants&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, and understand that Roku will use your information as described in that notice. If you do not wish to receive any communications from Roku regarding this role or similar roles in the future, you may unsubscribe at any time by emailing &lt;a ----- -----Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

