&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Team &amp;amp; About Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik&#39;s sales organization helps hospitals, banks, schools and government agencies stay resilient against cyberattacks, malicious insiders and operational disruption, and unstructured data on NAS is one of the fastest-growing and most exposed corners of the data estate. As Regional Director for NAS Cloud Direct, you&#39;ll build and lead the team of Product Line Specialists who own this number across your region, and you&#39;ll set the standard for how Rubrik wins in this market. You&#39;ll work hand in hand with Core Account Executives, Sales Engineering, Sales Development, Channel Development and our partners within the One Rubrik selling motion, with the enablement, autonomy and ownership to take your team, your career and your earnings as far as your results allow. You&#39;ll also be the consolidated voice of the field and the customer back to Product Management, Product Marketing and PnP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own bookings growth and quota attainment for NAS Cloud Direct across the region, building a regional plan that helps more organizations protect massive volumes of unstructured data without adding on-prem backup infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, hire, coach and develop a team of NAS Cloud Direct Sales Specialists, raising the bar on daily pipeline generation, net new logo acquisition and expansion within the existing Rubrik base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead from the front on strategic opportunities, joining key deals and guiding your team through complex data center and cloud design conversations and CxO-level selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a disciplined forecast and weekly operating rhythm, using MEDDPICC and COtM to keep pipeline honest and give leadership a number they can plan around&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with regional leaders in Core AE, Sales Engineering, Sales Development and Channel Development on coverage and account strategy, so specialists and Core AEs win together rather than compete for the same deal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable, partner-led momentum with distributors, resellers and VARs, turning co-sell relationships into a growing share of regional pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion NAS Cloud Direct inside and outside Rubrik, enabling the field on positioning, objection handling and competitive differentiation so more teams can sell it with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring market and customer feedback to Product Management and Product Marketing, shaping what we build next and how we take it to market, and share what&#39;s working with fellow Product Line Specialist leaders so the whole organization learns faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience You&#39;ll Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years leading quota-carrying field sales teams in technology, with a record of consistently overachieving as a leader and as a seller&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling or leading sales of data protection, storage, cloud infrastructure or NAS-related solutions into enterprise and mid-enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building pipeline across many accounts and verticals and landing net new logos, and of coaching others to do the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort guiding sellers as they position a technical product in complex data center and cloud environments and build champions with technical and business buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with channel partners, distributors and resellers to co-sell and grow a territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting discipline, a structured approach to deal qualification, and experience recruiting and developing high-performing sellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written, verbal and presentation skills, and the ability to influence peers, executives and cross-functional partners in sensitive situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to unstructured data challenges and enterprise NAS platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading product-specialist or overlay sales teams alongside Core AE organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the competitive landscape in data protection and cloud storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MEDDPICC for sales qualification and the COtM sales methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;The Rubrik Engineering team is comprised of people who produce extraordinary results. Our engineers are driven to build efficient, reliable, and cost-effective products. We believe in empowering our teams, giving engineers autonomy and responsibility, not just tasks. Our goal is to motivate and challenge you to do the best work of your career. As part of the Rubrik Engineering team, you will work closely with product managers, designers, and other engineers to define the next generation of products for Rubrik. At Rubrik, nothing will stop you from thinking big. We are looking for individuals who are comfortable with ambiguity and excited by the prospect of a challenge. If you have a positive attitude, high energy and limitless drive, and like to win, we want to talk to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Solutions Architect is a key sales specialist who brings deep technical expertise to the broader sales organisation. You will work with customers &amp;amp; prospects to educate how Rubrik protects and manages data across the enterprise estate, from virtualisation, physical servers, NAS, and databases to cloud, SaaS, and identity. You will own the technical side of the sale from first conversation to validated decision. That includes running proof of concept, producing technical documentation, diagrams and guiding complex, multi-stakeholder discussions.&amp;nbsp;You will also bring field insight back to Product and Engineering, test features before release, and help enable the wider sales team. Your technical credibility and influence with customers will drive results now and shape the product over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical conversations, in person and remote, with audiences from practitioners to executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with account teams to run in-depth discovery to connect technical capabilities to customer pain, risk, and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide complex engagements that involve several teams and competing priorities, such as infrastructure, applications, database, cloud, security, identity, and compliance. Build consensus among them and handle objections and competitive pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical win. Agree POC scope and success criteria with the customer, plan and deliver the POC, resolve blockers, and present results that support the business case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with technical implementation and validation of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design resilient backup, recovery, and cyber resilience architectures across hybrid and multi-cloud environments. Workloads include:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hypervisors and virtualized infrastructure (VMware, Hyper-V, Nutanix AHV). Physical servers (Windows, Linux). NAS and unstructured data. Enterprise databases (Oracle, SQL Server, and others). Public cloud workloads (AWS, Azure, GCP, OCI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on identity resilience and integration with identity providers (Entra, AD, Okta, Ping).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for automation through Infrastructure as Code and APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales and field enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with sales teams from initial discovery through technical validation, contributing to deal strategy and competitive positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and deliver presentations that enable systems engineers, and act as a technical resource for opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Management and Engineering to find and address product gaps, bringing real-world insight from POCs and customer deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote position with approximately 50% travel for onsite meetings, as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend internal meetings and events, in person and remote, as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in enterprise data protection, infrastructure, or a closely related focus area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with backup, high availability, and disaster recovery for enterprise workloads such as virtualization, physical servers, NAS, and databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering customer POCs or technical validations in complex enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing senior technical and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of at least one major cloud platform (AWS, Azure, or GCP), including identity, networking, and security fundamentals. Knowledge of identity providers (Entra, AD, Okta) is also valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting experience in a relevant language (Python, PowerShell, Bash, etc.). Terraform or similar IaC experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience giving technical presentations to small and large audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage your own time and projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addepar is a global data and AI platform empowering investment professionals to turn complex financial information into actionable intelligence. Addepar unifies portfolio, market and client data in a total portfolio view and delivers AI-powered insights within investment and client workflows. More than 1,500 firms in 60 countries use Addepar to manage and advise on nearly $10 trillion in assets. Its open platform integrates with 650 software, data and consulting partners to power end-to-end investment operations across firms of all sizes and levels of complexity. Addepar supports clients worldwide with offices in New York City, Salt Lake City, São Paulo, London, Edinburgh, Geneva, Warsaw, Dubai, Pune and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Product Marketing Manager to join our growing Product Marketing team and help shape how Addepar goes to market across EMEA, LATAM and APAC. You will become a trusted expert on the buyers, segments, market dynamics, competitive landscapes and regional nuances that influence how we position Addepar and engage prospects and clients in each market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with regional Sales, Relationship Management and Performance Marketing teams, along with Product and other go-to-market partners, to translate market insight into differentiated positioning, campaigns, enablement and launch strategies. This is a highly collaborative, hands-on role for a product marketer who can connect Addepar’s global platform narrative to the distinct needs, use cases and product availability of each region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must have, and maintain, the right to work in the United Kingdom from the first day of employment. Please note that visa sponsorship is not available for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute product marketing strategies for clients and prospects across EMEA, LATAM and APAC, aligned with company and platform priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build deep market expertise by understanding regional buyers, buying committees, client needs, competitive dynamics and cultural nuances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with regional Sales, Relationship Management and Performance Marketing teams to identify priorities and develop coordinated go-to-market programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define regional positioning and messaging that connects Addepar’s global value proposition to the needs of prospective buyers and existing clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt broader product launches for regional audiences and product availability, while owning end-to-end launches for region-specific capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop campaigns that generate awareness and demand among prospects while supporting engagement, adoption and expansion among clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create scalable content and enablement, monitor program performance and use market and stakeholder feedback to continually strengthen our approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8 years of product marketing or related go-to-market experience. Experience with B2B SaaS, financial services, fintech, wealth management or investment management is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-stack product marketer with experience across market research, positioning, messaging, launches, campaigns, enablement and content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience adapting go-to-market strategies for different markets, audiences or customer needs; direct experience in every region is not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent storyteller, writer and communicator who can translate sophisticated capabilities into clear customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional partner who can build trusted relationships with regional Sales, Marketing, Relationship Management and Product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Globally minded and curious, with the judgment to balance a consistent global narrative with meaningful regional differences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working independently across multiple priorities, collaborating across time zones and traveling internationally as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act Like an Owner - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Think and operate with intention, purpose and care. Own outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Together - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborate to unlock the best solutions. Deliver lasting value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Our Clients - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Exceed client expectations. Our clients’ success is our success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Innovation - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Be bold and unconstrained in problem solving. Transform the industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace Learning - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Engage our community to broaden our perspective. Bring a growth mindset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In addition to our core values, Addepar is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We seek to bring together diverse ideas, experiences, skill sets, perspectives, backgrounds and identities to drive innovative solutions. We commit to promoting a welcoming environment where inclusion and belonging are held as a shared responsibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;PHISHING SCAM WARNING: Addepar is among several companies recently made aware of a phishing scam involving con artists posing as hiring managers recruiting via email, text and social media. The imposters are creating misleading email accounts, conducting remote “interviews,” and making fake job offers in order to collect personal and financial information from unsuspecting individuals. Please be aware that no job offers will be made from Addepar without a formal interview process. Additionally, Addepar will not ask you to purchase equipment or supplies as part of your onboarding process. If you have any questions, please reach out to &lt;a ----------Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Tenable?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable® is the Exposure Management company. Over 40,000 organizations around the globe rely on Tenable to understand and reduce cyber risk. Our global employees support 65 percent of the Fortune 500, 50 percent of the Global 2000, and large government agencies. Come be part of our journey!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes Tenable such a great place to work?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ask a member of our team and they’ll answer, “Our people!” We work together to build and innovate best-in-class cybersecurity solutions for our customers; all while creating a culture of belonging, respect, and excellence where we can be our best selves. When you’re part of our #OneTenable team, you can expect to partner with some of the most talented and passionate people in the industry, and have the support and resources you need to do work that truly matters. We deliver results that exceed expectations and we win together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Director, EMEA Marketing, you have the opportunity to shape the strategy and execution of full stack marketing in Tenable’s fastest growing theater. This is a unique opportunity to operate as the region&#39;s marketing lead across: field and demand generation, channel marketing, advertising, communications, and social. You own the ideas and decisions that drive pipeline creation and advancement across EMEA, and you are the primary marketing partner to sales leadership in turning that strategy into bookings. You lead a team of proven regional marketing managers across the theater, and you report to the Global SVP, Revenue Marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Strategy &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as a “regional CMO” for EMEA — equally comfortable setting integrated marketing strategy, doing a brief on an ad campaign, reviewing a communications plan, or defending pipeline attribution in a QBR, rather than specializing in a single discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You are a member of the well respected Global Revenue Marketing leadership team that has dramatically shaped and shifted the Tenable brand and the very idea of marketing’s importance to the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Stay current on modern marketing technology and strategy (intent data, ABM, attribution modeling, AI-enabled marketing tools) and bring that fluency to how the theater’s marketing programs are built, measured, and evolve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with global marketing teams—including product marketing, brand, and corporate communications—to localize initiatives for the EMEA region while relaying critical regional needs back to headquarters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Pipeline Creation, Advancement &amp;amp; Attribution&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Redefine our integrated go-to-market plans with your new viewpoint across the regions to bridge company targets with local revenue benchmarks. Build long-lasting and collaborative partnerships with corporate functions and field sales executives to secure the alignment needed to drive marketing impact and efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive pipeline creation and progression across EMEA while measuring marketing&#39;s attribution to pipeline as a core measure of this role&#39;s success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and modern marketing/revenue technology — CRM, marketing automation, intent and account-based platforms, BI/analytics, and AI — to continuously identify where investment is and isn&#39;t converting, and YOU decided how to reallocate resources and program funds accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Team, Regional &amp;amp; Channel Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a leader that leads from the front, inspiring and driving a team across EMEA marketing, setting priorities, developing talent, and ensuring consistent execution across countries and sub-regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Maintain fiscal governance for the theater, overseeing resource allocation and fund distribution across sub-regions with clear strategic guidance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Representing Tenable at various events; from presenting to partner relations and customer insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As a channel-led organization, this position owns how distributors, resellers, and strategic partners are enabled, funded, and activated—utilizing MDF, joint marketing initiatives, and partner enablement programs to accelerate pipeline generation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Sales Partnership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary marketing partner to Tenable&#39;s EMEA Theater Sales SVP and country/segment sales leaders — co-owning pipeline coverage plans, forecast conversations, and go-to-market execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent marketing in regional sales leadership forums, with a clear point of view on where the pipeline is healthy, where it&#39;s at risk, and what marketing will do about it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;True understanding of the requirements from each regional sales leader from a market perspective.&amp;nbsp; Being present in each region at least once a year for sales relationship, partner meetings and team connect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of B2B marketing experience, including 5+ years in a marketing leadership role managing people and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated track record as a broad, full-funnel marketer —with a key focus on numbers as well as driving social media to cast a bigger shadow&amp;nbsp; Demand generation is core to your background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a marketing budget of comparable scale, with direct management of multi-million-dollar spend and influence over a larger pool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record partnering with sales leadership, including comfort presenting pipeline and marketing-attribution data to senior sales and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of channel/partner marketing dynamics — this is a channel-led business, and comfort working through distributors and resellers is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with modern marketing technology and strategy, including being AI-forward: marketing automation/CRM platforms, intent and account-based marketing tools, and data/analytics platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cybersecurity industry experience is strongly preferred; candidates from other B2B industries will be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required; no additional language requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in London, UK, with a hybrid work model; regular travel across the EMEA theater is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DD1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re committed to promoting Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) at Tenable - through all equal employment opportunity laws and regulations at the international, federal, state and local levels.&amp;nbsp; If you need a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please contact&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- for further assistance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tenable Data Consent Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable is committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal data. Depending on your location, one or more of the following notices may apply to you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_General_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;General Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_CCPA_Notice_Applicants_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_EEA_UK_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_6-4-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EU/EEA/UK Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;By bringing together next-gen technology and the finest live data available, Genius Sports is enabling a new era of sports for fans worldwide, delivering experiences that are more immersive, interactive and personalised than ever before. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.geniussports.com/about-us/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Learn more at geniussports.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Business Development Manager – Betting &amp;amp; Gaming Media to drive direct commercial relationships with Tier 1 and Tier 2 online Sportsbooks and Casino groups across Europe plus their agencies (if applicable).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior, hunter-led individual contributor role focused on new business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires deep programmatic expertise, strong understanding of sportsbook and casino marketing objectives, and the ability to translate live sports data, audience intelligence, and Deal ID-led buying into measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow direct programmatic revenue across Tier 1 and Tier 2 sportsbooks, casino operators based in Europe, selling both managed service programmatic solutions and Deal ID-based buying.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans aligned to your new business revenue goals, priority targeted operators, key sports, their season calendars, and in-game signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute end-to-end sales cycles across CTV, in-app, digital video, display, and DOOH channels, from initial strategic new business outreach through to deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell and activate managed service programmatic campaigns and Deal ID-based buying to operators and, where applicable, their internal programmatic media trading teams, leveraging the benefits of using Genius Sports’ proprietary data, audiences, and real-time sports signals for their Programmatic media activations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your pipeline management, forecasting, and revenue performance through Salesforce, with a focus on deal quality and scalable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of betting and gaming market dynamics, including regulatory considerations and competitive offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Genius Sports at key industry events and client forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BRING:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in digital and programmatic advertising new business sales, with ideally 2+ years specifically within iGaming, sportsbooks, online casino, or regulated betting environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of managed service programmatic models, DSPs, PMPs, PG, Deal IDs, audience targeting, in-app environments, and programmatic buying workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to sell performance-driven media tied to measurable outcomes such as acquisition, reactivation, retention, and lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning complex, enterprise-level sales cycles from initial strategy through to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with disciplined pipeline management and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build trusted, relationships with operator-side stakeholders (CMO, Head of Growth, Digital etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to demonstrate an entrepreneurial, self-directed approach, focused on new business and building scalable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We enjoy an ‘office-first’ culture and maximize opportunities to collaborate, connect and learn together. Our hybrid working models differ depending on your role and location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As well as a competitive salary and range of benefits, we’re committed to supporting employee wellbeing and helping you grow your skills, experience and career. Learn more about how rewarding life at Genius can be at&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.geniussports.com/reward/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reward | Genius Sports.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;One team, being brave, driving change&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive working environment, where everyone feels a sense of belonging and the ability to make a difference. Learn more about our values and culture at&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.geniussports.com/culture/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; Culture&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;| Genius Sports.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Let us know when you apply if you need any assistance during the recruiting process due to a disability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Why At Dotmatics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Dotmatics, a Siemens company,&amp;nbsp; we believe science, data, and decision-making must be deeply intertwined for innovation to thrive. Our Portfolio includes Luma, LumaLab Connect, ELN Platform, Graphpad Prism, Geneious, SnapGene, Protein Metrics, OMIQ, FCS Express, LabArchives, NQuery, EasyPanel, SoftGenetics and Virscidian.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have a vision for a new Lab of the Future that will change the future of scientific research.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have created the world’s most comprehensive digital science platform – best-of-breed software applications already used by more than 2 million scientists, together in a single ecosystem united by a powerful, flexible enterprise data platform. This is not flat data buried away in digital graveyards. This is dynamic, multi-dimensional decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scientific enterprises need a new level of effectiveness to achieve tomorrow’s breakthroughs. Illness will not wait. The biosphere will not wait. We are tireless in our vision, because the time for innovation is now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping the Future of Science At Dotmatics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global team of more than 800 colleagues are dedicated to supporting our customers in over 180 countries. Together, with our scientific community of users, we accelerate scientific innovation in order to make the world a healthier, cleaner, and safer place to live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a collaborative, global team pushing the boundaries of scientific innovation.&amp;nbsp; Your ideas and efforts will have a tangible impact, accelerating scientific progress and discovery. We offer a dynamic, remote-friendly environment that fosters high integrity and collaboration, empowering you to excel. Dotmatics is a company built by scientists, for scientists. Combined, we are now the world’s largest cloud-based scientific research R&amp;amp;D platform. We need your help to keep growing and pioneering the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are Science Driven. We are Customer Centric. We are Better Together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Director, EMEA Professional Services to lead our EMEA Platform Services organisation and drive delivery excellence across our scientific software portfolio.&amp;nbsp; Reporting to the VP, Global Professional Services, you will lead the regional delivery organisation through a management layer, initially comprising Application Scientist Managers and an India Services Manager responsible for both direct hires and outsourced delivery capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be accountable for regional delivery execution, commercial performance, customer governance, organisational capability and delivery excellence across EMEA, while helping shape the evolution of Professional Services as we continue our transition to Luma.&amp;nbsp; This is a regional business leadership role with accountability for services revenue, utilisation, margin, forecasting, delivery quality, customer outcomes and people leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the EMEA Services Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a high performing management team across scientific implementation and regional delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of accountability, collaboration and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an organisation capable of supporting both established Platform implementations and next generation Luma solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build management capability and succession across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead offshore resources&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Commercial Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own regional services bookings, revenue, utilisation, margin, forecasting and delivery predictability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, PreSales, Support and Customer Success to shape, scope and govern services engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong commercial discipline across Statements of Work, change control, financial management and resource planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify delivery risks early and drive practical mitigation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Customer Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior Professional Services leader for strategic EMEA customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted executive relationships with customer stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead executive governance, steering committees and major delivery escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure programmes consistently deliver quality outcomes, customer value and commercial success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen Delivery Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regional resource planning across Application Scientists, India-based teams and partner delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable delivery capacity through offshore teams and strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Global PMO to ensure consistent delivery governance, forecasting and project management standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement in delivery quality, operational maturity and implementation predictability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Across the Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Sales, PreSales, STS, Support, Customer Success, Product, Finance, Legal and Partner teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide implementation insight that helps shape product evolution and service offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Professional Services in planning for Luma, partner enablement and regional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the evolution of repeatable, scalable delivery models across the Platform business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt; an experienced Professional Services leader who combines commercial thinking with strong operational execution. You will bring experience in Scientific software, R&amp;amp;D informatics, ELN, LIMS, SDMS, lab automation and orchestration, data platforms or scientific workflow software or similar industry.&amp;nbsp; Ideally you will hold experience working in/with the Life sciences, pharma, biotech, chemicals, CROs or regulated research environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have a deep understanding of services delivering enterprise SaaS, cloud platforms, data platforms, digital transformation with complex workflow implementation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The key skills we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scientific software, R&amp;amp;D informatics, ELN, LIMS, SDMS, laboratory orchestration/automation or scientific workflow platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life sciences, Lab Automation, biotechnology, pharmaceutical or chemicals industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant leadership experience within Professional Services, consulting or enterprise software delivery..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading managers and building high performing regional organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of commercial metrics including revenue, utilisation, margin, forecasting and capacity planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex customer implementations and executive governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Statements of Work, project governance, scope management and change control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with Sales, PreSales, Support, Product, Customer Success and Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building offshore, partner or blended delivery models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and the ability to influence senior stakeholders across a global organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may also have;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise SaaS, cloud platforms or digital transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner-led delivery or systems integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PSA, CRM and project governance platforms such as OpenAir, Salesforce or Jira.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulated environments, including GxP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
