Requirement：












7+ years of experience in EU public policy, government affairs, regulatory affairs or a related field.&nbsp;
Strong understanding of EU policy making and regulatory processes.&nbsp;
Established relationships with European policymakers and regulators.&nbsp;
Experience leading policy strategies and stakeholder engagement.&nbsp;
Excellent communication, negotiation and public-speaking skills.
Background in automotive, mobility, transportation, autonomous vehicles or technology policy is preferred.&nbsp;
Well known German policy and German speaker is preferred.











