&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW51549985 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:57,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW155618744 BCX0&quot;&gt;As an Analytics Manager, you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;be responsible for&amp;nbsp;the development and delivery of measurement and insight projects across various marketing activities and&amp;nbsp;work with data strategists and&amp;nbsp;consultants to&amp;nbsp;answer business questions,&amp;nbsp;ultimately ensuring&amp;nbsp;that we are making best use of available data to deliver against the client vision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
