&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is&amp;nbsp;predominantly a&amp;nbsp;technical role grounded in&amp;nbsp;web analytics&amp;nbsp;data, so you should be experienced in handling large data sets&amp;nbsp;and a variety of web analytics tools.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Communication and interpersonal skills are important, both in collaborating with clients and colleagues across multiple disciplines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
