&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment by helping teams navigate tradeoffs between technical constraints, business goals, and user experience to deliver high-quality outcomes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-First Execution&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply an AI-first mindset to how you design and build—leveraging modern AI tooling, agent-driven workflows, and code-based prototyping to accelerate iteration and unlock new product possibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and engineering teams to shape how intelligent capabilities are integrated into real user workflows, ensuring outputs are transparent, trustworthy, and usable.&lt;/li&gt;
