&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Horizon Trading Solutions is an independent global technology company focused on electronic trading, supporting agency and principal business activities across equities and derivatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 20 years, we have equipped leading capital market participants with algorithmic trading technology and direct connectivity to more than 80 exchanges worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently looking for an Account Manager EMEA to strengthen to drive sustainable revenue growth and increase the value of Horizon’s existing client accounts by developing structured account plans, identifying upsell and cross-sell opportunities, securing renewals and strengthening relationships with key decision-makers. The Account Manager acts as the commercial owner of each account and coordinates internal teams to turn client knowledge into profitable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;1. Grow the Existing Client Portfolio&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage an account plan for each priority account, covering growth potential, stakeholder mapping, key challenges, competition, opportunities and actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, qualify and convert upsell, cross-sell, geographic expansion and functional expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a reliable, documented expansion pipeline and keep it regularly updated in the CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare business cases and commercial proposals, and lead negotiations and contracting through to closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;2. Secure Retention and Renewals&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate renewals and churn risks, with a retention plan shared with the relevant teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor product usage, client satisfaction, value delivered and commercial pain points across the portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead account reviews and executive business reviews, providing actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;3. Build Executive Relationships&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build lasting relationships with sponsors and decision-makers across business, IT, trading, operations and procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand each client’s strategy, organisation and priorities in order to develop new use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the voice of the client internally while protecting Horizon’s commercial interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;4. Coordinate Internal Execution&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate Client Services, Customer Delivery, Product, PreSales, Legal and Finance around the account objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clear handovers and follow through on commitments made to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share market signals, client needs and competitive insights that can inform the product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;5. Manage Performance&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track growth, retention, pipeline, forecast, stakeholder coverage and margin indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce evidence-based forecasts, explain variances and recommend corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to commercial discipline, sales methodologies and the team’s continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Expected Outcomes Within 12 Months&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% of priority accounts have an approved account plan that is updated quarterly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achievement of the annual recurring revenue and/or revenue expansion target across the assigned portfolio (quantified target to be defined).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A qualified expansion pipeline maintained at a level consistent with the annual objective (recommended benchmark: at least 3x the target).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Renewal rate and net revenue retention in line with agreed objectives, with no strategic renewal identified too late.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-threaded mapping of decision-makers and influencers across all strategic accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable monthly forecast, up-to-date CRM data, and clearly documented risks and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least five years of experience in account management, sales or complex B2B business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in finance or capital markets is mandatory: investment banking, brokerage, asset management, fintech, financial software or a comparable environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable results in growing existing accounts, complex negotiations and managing long sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage effectively with both business and technical stakeholders, including at executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of SaaS/licensing models, recurring revenue, renewals and account profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to trading technology, software platforms, APIs/connectivity or IT projects would be a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in French and English is essential; another European language would be an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Skills and Behaviours&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth mindset and results orientation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of financial markets and understanding of client challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account planning and prioritisation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing, active listening and relationship-building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial negotiation and value-based selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration and strong execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM discipline, forecasting and data-driven management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technological curiosity, autonomy and an entrepreneurial mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Horizon is an equal opportunity employer. We promote diversity, multiculturalism, and inclusion.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Modalités de travail:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Chez&amp;nbsp;GoDaddy, l’organisation du travail varie selon les équipes : certaines travaillent au bureau, d’autres en mode hybride, et d’autres entièrement à distance.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Sur Site:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ce poste s’exerce à temps plein sur site. Vous devez donc résider à une distance permettant de vous rendre régulièrement dans les locaux auxquels vous êtes rattaché(e).&amp;nbsp;Vous travaillerez sur ce site dès votre premier jour&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Rejoignez notre équipe :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;GoDaddy recherche un(e) Chef d’équipe de Data Center expérimenté(e) pour superviser les opérations quotidiennes de notre centre de données de Strasbourg. Vous encadrerez une équipe de techniciens chargée de la maintenance et du développement des infrastructures critiques qui assurent la continuité de services essentiels à l’activité, 24 h/24 et 7 j/7.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;En tant que membre de l’équipe de management du site, vous veillerez à assurer une couverture opérationnelle adaptée, à garantir la continuité des activités et à fournir des services fiables aux clients internes et externes. Vous collaborerez étroitement avec les ingénieurs, chefs de projet, équipes en charge des environnements critiques, fournisseurs et partenaires internes, tout en développant une équipe performante et en contribuant à l’amélioration continue des opérations du centre de données.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Votre&amp;nbsp;expérience&amp;nbsp;doit&amp;nbsp;inclure&amp;nbsp;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience confirmée en management et leadership d’équipes en charge des opérations techniques, dans un centre de données, une infrastructure ou un environnement&amp;nbsp;stratégique.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience dans le support de clients Enterprise et de services stratégiques pour l’entreprise, dans un environnement opérationnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Connaissances techniques dans au moins deux des domaines suivants : administration système (Linux et/ou Windows), réseaux, architecture des centres de données ou programmation/scripting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience dans la délégation des tâches, la gestion de la charge de travail, la formation et le développement des membres de l’équipe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience dans la coordination de projets opérationnels, l’amélioration des processus ainsi que la gestion de la documentation et du&amp;nbsp;reporting&amp;nbsp;opérationnels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Idéalement, vous disposez également de…&amp;nbsp;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience de 3 ans ou plus dans un centre de données, dans un rôle comportant des responsabilités d’encadrement, de supervision ou de management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Bonne connaissance des systèmes d’exploitation Linux et Windows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience avec Python, Bash, PowerShell, Java ou d’autres technologies de&amp;nbsp;scripting&amp;nbsp;et d’automatisation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Connaissance de RAID, SAN/NAS, de l’architecture x86, des systèmes d’exploitation, des infrastructures de stockage, des protocoles réseau et du diagnostic des problèmes de performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience avec&amp;nbsp;ServiceNow, CMDB, Jira, Confluence, Microsoft 365,&amp;nbsp;Workday&amp;nbsp;et des outils de gestion des stocks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience dans la mise en œuvre d’initiatives d’automatisation ou d’amélioration continue des opérations d’infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nos avantages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nous proposons une offre globale de rémunération et d’avantages pouvant inclure des congés payés, des dispositifs d’épargne retraite, des bonus ou primes, des actions, la participation à notre programme d’achat d’actions pour les salariés, une couverture santé compétitive ainsi que des avantages favorisant l’équilibre familial, notamment le congé parental. Les avantages proposés par&amp;nbsp;GoDaddy&amp;nbsp;varient selon le poste et le lieu de travail et pourront être présentés plus en détail au cours du processus de recrutement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;À propos de nous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;GoDaddy accompagne les entrepreneurs du monde entier en leur fournissant les outils et le soutien nécessaires pour réussir en ligne et rendre les opportunités accessibles au plus grand nombre. GoDaddy permet à chacun de donner vie à son idée, de créer un site web professionnel, d’attirer des clients, de vendre ses produits et services et de gérer son activité. Notre mission est de donner à nos clients les outils, les informations et l’accompagnement nécessaires pour transformer leurs idées et leur initiative en succès. Pour en savoir plus, consultez notre page &lt;a href=&quot;https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faboutus.godaddy.net%2Fabout-us%2Foverview%2Fdefault.aspx&amp;amp;data=05%7C01%7Cklilas%40godaddy.com%7C4a7c273441f14a72548908dab30d54f3%7Cd5f1622b14a345a6b069003f8dc4851f%7C0%7C0%7C638019167147789183%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=JKqNxY8z5E%2BjfKXCtVVYGLmGXuv31qCpLmWP960VLzo%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot;&gt;Chez&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot;&gt;GoDaddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot;&gt;, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des équipes contribue à créer de meilleurs produits. Notre culture valorise la diversité et l’inclusion des idées, des expériences et des perspectives. Nous intégrons les principes de diversité, d’équité, d’inclusion et d’appartenance dans notre façon de travailler, pour nos collaborateurs comme pour nos clients et nos activités. Pour en savoir plus sur nos engagements ainsi que sur nos données en matière de représentation et d’équité salariale, consultez notre rapport annuel &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.godaddy/diversity&quot;&gt;Diversity Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;sur notre page dédiée à la diversité.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nous célébrons également cette diversité au travers de nos C&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.godaddy/culture&quot;&gt;ulture&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;GoDaddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;est fier d’être un employeur garantissant l’égalité des chances. Les candidatures de personnes qualifiées ayant des antécédents judiciaires seront examinées conformément aux exigences légales locales et fédérales. Consultez&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;notre politique complète&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;en matière d’égalité des chances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;em&gt;Refer to our full&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.godaddy.com/legal/agreements/equal-opportunity-employment-statement&quot;&gt;EEO policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;Notre équipe de recrutement est à votre disposition pour vous accompagner dans votre candidature.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;Si&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;vous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;avez&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;des&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;questions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;contactez&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight MacChromeBold SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;a ---------- class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot;&gt;GoDaddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;n’accepte pas les candidatures spontanées transmises par des recruteurs ou des agences de recrutement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Modalités de travail:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Chez&amp;nbsp;GoDaddy, l’organisation du travail varie selon les équipes : certaines travaillent au bureau, d’autres en mode hybride, et d’autres entièrement à distance.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Sur Site:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ce poste s’exerce à temps plein sur site. Vous devez donc résider à une distance permettant de vous rendre régulièrement dans les locaux auxquels vous êtes rattaché(e). Vous travaillerez sur ce site dès votre premier jour&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Rejoignez notre équipe :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Chez&amp;nbsp;GoDaddy, notre infrastructure est au service de millions de clients à travers le monde. Nous recherchons un(e) Data Center Manager expérimenté(e) pour piloter les opérations, les équipes, la performance financière et la qualité des services de notre centre de données de Strasbourg.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;En tant que membre de l’équipe de management du site, vous déclinerez la stratégie de l’entreprise en actions concrètes à travers la planification des effectifs, le développement des talents, la gestion financière, la gouvernance opérationnelle et l’amélioration continue. Vous collaborerez avec les clients, les fournisseurs et les différentes équipes internes afin de garantir des opérations sûres, fiables et évolutives dans un environnement fonctionnant 24 h/24 et 7 j/7.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Votre&amp;nbsp;expérience&amp;nbsp;doit&amp;nbsp;inclure&amp;nbsp;….&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience confirmée en management et leadership, notamment dans l’encadrement de managers, le développement d’équipes responsabilisées et la conduite du changement organisationnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience dans le pilotage d’opérations au service de clients Enterprise et de services critiques pour l’activité.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience en gouvernance opérationnelle, gestion des risques, continuité d’activité, gestion budgétaire, prévisions et&amp;nbsp;reporting&amp;nbsp;auprès de la direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expertise technique dans au moins deux des domaines suivants : administration système (Linux et/ou Windows), réseaux, architecture des centres de données, programmation/scripting&amp;nbsp;ou automatisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience dans la mise en place de programmes de formation, de développement des compétences et de planification de la relève.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Idéalement, vous disposez également de…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Plus de 5 ans d’expérience dans les opérations de centres de données, d’infrastructures ou d’environnements critiques, avec des responsabilités croissantes en management d’équipes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Bonne connaissance des environnements Linux et Windows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience avec Python, Bash, PowerShell, Java, Perl, Ruby, PHP ou des technologies de&amp;nbsp;scripting&amp;nbsp;similaires.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Connaissance de RAID, SAN/NAS, de l’architecture x86, des processus de démarrage, des systèmes de fichiers et d’exploitation, des réseaux, des technologies de stockage et du diagnostic d’infrastructures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience dans la mise en œuvre d’initiatives d’automatisation, d’excellence opérationnelle ou d’amélioration des processus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience avec&amp;nbsp;ServiceNow, CMDB, Jira, Confluence, Microsoft 365,&amp;nbsp;Workday&amp;nbsp;et des outils de gestion des stocks.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nous vous encourageons à postuler même si votre expérience ou vos compétences ne correspondent pas à&amp;nbsp;tous les critères. Nous valorisons la diversité des parcours et les compétences transférables, et favorisons le développement et l’apprentissage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nos avantages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nous proposons une offre globale de rémunération et d’avantages pouvant inclure des congés payés, des dispositifs d’épargne retraite, des bonus ou primes, des actions, la participation à notre programme d’achat d’actions pour les salariés, une couverture santé compétitive ainsi que des avantages favorisant l’équilibre familial, notamment le congé parental. Les avantages proposés par&amp;nbsp;GoDaddy&amp;nbsp;varient selon le poste et le lieu de travail et pourront être présentés plus en détail au cours du processus de recrutement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;À propos de nous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;GoDaddy accompagne les entrepreneurs du monde entier en leur fournissant les outils et le soutien nécessaires pour réussir en ligne et rendre les opportunités accessibles au plus grand nombre. GoDaddy permet à chacun de donner vie à son idée, de créer un site web professionnel, d’attirer des clients, de vendre ses produits et services et de gérer son activité. Notre mission est de donner à nos clients les outils, les informations et l’accompagnement nécessaires pour transformer leurs idées et leur initiative en succès. Pour en savoir plus, consultez notre page &lt;a href=&quot;https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faboutus.godaddy.net%2Fabout-us%2Foverview%2Fdefault.aspx&amp;amp;data=05%7C01%7Cklilas%40godaddy.com%7C4a7c273441f14a72548908dab30d54f3%7Cd5f1622b14a345a6b069003f8dc4851f%7C0%7C0%7C638019167147789183%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=JKqNxY8z5E%2BjfKXCtVVYGLmGXuv31qCpLmWP960VLzo%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot;&gt;Chez&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot;&gt;GoDaddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot;&gt;, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des équipes contribue à créer de meilleurs produits. Notre culture valorise la diversité et l’inclusion des idées, des expériences et des perspectives. Nous intégrons les principes de diversité, d’équité, d’inclusion et d’appartenance dans notre façon de travailler, pour nos collaborateurs comme pour nos clients et nos activités. Pour en savoir plus sur nos engagements ainsi que sur nos données en matière de représentation et d’équité salariale, consultez notre rapport annuel &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.godaddy/diversity&quot;&gt;Diversity Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;sur notre page dédiée à la diversité.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nous célébrons également cette diversité au travers de nos C&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.godaddy/culture&quot;&gt;ulture&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;GoDaddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;est fier d’être un employeur garantissant l’égalité des chances. Les candidatures de personnes qualifiées ayant des antécédents judiciaires seront examinées conformément aux exigences légales locales et fédérales. Consultez&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;notre politique complète&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;en matière d’égalité des chances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;em&gt;Refer to our full&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.godaddy.com/legal/agreements/equal-opportunity-employment-statement&quot;&gt;EEO policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;Notre équipe de recrutement est à votre disposition pour vous accompagner dans votre candidature.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;Si&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;vous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;avez&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;des&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;questions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;contactez&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight MacChromeBold SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;a ---------- class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot;&gt;GoDaddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;n’accepte pas les candidatures spontanées transmises par des recruteurs ou des agences de recrutement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nous recrutons, pour renforcer nos équipes Sales, un.e Head of Alliances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Head of Alliances, vous pilotez le go-to-market de WPP Enterprise Solutions avec nos partenaires technologiques stratégiques (Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, Shopify) et les innovateurs de l’IA. Point de convergence entre nos partenaires, nos équipes commerciales et nos Business Units, vous transformez la force de l’écosystème en pipeline, en différenciation et en croissance. Comme l’ensemble de l’équipe de Business Développement, vous reposez sur un profil hybride dont les 2 piliers sont d’être :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsable du go-to-market conjoint avec nos partenaires technologiques stratégiques : co-construction des offres, des plans d’affaires et de la démarche de co-selling autour de nos &lt;em&gt;capabilities &lt;/em&gt;auprès de clients et prospects,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrateur de l’écosystème en interne : enablement des équipes, montée en compétence et certifications sur les plateformes partenaires, pour activer la bonne expertise au sein de WPP Enterprise Solutions et du réseau WPP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cette hybridation est la clé du succès : être à la fois moteur du business généré via l’écosystème partenaires et garant de la capacité des équipes à délivrer avec ces technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dimension Business :&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définit et déploie la stratégie de go-to-market et de marketing partenaires de WPP Enterprise Solutions avec ses partenaires technologiques stratégiques, afin de maximiser la valeur, la différenciation et le pipeline générés par l’écosystème,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construit et anime les plans d’affaires conjoints (joint business plans) avec chaque partenaire clé (Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, Shopify…), en pilotant objectifs, jalons et indicateurs de performance partagés,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestre le co-selling et le co-marketing : aligne partenaires, équipes commerciales et Business Units pour transformer les opportunités de l’écosystème en deals, du sourcing à la conversion,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conçoit et orchestre le plan d’événements dédiés ou co-construits avec les partenaires (webinaires, ateliers, salons, temps forts commerciaux), afin de générer visibilité, demande et pipeline,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Met en œuvre, en continu, l’excellence de la démarche partenaires via les processus et outils internes ainsi que les portails partenaires, à des fins de visibilité, de pilotage et d’animation globale en interne,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sécurise et défend les intérêts économique et contractuel de WPP Enterprise Solutions dans le cadre des accords de partenariat (referral, reselling, MDF, niveaux de partenariat),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilote le niveau de préférence et de mindshare de nos partenaires à notre égard : positionne WPP Enterprise Solutions comme partenaire de référence dans leur écosystème, fait progresser notre niveau de partenariat et suit la performance des objectifs conjoints,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribue au thought leadership de WPP Enterprise Solutions sur les enjeux d’écosystème et de plateformes (IA, data, commerce, CX), via des prises de parole conjointes valorisant nos réussites dans une logique de ROI business,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construit et fait vivre un patrimoine de connaissances sur l’écosystème technologique (roadmaps produits, niveaux et programmes de partenariat, dispositifs de financement) afin d’accélérer et de fluidifier l’action commerciale,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incarne, diffuse et fait vivre l’excellence du modèle partenaires en interne, en particulier auprès des communautés commerciale et managériale, pour l’inspirer et développer son réflexe écosystème.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dimension Enablement &amp;amp; Delivery :&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travaille de concert avec le CTO, à qui revient la responsabilité de l’enablement, des certifications et de la montée en compétences des équipes sur les plateformes partenaires ; il s’assure que ces chantiers progressent au rythme des priorités business et des engagements pris auprès des partenaires,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Veille à la disponibilité et à la capitalisation des assets conjoints (cas clients, références, supports de co-vente) et au partage des retours d’expérience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous justifiez de 5 à 10 ans d’expérience, dont une expérience significative en alliances / partenariats technologiques, channel ou business development – idéalement acquise en cabinet de conseil, ESN, agence ou chez un éditeur / hyperscaler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre croissance reposant sur un écosystème de partenaires technologiques (Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, Shopify…), vous maîtrisez les mécaniques de co-selling, de co-marketing et de joint business planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous pouvez justifier de contributions ou de succès significatifs dans le cadre d’initiatives partenaires ou de développement business, au-delà d’en comprendre la logique ou les bonnes pratiques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre capacité à nouer des relations de grande qualité, tant avec les équipes partenaires (alliance managers, channel, avant-vente) qu’avec les décideurs internes (Directions commerciales, Business Units, Marketing), fait de vous un orchestrateur d’écosystème performant, du sourcing d’opportunités à la conclusion de deals conjoints équilibrant les intérêts du partenaire, du client et de WPP Enterprise Solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les enjeux des plateformes technologiques et de l’écosystème IA / data / commerce vous passionnent, et vous savez vous appuyer sur vos expériences pour bâtir un discours solide en interne comme auprès des partenaires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre rigueur et votre curiosité font de vous un acteur à la fois à l’aise dans la logique de développement business sur des clients existants que sur de la conquête opportuniste, ou en relai d’un partenaire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La maîtrise de l’anglais, à l’oral comme à l’écrit, est indispensable : vous adressez des partenaires et des interlocuteurs internationaux de manière totalement autonome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tous nos postes sont ouverts aux personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous proposons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote partiel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prise en charge à 75% des transports en commun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une carte restaurant à 11€/jour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cours d&#39;anglais, massages, yoga&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soirées et team building réguliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intégrer WPP Enterprise Solutions, c’est choisir d’évoluer dans un environnement dynamique, humain et innovant, propice au développement de chacun, à la réalisation de missions enrichissantes et aux évolutions de carrière. Nous rejoindre, c’est participer à une aventure collective au service de l’épanouissement personnel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;At Databricks we work on some of the most complex distributed processing and machine learning problems in the world and our customers challenge us with interesting new big data and AI use cases. You will shape the future of big data and the machine learning landscape for leading Fortune 500 organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed Engineering (FDE) Delivery Partner Manager &lt;/strong&gt;supports the mission of the Professional Services team, which is to&lt;strong&gt; accelerate and de-risk our customers&#39; business outcomes&lt;/strong&gt; through effective enablement and delivery of Databricks platform technology. This is an individual contributor role that will oversee the Databricks Delivery Partner Program which looks to use close partnerships with key system integrators to effectively co-deliver Databricks services engagements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work with the FDE team in order to use &lt;strong&gt;Databricks delivery partners to accelerate our customer project outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop FDE relationships with &lt;strong&gt;Global System Integrators (GSIs), Regional System Integrators (RSIs), regional Partner team &lt;/strong&gt;to support bi-directional pipeline review and bi-directional engagements (subcontracting, and advisory) for company priorities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a &lt;strong&gt;RFP process&lt;/strong&gt; to support Partner Selection for large complex multi year, multi phase &lt;strong&gt;migration&lt;/strong&gt; deals. Create templates, scorecards to supplement partner selection with a data driven approach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead and lead efforts to incubate and ramp new partners with &lt;strong&gt;Gen AI&lt;/strong&gt; capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive MBRs and QBRs with &lt;strong&gt;priority partners&lt;/strong&gt;, and develop long term roadmaps for PS Partner delivery priorities. Develop scorecards and feedback loops to segment partners by focus areas, regions and company priorities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive&lt;strong&gt; delivery governance&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure partner quality and delivery on Services led and partner supported implementations. Support global programs to measure partner quality such as CSAT, Partner Survey and program governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead programs that align with our &lt;strong&gt;FDE &amp;amp; Partner strategy &lt;/strong&gt;for Assurance and advisory services. Work with our cross-functional channel teams to enable GSIs, RSIs, SIs on Assurance services, and support bi-weekly reviews and deal governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support &lt;strong&gt;Partner IP efforts&lt;/strong&gt; such as the creation of service delivery kits to better scale our ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaison with Delivery Partner organizations to ensure personnel have the required level of training and certification in order to achieve Databricks projects following best practices. Champion and provide thought leadership for &lt;strong&gt;specialization &lt;/strong&gt;programs. You will implement and lead programs for achieving requirements and exceeding delivery quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain an &lt;strong&gt;effective onboarding process for partner resources&lt;/strong&gt; ensuring effective utilization and quality of services across Databricks customer deliveries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the &lt;strong&gt;Databricks resource management team &lt;/strong&gt;to oversee the pipeline planning process with each of the delivery partners, ensuring partner resource availability in a timely manner to support Databricks services opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocation and outsourcing of Projects to Services partners. This includes selecting the appropriate partner for the project and working with the partner closely to ensure project success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our legal, people operations and other cross functional organization to &lt;strong&gt;support bi directional contractual negotiations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for the Partner&#39;s needs internally; managing any escalations and issues on projects being delivered by partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, implement, and monitor Key Performance Indicators for each Services partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach, Mentor junior members of the team, and partner resource&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive industry experience including resource management and demand pipeline management and record of success in navigating and driving engagements with large enterprise organizations with a focus on FDE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience within a FDE or consulting organization as a partner Manager, and/or Consulting Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing partner or third-party organization enablement including upskilling teams to provide delivery capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at working directly with Partners and customers to gather, prioritize, plan and execute solutions to customer business requirements as they relate to technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing commercial agreements with partners including statements of works to support services management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;FEQ227R207&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Field Engineering Manager, you will lead a talented team of technical pre-sales Solutions Architects and Solutions Engineers based in France. You’ll play a key leadership role at the intersection of technology and business, helping our teams design value-based solutions and drive growth through effective collaboration with Sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll coach your team to communicate complex ideas clearly, support strategic sales cycles, and build strong partnerships with customers and stakeholders across large organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a high-performing pre-sales team in France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster an inclusive and collaborative culture that reflects Databricks’ values of customer obsession, teamwork, and diversity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales to drive growth through solution- and value-based selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance team effectiveness by establishing best practices that improve efficiency and focus on business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with customer executives and strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across teams—including Marketing, Sales, and Services—to ensure seamless implementation and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Databricks as part of the regional leadership team and contribute to building our brand and presence in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing technical teams in Big Data, Cloud, or SaaS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading, mentoring, and scaling pre-sales or technical field organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of consumption-based business models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively with Sales and other cross-functional leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills—fluent in English and native-level French.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background in Data Engineering, Databases, or Data Science (consulting experience is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for data, AI, and cloud technologies and the ability to articulate their business value clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: Location for the role is in Paris (i.e. within commutable distance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. AI is becoming the engine of that communication. Integrations are what give that engine teeth: the data, the tools, the systems that turn a clever agent into one that actually closes loops.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Product Manager to join our Integrations team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll own the surface that decides whether our AI agents are clever demos or systems that actually do work. CRM sync, appointment bookings, call transfers, custom workflows: every action our agents take in the real world runs through your team. Plus our public API, webhooks, and the developer experience that lets partners build on top of us. If you&#39;re excited to design APIs, ship agent tooling, and own a surface that gets more strategic every quarter, this might be a great fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re reshaping our product function around three pillars, AI, Integrations, and Core, with a PM in each, operating directly with our founder and CPO Mika. This role is for Integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Learn how product is built from the inside, working side by side with our CPO.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As our Associate Product Manager, you&#39;ll work directly with our CPO as a force multiplier for the product team. You&#39;ll take on high-impact work across customer research, product data, product marketing and adoption - topics that span the whole product org rather than a single product area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Who We Want&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hungry learner&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re eager to learn fast, actively seek feedback and turn it into visible progress within weeks, not months.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured self-starter&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re highly organized, bring order to messy situations and get things done without step-by-step guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical thinker&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with data and can pull numbers from spreadsheets or analytics tools and turn them into clear insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-curious&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You enjoy talking to users, ask good follow-up questions and turn interviews into actionable takeaways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You write crisply, build clean slides and feel comfortable presenting to customers, e.g. in webinars.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scrappy generalist&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re happy to switch between product marketing, data, research and ops, and no task is &quot;beneath you&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You use AI tools daily to work faster and better - from research and data analysis to drafting content and slides - and you&#39;re always experimenting with new ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Has taste&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You have a strong sense for what good looks like in product, design and writing, and you notice when something feels off, even if it&#39;s &quot;technically fine&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re fluent in English, written and spoken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Who We Don&#39;t Want&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You only want &quot;pure PM&quot; work like roadmaps and specs and aren&#39;t interested in marketing or customer-facing tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You need a lot of structure and clear processes to be productive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You struggle to communicate clearly in English, in writing or in front of an audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You get defensive when receiving feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You see this mainly as a title step rather than a chance to learn and get hands-on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day to Day&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Strategic Projects (~25%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with our CPO on the topics that matter most right now&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare leadership meetings, drive decisions forward and make sure priorities turn into results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Product Marketing &amp;amp; Launches (~35%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and run initiatives that bring our product to customers: webinars, product updates, customer events, newsletters and educational content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and launch new features end-to-end together with Product, Engineering and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build sharp slides and reports for customers and leadership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-lfile-container=&quot;df4b3f91-b87e-448a-89b1-dc2439ff8611&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Customer Research (~20%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run customer interviews and turn what you hear into clear insights for the product team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed those insights into roadmap decisions together with our PMs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Product Analytics &amp;amp; Adoption (~20%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own dashboards on activation and adoption and turn the numbers into actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives that improve activation and adoption of key features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Managers:&lt;/strong&gt; Feed customer insights and data into roadmap decisions and support with research, specs and launch prep&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering &amp;amp; Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Clarify requirements, gather product feedback and coordinate release timing for launches&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify customers for interviews and work together on onboarding, activation and adoption initiatives&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Build enablement material and slides, and align on positioning and messaging for new features&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing:&lt;/strong&gt; Co-own product launches, webinars, release content and campaigns&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers:&lt;/strong&gt; Run interviews and webinars, collect feedback and turn it into insights for the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Why People Choose Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe in the power of in-person collaboration: We&#39;re an in-office culture at heart - we genuinely love being together in the Berlin office. That&#39;s where the best ideas happen, decisions move faster, and we learn from and grow with each other every day. We do offer some flexibility for remote work, but our default and our energy is being in the room together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re an international team with diverse cultural backgrounds and languages. Openness, mutual respect, and the exchange of different perspectives shape the way we work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value ambition and drive. We&#39;re looking for people who take ownership, show initiative, and are excited to grow quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work with a high degree of ownership and a strong learning mindset. Asking questions, staying curious, and continuously improving are part of our everyday culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We care deeply about humility and teamwork. No egos, open feedback, and a willingness to learn from one another matter more to us than titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose between an Urban Sports Club or John Reed membership, or a public transport pass/Dance subscription.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company-wide and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual €500 learning and development budget that you can use for conferences, courses, books, career coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and exciting startup culture that supports rapid professional and personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A beautiful office in the heart of Berlin (Prenzlauer Allee 242) with free snacks, drinks, and top-notch equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to build a community, not just a company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creating an environment where people genuinely enjoy spending time together is important to us - whether that&#39;s through HYROX training, golf, beer pong tournaments, running clubs, Warhammer, weekend activities, or any other community you&#39;d like to build here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe that diversity makes companies stronger. We welcome applications from everyone, regardless of gender, background, nationality, or religion. Feel free to apply - we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our Privacy Policy.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to receiving your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is located in Munich, Germany. TULIP is a hybrid work environment and we are in the office 3+ days/per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/&quot;&gt;TULIP&lt;/a&gt; is the frontline operations platform that helps manufacturers digitize, connect and continuously improve how they run production, with AI at the core of the product. TULIP was founded out of the MIT Media Lab. It is headquartered in Boston, has offices in Munich, Tokyo, Tel Aviv, Budapest and Singapore, and has customer sites in more than 45 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In January 2026, TULIP &lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/press/tulip-secures-120m-series-d/&quot;&gt;closed its $120M Series D&lt;/a&gt;, at a valuation of $1.3B. Leading global manufacturers run on TULIP, including VEKA, DMG Mori, Roche, AstraZeneca, Richemont, Saint-Gobain Aerospace and Mitsubishi Electric. We partner with NVIDIA, PwC, McKinsey, BCG and more than 160 technology partners worldwide. TULIP is part of the World Economic Forum&#39;s Global Innovator community, and our CEO, Dr. Natan Linder, co-chairs the Forum&#39;s Advanced Manufacturing Industry Governors Community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity in DACH for TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DACH is the heart of global manufacturing. Germany is Europe&#39;s largest industrial economy and the birthplace of Industrie 4.0. Switzerland is a global centre for pharma, life sciences and precision manufacturing. Austria is a strong base in automotive, machinery, metals and semiconductors. The region is also home to many of the world&#39;s &quot;Hidden Champions&quot;, mid-sized companies that lead global niche markets. Today, these companies face similar pressures: fewer skilled workers, rising quality and compliance demands, and the need to modernize existing plants without stopping production. TULIP gives their frontline teams an AI-native production system to meet those pressures and accelerate time-to-value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TULIP GmbH is a full operating entity and Munich is TULIP’s headquarters in Europe. The team covers sales, solutions engineering, pre-sales engineering, customer success, and R&amp;amp;D. Local customers trust our product in regulated, high-precision environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ve seen the challenges of day-to-day manufacturing operations firsthand — the inefficiencies, the untapped potential, and everything in between. You believe technology should make people&#39;s jobs better, not harder, and you&#39;re energized by the challenge of making that happen. You&#39;re humble, curious, and just as comfortable presenting to a C-suite executive as you are walking a production line. You thrive in fast-moving environments, take ownership of what you build, and genuinely care about the customers you work with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What skills do I need?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in manufacturing, operations technology, or a related field, with demonstrated customer-facing project leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in Operations Technology, including MES, ERP, or similar systems; architecting and implementation experience within the &lt;strong&gt;Life Sciences industry, specifically in pharmaceuticals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in system and device integration in the manufacturing industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record leading Lean Manufacturing or continuous improvement initiatives; ability to walk a shop floor and identify opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management, organization, and communication skills: written and verbal, with experience managing enterprise-level engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25% travel expected within Europe&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS in Engineering or similar field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customers to deeply understand their operational challenges, goals, and success criteria - supporting solution architecture for their specific processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work side-by-side with customers and partners to develop, configure, and implement Tulip solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support delivery of enterprise-level customer projects from kickoff through delivery, ensuring on-time, high-quality outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain trusted relationships across customer organizations, from the shop floor to the C-suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing technical support to customers, diagnosing issues and driving resolution with urgency and care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage knowledge of OT/IT systems (MES, ERP, device integration) to guide customers through complex implementation decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a consistent voice of the customer internally — surfacing insights, patterns, and feedback to Product and Engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and improvement of internal processes, playbooks, and delivery frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working At Tulip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We know even great candidates experience imposter syndrome. Even if you don’t match every requirement, applying gives you the opportunity to be considered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a strong, diverse team that values hard work, families, and personal well-being. Benefits of working with us include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct impact on product and culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual company events and happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office catered lunches and stocked kitchens&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer. At Tulip, we celebrate all. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status. Help us build an inclusive community that will transform frontline operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note that we may use AI-based tools to support parts of our hiring process. All data processing is carried out in compliance with local data protection laws, ensuring all personal candidate information is handled securely and ethically.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is located in Munich, Germany. TULIP is a hybrid work environment and we are in the office 3+ days/per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/&quot;&gt;TULIP&lt;/a&gt; is the frontline operations platform that helps manufacturers digitize, connect and continuously improve how they run production, with AI at the core of the product. TULIP was founded out of the MIT Media Lab. It is headquartered in Boston, has offices in Munich, Tokyo, Tel Aviv, Budapest and Singapore, and has customer sites in more than 45 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In January 2026, TULIP &lt;a href=&quot;https://tulip.co/press/tulip-secures-120m-series-d/&quot;&gt;closed its $120M Series D&lt;/a&gt;, at a valuation of $1.3B. Leading global manufacturers run on TULIP, including VEKA, DMG Mori, Roche, AstraZeneca, Richemont, Saint-Gobain Aerospace and Mitsubishi Electric. We partner with NVIDIA, PwC, McKinsey, BCG and more than 160 technology partners worldwide. TULIP is part of the World Economic Forum&#39;s Global Innovator community, and our CEO, Dr. Natan Linder, co-chairs the Forum&#39;s Advanced Manufacturing Industry Governors Community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity in DACH for TULIP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DACH is the heart of global manufacturing. Germany is Europe&#39;s largest industrial economy and the birthplace of Industrie 4.0. Switzerland is a global centre for pharma, life sciences and precision manufacturing. Austria is a strong base in automotive, machinery, metals and semiconductors. The region is also home to many of the world&#39;s &quot;Hidden Champions&quot;, mid-sized companies that lead global niche markets. Today, these companies face similar pressures: fewer skilled workers, rising quality and compliance demands, and the need to modernize existing plants without stopping production. TULIP gives their frontline teams an AI-native production system to meet those pressures and accelerate time-to-value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TULIP GmbH is a full operating entity and Munich is TULIP’s headquarters in Europe. The team covers sales, solutions engineering, pre-sales engineering, customer success, and R&amp;amp;D. Local customers trust our product in regulated, high-precision environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and talented individual to join our delivery team in our Munich office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You know the challenges in manufacturing and operations, and you believe in putting the operator in the center&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You can take on and lead projects with complex stakeholder landscapes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You are comfortable communicating with customer stakeholders from the shop floor to the C-suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You’re flexible and can thrive in environments that don’t have defined processes, and you’re excited to help build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;those processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You have experience working in a startup environment or at a minimum are ready to take the plunge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What skills do I need?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;BS Degree: Industrial Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Engineering Management, Computer Science or a&amp;nbsp;related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;5+ years of work experience; prior experience in project management and manufacturing or process engineering is -&amp;nbsp;a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Exceptional analytical and problem-solving skills, with a keen eye for detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Basic coding skills and familiarity with SQL and REST API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Proactive, self-starter attitude with a willingness to learn and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Fluency in English &amp;amp; German is reuired, French - a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;A strong track record of academic excellence and a passion for continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Manage and execute enterprise-level customer projects using Tulip No-Code platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Work side by side with customers and partners to develop and implement Tulip solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Provide ongoing customer technical support and build and maintain relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Contribute to internal process building, improvement, and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the engineering and product teams to provide insights and feedback based on customer&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Working At Tulip&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working At Tulip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know even great candidates experience imposter syndrome. Even if you don’t match every requirement, applying gives you the opportunity to be considered.&amp;nbsp; We’re building a strong, diverse team that values hard work, families, and personal well-being. Benefits of working with us include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct impact on product and culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits package including Health, Dental, Vision, Short-term Disability, Long-term Disability, Life Insurance, AD&amp;amp;D Insurance, Flexible Spending Account (FSA), Commuter Benefits, Parental Leave, and 401(K)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule and unlimited vacation policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual company events and happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness subsidies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, dog-friendly office with diverse and inspiring colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. At Tulip, we celebrate all. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status. Help us build an inclusive community that will transform frontline operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note that we may use AI-based tools to support parts of our hiring process. All data processing is carried out in compliance with local data protection laws, ensuring all personal candidate information is handled securely and ethically.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1000&quot; data-local-id=&quot;74cb0e4e-11e1-4b83-bd54-c890cd36d90c&quot;&gt;Wir bei flaconi glauben, dass Diversität Kreativität, Innovation und Wachstum fördert. Diese Diversität lebt in allen Formen von Beauty. Deshalb ist auch unser Team ein Mosaik aus Menschen mit unterschiedlichen Hintergründen, Kulturen und Lebenswegen, die eine gemeinsame Leidenschaft für die Beauty-Welt verbindet. Unser Engagement basiert auf unseren Grundwerten, insbesondere #trustinpeople. Wir übernehmen bewusst die Verantwortung für ein Umfeld, in dem jede:r Mitarbeiter:in aufrichtig wertgeschätzt und gehört wird und in dem jede:r die Möglichkeit hat, eine einzigartige Perspektive einzubringen, um das Gefühl der Zugehörigkeit zu stärken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1650&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22e776e5-b9ed-459d-a651-522fd9fbb9ab&quot;&gt;flaconi setzt sich als Arbeitgeber für Chancengleichheit ein und begrüßt und ermutigt alle qualifizierten Bewerbern mit unterschiedlichem Hintergrund und Identität, unabhängig von ethnischer Zugehörigkeit, Hautfarbe, Geschlechtsidentität, Migrationshintergrund, nationaler Herkunft, Behinderungsstatus, sexueller Orientierung, Religion oder Alter, sich zu bewerben.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Als unser/e neue/r &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;Friseurmeister:in (all genders)&lt;/strong&gt; schaffst du außergewöhnliche Erlebnisse für unsere Kund:innen und prägst gleichzeitig die kreative und operative Exzellenz unseres Salon-Teams. Du bringst Expertise in den Bereichen Schnitt, Farbe und Styling mit – kombiniert mit der Leidenschaft, andere zu fördern und eine Kultur aus Beauty, Professionalität und Innovation voranzutreiben.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;In dieser Rolle arbeitest du sowohl direkt am Gast als auch im operativen Tagesgeschäft unseres Salons. Dabei behältst du den Fokus auf den Verkauf und das Erreichen kommerzieller Ziele, während du für eine reibungslose Koordination, herausragende Servicequalität und ein motiviertes, leistungsstarkes Team sorgst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Du bietest erstklassige Services wie Beratung, Schnitt, Farbe und Styling nach den Premium-Standards von flaconi an.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;Du bleibst über Trends, Techniken und Produkte auf dem Laufenden, um sowohl Kund:innen als auch Kolleg:innen zu inspirieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;Du schaffst personalisierte Beauty-Erlebnisse, die die Kundenbindung und -zufriedenheit stärken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Durch professionelle Beratung unterstützt du den Zusatzverkauf von Produkten und Dienstleistungen (Upselling).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;Du steuerst die Terminplanung, den Salonbetrieb und das Inventar im Einklang mit den Unternehmenszielen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot;&gt;Du stellst die Einhaltung von Hygiene-, Sicherheits- und Qualitätsstandards sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot;&gt;Du arbeitest mit den Retail- und Marketing-Teams zusammen, um In-Store-Kampagnen und Events umzusetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,7,0&quot;&gt;Du förderst die Teamleistung, bearbeitest Kundenfeedback und stärkst eine positive, inklusive Arbeitskultur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Du bist zertifizierte/r Friseurmeister:in mit mehrjähriger praktischer Erfahrung im Salon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Du bringst nachweisbare Erfahrung in der Teamleitung oder im Salonmanagement mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Du besitzt starke Kommunikations-, Mentoring- und Organisationsfähigkeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Du brennst für Beauty, Trends und eine außergewöhnliche Customer Experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Du sprichst fließend Deutsch und Englisch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;Du hast eine proaktive Hands-on-Mentalität, ein Gespür für Stil und Liebe zum Detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir dir bieten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Unsere Mitarbeiter:innen sind uns wichtig:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir bieten dir einen befristeten Arbeitsvertrag an und übernehmen die Kosten deines Deutschland Tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Work-Life-Balance:&lt;/strong&gt; 29 Urlaubstage plus 2 zusätzliche freie Tage: 24. und 31. Dezember und die Möglichkeit eines bezahlten Sabbaticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;flaconi Academy:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Mit unseren internen und externen Weiterbildungsangeboten kannst du deinen eigenen Karriereweg aktiv gestalten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mitarbeiter:innenrabatte &amp;amp; andere Vergünstigungen:&lt;/strong&gt; Tolle Rabatte in unserem Online-Shop sowie bei Partnerunternehmen, coole Teamevents &amp;amp; Firmenfeiern!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Dein Wohlbefinden liegt uns am Herzen:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir möchten dich auch in schwierigen Zeiten unterstützen. Dazu bieten wir dir und deinen Angehörigen Beratungsgespräche mit psychologischen Fachkräften an.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Gemeinsam an morgen denken:&lt;/strong&gt; flaconi bezuschusst deinen Sparbeitrag zur betrieblichen Altersvorsorge mit zusätzlichen 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;41695&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dfb7af0d-b145-4367-b353-53c2bc6ed6b9&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;41695&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dfb7af0d-b145-4367-b353-53c2bc6ed6b9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über flaconi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;41695&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dfb7af0d-b145-4367-b353-53c2bc6ed6b9&quot;&gt;flaconi ist einer der führenden deutschen Online-Kosmetikhändler mit einem umfangreichen Portfolio von fast 1000 Marken und 50.000 Produkten. Von Drogerie über Bio-Kosmetik bis hin zu Premium und Luxus decken die Online-Shops in Deutschland, Frankreich, Österreich, Polen und der Schweiz alle Produktsegmente ab und bieten eine vielfältige Auswahl an Produkten für eine einzigartige und tägliche Beauty-Routine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;42121&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fe107920-fae8-4147-81da-50cf3d23d08b&quot;&gt;2011 als eine der ersten Online-Parfümerien gegründet, arbeitet flaconi heute mit mehr als 700 Mitarbeitern aus 60 verschiedenen Nationen in der flaconi-Zentrale in Berlin-Charlottenburg und im Fulfillment-Center in Halle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;42345&quot; data-local-id=&quot;18cb85e5-02d6-46dd-b027-bbf098325bf1&quot;&gt;Gestalte mit uns den Erfolg unseres Unternehmens und bewirb dich jetzt online! Wir freuen uns auf deine vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen inklusive deines frühestmöglichen Eintrittstermins.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;42608&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b82773dc-fbeb-4664-9b78-e65218cfe10f&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;flaconi akzeptiert keine unaufgeforderten Lebensläufe aus anderen Quellen (z.B. Personaldienstleister) als direkt von einem Bewerber.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KI-Hinweis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir setzen KI-gestützte Tools ein, um einzelne Schritte unseres Recruiting-Prozesses effizienter zu gestalten und zu unterstützen. Diese Tools helfen unserem Recruiting-Team beispielsweise dabei, passende Kandidaten zu identifizieren, Bewerbungen zu priorisieren oder recruitingrelevante Erkenntnisse zu gewinnen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die KI trifft dabei keine Einstellungsentscheidungen. Jede Bewerbung wird von Menschen geprüft und bewertet, und sämtliche Personalentscheidungen erfolgen unter menschlicher Aufsicht und Verantwortung. Unser KI-System wird regelmäßig auf mögliche Verzerrungen überprüft und verfügt über eine ISO 42001-Zertifizierung für KI-Governance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bei Fragen zum Einsatz der KI oder zur Erläuterung der Kriterien können Sie sich jederzeit an unser Talent Acquisition team (&lt;a ---------- wenden.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Das angebotene Gehalt wird stets innerhalb dieses Rahmens liegen und basiert auf den Ergebnissen des Rekrutierungsprozesses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Gehaltsband (Brutto jährlich)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€37.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€48.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot; style=&quot;font-size: small;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Mozilla?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mozilla Corporation is the non-profit-backed technology company that has shaped the internet for the better over the last 25 years. We make pioneering brands like Firefox, the privacy-minded web browser. Now, with more than 225 million people around the world using our products each month, we’re shaping the next 25 years of technology and helping to reclaim an internet built for people, not companies. Our work focuses on diverse areas including AI, social media, security and more. And we’re doing this while never losing our focus on our core mission – to make the internet better for people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Mozilla Corporation is wholly owned by the non-profit 501(c) Mozilla Foundation. This means we aren’t beholden to any shareholders — only to our mission. Along with thousands of volunteer contributors and collaborators all over the world, Mozillians design, build and distribute &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;open-source&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; software that enables people to enjoy the internet on their terms. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the OS Integration team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The OS Integration team ensures Firefox works well with the host operating system and environment. We’re a distributed team with expertise in Windows, macOS, and Linux-based operating systems. Our responsibilities include developing fixes and improvements for Firefox related to Windows, macOS, and Linux environments. This might include integration with a new OS feature or fixing an OS-specific user interface bug. Other responsibilities include native crash reporting, OS abstraction layers, sandboxing, hardening, updater, and enterprise DLP support.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As a member of the OS Integration team, you’ll develop fixes, improvements, and new features for Firefox. In many cases work may be cross-platform or have a cross-platform component. This role will include maintenance and development of the installer and updater of Firefox. You’ll contribute to the team through code review and discussion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Improve the quality of Firefox and other Mozilla products by debugging and fixing software defects, improving the browsing experience for hundreds of millions of users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contribute to new features and improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Break down tasks and work with others to deliver solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with experienced software engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Perform code reviews and provide technical direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with a geographically-distributed development team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Interact with teams throughout the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;5+ years of overall software engineering experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of C and C++&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with desktop application development on Windows, macOS, or Linux with C++.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of web technologies such as Javascript and HTML.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of secure coding practices and memory safety concerns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving and debugging skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Written and verbal communication skills with a collaborative mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Willingness to work effectively in a distributed team environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Commitment to our values:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Play to win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Build for People first&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Engage Evidence over Ego&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Decide and Deliver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ship, learn and repeat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points for experience with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Installer and/or Updater development on any OS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Windows internals like the BITS server or MSIX packages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Open-source contributions or personal engineering projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous performance-based bonus plans to all eligible employees - we share in our success as one team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Rich medical, dental, and vision coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous retirement contributions with 100% immediate vesting (regardless of whether you contribute)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quarterly all-company wellness days where everyone takes a pause together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Country specific holidays plus a day off for your birthday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;One-time home office stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Annual professional development budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Considerable paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee referral bonus program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Other benefits (life/AD&amp;amp;D, disability, EAP, etc. - varies by country)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mozilla&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla exists to build the Internet as a public resource accessible to all because we believe that open and free is better than closed and controlled. When you work at Mozilla, you give yourself a chance to make a difference in the lives of Web users everywhere. And you give us a chance to make a difference in your life every single day. Join us to work on the Web as the platform and help create more opportunity and innovation for everyone online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla understands that valuing diverse creative practices and forms of knowledge are crucial to and enrich the company’s core mission.&amp;nbsp; We encourage applications from everyone, including members of all equity-seeking communities, such as (but certainly not limited to) women, racialized and Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, persons of all sexual orientation&lt;span style=&quot;color: #003366;&quot;&gt;s, &lt;/span&gt;gender identities, and expressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that qualified individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, as appropriate. Please contact us at &lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; ---------- to request accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race (including hairstyle and texture), religion (including religious grooming and dress practices), gender, gender identity, gender expression, color, national origin, pregnancy, ancestry, domestic partner status, disability, sexual orientation, age, genetic predisposition, medical condition, marital status, citizenship status, military or veteran status, or any other basis covered by applicable laws.&amp;nbsp; Mozilla will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics or any other unlawful behavior, conduct, or purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Group: D&lt;/p&gt;
