&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Munich, Bavaria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: €60,000 base salary + uncapped commission (circa €100,000+ OTE)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About OpenTable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners, 60,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the face of OpenTable in your territory, owning the entire sales cycle from prospecting and relationship building through to negotiation and closing. In this field-based role, you will work across Stuttgart, spending a significant portion of your time meeting restaurant partners in person and the remainder working remotely. You will help restaurants grow revenue and improve operations by introducing technology that supports reservations, front-of-house management, and guest experience. This role requires professional fluency in German and English and a strong ability to build credibility with restaurant operators in a competitive market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t have an office in Germany so you&#39;ll spend much of your week meeting restaurant operators face-to-face across your territory, helping build trusted relationships and close new business.This field-based role combines home working with regular travel across your territory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, engage, and win new restaurant business within an assigned territory to grow OpenTable’s network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver tailored in-person and virtual product demonstrations that clearly connect OpenTable’s solutions to each partner’s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with restaurant operators, share relevant market insights, and help them think differently about opportunities in their business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop territory plans, manage pipeline activity, forecast accurately, and process contracts using Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently meet or exceed monthly and quarterly acquisition and revenue targets while navigating objections and competitive pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share customer feedback with internal teams and represent OpenTable through networking, events, and ongoing engagement with the hospitality community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in consultative business-to-business enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success meeting or exceeding sales targets in a consultative sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery, negotiation, presentation, and time management skills, with the ability to use data to influence decisions and build a business case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Google Workspace and Salesforce, a bachelor’s degree, and the ability to travel regularly within Germany for a field-based role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling software, hospitality technology, payments, or related solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in restaurant management or sales within the food and beverage industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using customer and market insights to improve sales strategy and provide product feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience representing a company through industry networking and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in hospitality and technology, with a collaborative and learning-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note; we have a global recruitment team, so ask that your Resume is submitted in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get at&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.opentable.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenTable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great work happens when people feel trusted, supported &amp;amp; excited about what they do — so we offer benefits designed to support your life, wellbeing &amp;amp; growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Flexibility that actually feels flexible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to &lt;strong&gt;20 days per year&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 vacation days per year&lt;/strong&gt;, 2 days off off your wedding, one for moving &amp;amp; &lt;strong&gt;your birthday off&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual &lt;strong&gt;company-wide recharge week&lt;/strong&gt; where the whole business fully switches off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠 Support for your wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company-paid therapy&lt;/strong&gt; through Spring Health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;Headspace subscription&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;24/7 GP access&lt;/strong&gt;, legal support &amp;amp; more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Income protection &amp;amp; life assurance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Investment in your growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development Dollars&lt;/strong&gt; to support your learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership development opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to &lt;strong&gt;thousands of on-demand courses &amp;amp; learning resources&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨ The extras that make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid volunteer days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive pension contributions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Resource Groups &amp;amp; inclusive communities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application or interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-FF1&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Second Foundation is a global energy trading company with around 500 employees across locations in Prague HQ (CZ), Zug (CH), Berlin (DE), Charlotte (USA), and Tokyo (JP). We specialize in power market trading and in the integration and optimization of renewable energy and battery storage systems. In parallel, we are actively expanding our own asset base, with a primary focus on battery storage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior M&amp;amp;A Business Analyst to join our Berlin office. You will lead analytical work on M&amp;amp;A opportunities in the energy and battery-storage sectors, shape investment decisions, and support deal execution. In this senior role, you will own key analytical workstreams, coordinate cross-functional input, and help ensure high-quality decision-ready outputs. Your work will help expand and strengthen our portfolio across Europe and other key markets.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ac0262f4-8a9e-5820-b908-2d943c5f7113|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;would&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;work on?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Analyse&amp;nbsp;markets, competitors,&amp;nbsp;regulation&amp;nbsp;and technology across the energy and&amp;nbsp;battery-storage&amp;nbsp;sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Source and evaluate M&amp;amp;A opportunities, including BESS deals, and support due diligence through&amp;nbsp;to deal&amp;nbsp;close.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build and review financial models, investment cases, valuation&amp;nbsp;scenarios&amp;nbsp;and cost analyses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Structure analytical approaches and produce clear, decision-ready materials for senior stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own analytical workstreams end-to-end, manage concurrent&amp;nbsp;projects&amp;nbsp;and escalate issues with proposed solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Coordinate input from internal teams and work with external stakeholders, including banks, co-investors and partners where needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Support portfolio&amp;nbsp;optimisation, growth&amp;nbsp;initiatives&amp;nbsp;and post-acquisition integration where relevant.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Guide junior analysts, review their&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;and help&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;quality standards across team deliverables.&lt;/span&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;What makes you a great&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;candidate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Degree in business,&amp;nbsp;finance&amp;nbsp;or a STEM field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience in M&amp;amp;A, investment analysis, corporate finance, consulting, financial&amp;nbsp;modelling&amp;nbsp;or business analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;financial-modelling&amp;nbsp;skills, including DCF, IRR, NPV, scenario&amp;nbsp;analysis&amp;nbsp;and investment cases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Advanced analytical capability and ability to structure complex problems independently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Solid&amp;nbsp;data-handling,&amp;nbsp;analysis&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;visualisation&amp;nbsp;skills; Python or automation experience is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Curious, quick to learn and comfortable applying critical and creative thinking to business problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;we&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary package with the possibility of a yearly bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours and home office options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-end work equipment, with devices available from Apple, Samsung, or Lenovo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BVG Deutschlandticket Job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Edenred meal vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sports Club membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-building activities and company events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allow us to introduce ourselves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello there! We’re Appinio, a global market research company that combines an AI-powered insights platform with expert consultancy. On a mission to make the world a little more fact-based, we help companies understand how consumers think and make smarter decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started out in Hamburg back in 2014, but we’re now humbled to call the world our playground, with over &lt;strong&gt;260 employees&lt;/strong&gt; spread across &lt;strong&gt;13 countries &lt;/strong&gt;(we’re remote-first), 2600+ international clients, delivering research from &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;+190 markets,&lt;/strong&gt; globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to be a part of the Appinio movement? &lt;strong&gt;🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Here at Appinio, we value &lt;strong&gt;transparency&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;in our recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;ve created a blog to share what to expect during each step of our journey together:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;role&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-ad-editable job-ad-editable job-ad-editor&quot; data-content=&quot;6454830&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission as a (Senior) Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;(Senior) Product Designer (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt; to help shape the core experiences of our B2B research platform and B2C panel app. You&#39;ll work alongside a team of product designers, product managers and engineers to identify problems, explore solutions and ship great products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find problems worth solving&lt;/strong&gt;. Proactively identify opportunities through your own exploration and research, user conversations and feedback from research experts and product managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn problems into solutions&lt;/strong&gt;. Take ideas from early concepts and prototypes to polished UIs and shipped features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype in code&lt;/strong&gt;. Build and test ideas directly in the existing product using tools like Cursor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar for craft&lt;/strong&gt;. Sweat the details, from typography, color and spacing to composition and interaction, to make our products feel polished and considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are autonomous and proactive&lt;/strong&gt;. You don’t need every problem fully specified before you can get started. You take initiative and own features end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are craft-driven&lt;/strong&gt;. You have a high bar for quality and know how to make software feel polished down to the smallest details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are experienced in complex software&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ve designed dashboards and platforms with complex workflows and information structures, not just websites. Ideally with experience in data visualization and dashboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are strong in information design&lt;/strong&gt;. You know how to turn complex information into clear, easy-to-understand interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a systems thinker&lt;/strong&gt;. You build reusable patterns rather than isolated screens and have experience working with design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are comfortable with motion&lt;/strong&gt;. You use motion intentionally to communicate state, time and dynamism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a collaborative team player&lt;/strong&gt;. You work closely with product managers and engineers as well as stakeholders across the organization to find the right solutions and bring them to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are curious about new technology&lt;/strong&gt;. You actively experiment with AI tools in your design workflow and look for new ways to work and build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are based in one of the countries where we operate&lt;/strong&gt;: Germany, Spain, the Netherlands, or the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Flexibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; - Average is 30 days taken, however, we do not have a hard cap of number of vacation days as we know life happens&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Temporary work from abroad - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re based in the EU, you can work outside your country of residence for up to 180 days per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;All the hardware you need and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;your own MacBook&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you are located in Hamburg or Berlin, you&#39;ll get a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deutschland ticket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; or access to a mobility budget with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;NAVIT app&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; to get you to and from the office space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised &lt;strong&gt;Urban Sports Club &lt;/strong&gt;or &lt;strong&gt;ClassPass&lt;/strong&gt; membership based on location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;In case&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; you’re located in one of the cities where most of our fellow Appinioneers are (Hamburg, Berlin, Munich, London, Madrid, Barcelona, or New York), you can get access to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Co-working spaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job-ad-editable job-ad-editable job-ad-editor&quot; data-content=&quot;6454846&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;role&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-ad-editable job-ad-editable job-ad-editor&quot; data-content=&quot;6454830&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kind reminder:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please ensure that your application is submitted in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;This post not only outlines our ideal candidate but also serves as an inspiration for what this role can evolve into. Even if you consider yourself an 80% fit but have a genuine passion for this position, we encourage you to apply. We&#39;re eager to hear from individuals who share our enthusiasm.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Appinio is an equal-opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, colour, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran, or disability status.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our privacy policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en-gb/privacy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
